translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_f63fe386:

    # p "My dear friend, how was your day!"
    p "我亲爱的朋友，今天过得怎么样！"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_0000367f:

    # e "Very well, and meeting you now just made my day better."
    e "非常好，而现在见到你，更是让我的一天变得更好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_17cb9b6d:

    # "You notice a curious smile tugging at the corners of his lips."
    "你注意到，他的唇角牵起一抹意味不明的笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_2968ba01:

    # p "Y'know, I played some music up 'ere, looking at the audience and I find that funny little fella looking away from me."
    p "你知道，我在这儿演奏时看着观众，发现那个有趣的小家伙一直把脸转向一边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_1f3852f1:

    # p "A wolf type, muscles sprawling on his body and he has this, outfit that showed his plump flurry chest."
    p "一个狼族，身上肌肉发达，还穿着一身衣服，把他丰满蓬松的胸膛显露了出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_3e9e3b42:

    # "The songsinger gleefully exclaims, cupping against his chest to mimic the wolf's sheer size."
    "歌者兴高采烈地说道，同时在胸前拢起双手，模仿那头狼的硕大身形。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_129c44e3:

    # p "Mayhaps he's the Nocturnal Hunk I've been hearing about."
    p "莫非他就是我一直听说的“夜行猛男”？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_0fce4985:

    # p "Greetings! My dear friend. How does the road treat you?"
    p "你好！我亲爱的朋友。一路上还顺利吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_9ab45b37:

    # "As usual, Pirkka's voice danced with enthusiasm, his words like musical notes that filled the tavern."
    "和往常一样，皮尔卡的声音洋溢着热情，话语如乐符般在酒馆中回荡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_0c1079c3:

    # e "I'm holding up very well, you?"
    e "我过得挺好的，你呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_303f3353:

    # p "The generous keeper told me a lot of stuff about you. You were serving plates down there?"
    p "那位慷慨的店主告诉了我不少关于你的事。你之前是在那边端盘子吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_6f0adcc7:

    # e "It was just my side job."
    e "那只是我的副业。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_5f3532ac:

    # p "And from what I've heard, it was you who brought us the finest ale in the continent?"
    p "而且据我所知，给我们带来大陆上最好的麦酒的人就是你？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_a8b6f119:

    # e "The recipe was from Cane. I just helped him get the materials."
    e "配方是凯恩的。我只是帮他弄到了材料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_65ddc32e:

    # p "The only reason I can enjoy this fine refreshment is because of you. There's no song in the world that expresses my gratitude enough, [e]."
    p "我之所以能享用这美酒，全都多亏了你。世上没有哪首歌能充分表达我的感激之情，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_9cf4e321:

    # "Pirkka raises his cup of ale, and gentle smiles."
    "皮尔卡举起麦酒杯，温和地笑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_581f620c:

    # p "Well met, my friend."
    p "幸会，我的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_cb1ad581:

    # p "Sit down, sit down! It's been quite a day here at the tavern."
    p "坐吧，坐吧！今天这酒馆里可热闹了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_1d548eb9:

    # "Pirkka motions you to sit incredibly close in front of him."
    "皮尔卡示意你在他正前方坐下，离他近得出奇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_ca98b937:

    # e "Hello, Pirkka. Hope you like hanging out in the Tavern."
    e "你好，皮尔卡。希望你喜欢在酒馆里消磨时光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_6f9d120c:

    # p "Pray tell, have your travels brought you adventure and tales to share?"
    p "不妨说说，你的旅途是否带来了冒险与可供分享的故事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_18b1e2bb:

    # p "I'm eager to hear of your triumphs and trials, for every wanderer carries a world within their heart."
    p "我很想听听你的胜利与磨难，因为每个漂泊者心中都藏着一个世界。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_049203e2:

    # e "Your words just warms me up everytime you speak, Pirkka."
    e "每次你开口，你的话语都让我感到温暖，皮尔卡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_00c4aa53:

    # p "Ha, not my words. It was from a famous scribe back in the Old Times."
    p "哈，可不是我的话。这是旧日时代一位著名抄写员写的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_5c7ab059:

    # e "Fascinating."
    e "真有意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_edfd2fd0:

    # p "{i}Kins turned foes when his name is spoken, for years he deemed the last heir of the lion...{/i}"
    p "{i}提及他的名字，亲族便化作仇敌；多年来，他认定狮子的最后血裔……{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_d674cd3e:

    # p "{i}From none but his stronger brother, 'twas a claim sturdier than blood and tether.{/i}"
    p "{i}这份宣告唯独出自他那更强大的兄长，比血缘与羁绊更加牢不可破。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_fb87368f:

    # "The bard's voice was like a whisper, yet it echoed through the entire tavern."
    "吟游诗人的声音宛如低语，却在整间酒馆回荡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_02bb0cfc:

    # "He slowly opens his eyes, and his gaze meets yours."
    "他缓缓睁开双眼，目光与你相遇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_d75c0bd9:

    # p "Ah, [e]. I didn't see you there. I was just singing about the story I've heard from the East."
    p "啊，[e]。我没注意到你在那儿。我刚才只是在唱一段从东方听来的故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_dfe91eba:

    # e "It's a beautiful song, Pirkka. What's it about?"
    e "这首歌真美，皮尔卡。它讲的是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_70955557:

    # p "Oh... did you not know? It's about some rumors of the royal bastard in the palace."
    p "哦……你不知道吗？是关于宫里那位王室私生子的传闻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_e57839fb:

    # p "Granted, I don't usually sing over the grapevines, but it's a tale that's been known to everyone in the town I travelled from."
    p "我平时确实不太会对着葡萄藤唱歌，不过这是个我离开的城镇里人人都知道的故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_19fae5c5:

    # e "I see."
    e "原来如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Tavern_Talk_285e2e4e:

    # p "Hey, [e]. May I borrow you a few minutes to go somewhere with me?"
    p "嘿，[e]。能占用你几分钟，陪我去个地方吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Normal_Talk_2419a281:

    # p "How may I help you?" nointeract
    p "我能为你做些什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Normal_Talk_16954359:

    # e "That's all."
    e "就这些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Normal_Talk_3bc5fa9c:

    # p "Until next time, my friend."
    p "下次见，我的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Normal_Talk_b5d6e3bd:

    # "Pirkka strums another pleasant chord as you walk away."
    "你走远时，皮尔卡又拨响了一个悦耳的和弦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_153c4dac:

    # e "How's it going in the Tavern?"
    e "酒馆里最近怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_5cc56cb0:

    # p "Ah, the Nocturnal Trunk, a place that sets my spirit ablaze!"
    p "啊，夜夜椿，那可是点燃我灵魂的地方！"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_3b438ad1:

    # p "This joint has got a lively vibe, I tell ye."
    p "我跟你说，这地方可热闹着呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_49a87f5f:

    # "Pirkka grins and leans back, his fingers tapping a playful rhythm on the table."
    "皮尔卡咧嘴一笑，向后一靠，手指在桌上敲出欢快的节奏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_086f5079:

    # p "The air here is thick with stories, as potent as the aroma of ale and roasted meat."
    p "这里的空气中弥漫着各种故事，就像麦酒和烤肉的香气一样浓郁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_6b74a3cb:

    # p "And then there's Cane, the keeper of the tavern."
    p "还有酒馆老板凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_e913abef:

    # p "He could juggle mugs with such finesse, it seemed the very stars danced in his hands."
    p "他能如此娴熟地抛接酒杯，简直像是连星辰都在他手中起舞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_1108cc6d:

    # p "There is a flair of mystery I can feel within his heart. Especially when we were talking about you."
    p "我能感受到他心底那股神秘气息。尤其是我们谈到你的时候。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_3cecdbc3:

    # e "Maybe because I sometimes work in the Tavern."
    e "也许是因为我偶尔会在酒馆帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_10609109:

    # p "Not merely this reason, I'm afraid. I've heard something much more endearing, but it shall be strictly between you two."
    p "恐怕不只是这个原因。我还听说过一些更加动人的事，不过这事只能由你们两个知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_c8da89ea:

    # "You ponder over his words, but the tiger quickly continues before you can even understand the implication."
    "你思索着他的话，可还没来得及理解其中的意味，那只老虎便赶紧继续说了下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_2d4171e1:

    # p "Regardless, this place's truly a haven of merry spirits and lively tales. Seems like people are very enthusiastic about my music."
    p "不管怎么说，这地方确实是欢声笑语与趣闻轶事的乐土。看来大家都很喜欢我的音乐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_bc4778c7:

    # p "Indeed, me friend. The sound of mirth and jest echoed through the halls, as if the very walls themselves joined in the revelry."
    p "确实如此，我的朋友。欢笑和戏谑的声音在大厅里回荡，仿佛连墙壁本身也加入了这场狂欢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_5ffed59f:

    # p "I've sung many a song in that tavern, and I can tell ye, the spirits of joy and camaraderie were alive and well."
    p "我在那家酒馆唱过许多歌，我可以告诉你，那里的欢乐与情谊始终洋溢不散。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_cad5451b:

    # "Pirkka leans in closer against your face, his voice lowered."
    "皮尔卡俯身凑近你的脸，压低了声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_c64dc325:

    # p "Anyway, be careful with the card slingers just at the corners, they're friendly bunch, as long as you've got your gold."
    p "总之，小心那些躲在街角玩牌的家伙。他们只要看到你有金币，就会显得很友善。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_2e37fe34:

    # e "Have you had any encounters with them?"
    e "你和他们打过交道吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_449bcca2:

    # p "Oh indeed. One evening, they invited me to a friendly game of cards."
    p "当然有。某天晚上，他们邀请我玩了一局友谊牌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_adb139bc:

    # p "I considered it hard to play opposite to the alligator with those teeth, I could've lost a hand, and the hand."
    p "要和那条长着满口利齿的鳄鱼对着玩牌可不容易，我本来可能会输掉一手牌，连手都得赔进去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_bfbe4bf4:

    # p "Might be hard to deal with."
    p "对付起来恐怕不容易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_2c4f40df:

    # "He chuckles, a mischievous glint in his eyes."
    "他嘿嘿一笑，眼中闪过一丝淘气的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_378b8af8:

    # p "We had quite the match, and in the end, I left them dumbfounded and a few coins richer."
    p "我们那场牌局打得相当精彩，最后我让他们目瞪口呆，还赢得了几枚硬币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_a991c435:

    # p "Keep yer peepers peeled, or they might just snatch more than your purse."
    p "睁大你的眼睛，可别让他们顺走的东西不止你的钱包。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_e3d54470:

    # e "Thanks for the heads up, Pirkka. I'll be sure to stay on guard if I decide to test my luck."
    e "谢谢你的提醒，皮尔卡。要是我决定试试运气，我一定会保持警惕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_Tavern_835fc55e:

    # p "Hope I've gotten yer heads up too."
    p "希望我也给你提了个醒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_bb245525:

    # e "So, how did you become a bard?"
    e "那么，你是怎么成为吟游诗人的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_6685b599:

    # "Pirkka leaned back against the table, his eyes reflecting the flickering flames of the tavern hearth."
    "皮尔卡倚着桌子向后靠去，双眼映照着酒馆炉膛里摇曳的火焰。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_5f629f8a:

    # p "Let me sing you my story, [e]."
    p "让我把我的故事唱给你听，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_7fb9037e:

    # "With a wistful smile, he began his tale, his accent lending a distinct charm to his words."
    "他带着一抹惆怅的笑意讲起自己的故事，口音让他的话语别有一番魅力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_c4a13ae1:

    # p "Well, ye see, it all began in a humble village nestled amidst verdant hills and singing streams."
    p "嗯，你且听我说，这一切都始于一座朴素的小村庄，它坐落在葱郁的山丘与潺潺歌唱的溪流之间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_e4d09976:

    # p "'Twas a place where stories echoed in every corner and melodies danced upon the wind."
    p "那是个故事在每个角落回荡、旋律随风起舞的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_f424ddaa:

    # p "From a tender age, I found meself captivated by the ancient ballads and tales spun by the village elders, their words like magic spells enchantin' the air."
    p "从年幼时起，我便被那些古老的歌谣，以及村中长者编织的故事深深吸引；他们的话语仿佛魔法咒语，令空气都着了魔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_2b4a5013:

    # "Pirkka's voice hung in the air, like the lingering notes of a haunting melody."
    "皮尔卡的声音悬在空气中，仿佛一支摄人心魄的旋律留下的余音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_a30d254e:

    # p "One fateful eve, as the moon ca'est its silver glow upon the village square, a wanderin' minstrel arrived."
    p "在那注定改变命运的夜晚，月光将银辉洒在村庄广场上，一名四处漂泊的吟游诗人来到了这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_c127329f:

    # p "With his weathered lute and a voice that could charm even the stones, he regaled us with sagas of heroes and monsters, of love and loss."
    p "他带着一把饱经风霜的鲁特琴，嗓音甚至能迷住石头；他为我们讲述英雄与怪物、爱与失落的传奇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_409de229:

    # p "That night, as the melodies wove their way int'me soul, I knew me fate was sealed."
    p "那晚，旋律缓缓织入我的灵魂，我知道自己的命运已然注定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_5d370ef9:

    # p "I took to the road, me heart aflame with a hunger for music and stories."
    p "我踏上旅途，心中燃烧着对音乐与故事的渴望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_0650bd32:

    # p "From bustling taverns t' outer wilds, I wandered far and wide, learnin' from every bard, minstrel, and troubadour I met along the way."
    p "我从热闹的酒馆一路走到荒野深处，四处漂泊，向沿途遇到的每一位吟游诗人、游吟歌者和行吟诗人学习。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_69ec3579:

    # p "They tau-yt me the secryts of the lyre, t'ze power of a well-placed jest, and the ancient lore hidden in forgotten scrolls."
    p "他们教会我鲁特琴的秘密、恰到好处的笑话所蕴含的力量，以及隐藏在被遗忘卷轴中的古老知识。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_3a33211a:

    # p "And so, me friend, that's how this wanderin' soul found his place as a bard, a teller of tales and a weaver of dreams."
    p "所以啊，我的朋友，我这个漂泊的灵魂就是这样找到了自己的归宿，成了一名讲故事、织梦的吟游诗人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_6230fad1:

    # p "With each strum of me lute and every lyric that dances from me lips, I carry the echoes of those who came before, keepin' the ancient arts alive in a world thirstin' for magic and wonder."
    p "每拨弄一下我的鲁特琴，每唱出一句从唇间跃出的歌词，我都在承载前人的回响，让古老的技艺在这个渴望魔法与奇迹的世界里延续下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_dfec7db9:

    # "The tavern patrons, including you, are all enchanted by his story, listened in awe, your hearts touched by the passion that emanated from the whimsical bard."
    "酒馆里的客人，包括你在内，全都被他的故事迷住了，听得惊叹不已，心也被这位异想天开的吟游诗人所散发的热情触动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_216df6a5:

    # "You clapped your hands slowly, as Pirkka stares at you with an alluring smile."
    "你缓缓鼓掌，皮尔卡带着迷人的微笑凝视着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_07081db2:

    # e "That was quite beautiful, Pirkka."
    e "那真是美妙极了，皮尔卡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Ask_As_Bard_ee8d4a8a:

    # p "Thank you, my friend. 'Twas but a tuneful words imbued with the story of my own."
    p "谢谢你，我的朋友。那不过是几句悦耳的诗句，融入了我自己的故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_d1fb6846:

    # "Walking through the plains, you notice a lone figure sitting on a nearby rock, strumming a lute."
    "走过平原时，你注意到附近一块岩石上坐着一个孤独的身影，正拨弄着鲁特琴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_a954b571:

    # my "{i}-land of bloom, roaming with a heart of tune.{/i}"
    my "{i}-繁花之地，漫游其间，心随曲调。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_1db6dcfa:

    # my "{i}Words of legends and olden tale, dark ink of valor and fair rune.{/i}"
    my "{i}传说与古老故事的词句，勇武的墨痕与美丽的符文。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_545ee0cd:

    # my "{i}Percolating upon scripts of paper, newly trimmed, browned by the tides in days of yore.{/i}"
    my "{i}渗入新裁纸页上的篇章，在往昔岁月的潮汐中染成褐色。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_7f4b036a:

    # my "{i}And lost.{/i}"
    my "{i}又失去了。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_acd97be3:

    # my "{i}Oh, my champion, how should I atone for my shameful prune.{/i}"
    my "{i}噢，我的勇士，我该如何为这可耻的修剪赎罪？{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_060f37dc:

    # "The stranger fingers his lute with ease, singing with his amazingly soothing voice."
    "陌生人轻松地拨弄着鲁特琴，唱着异常舒缓的歌声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_67435e84:

    # my "{i}What's the future of Mokken without your lore, Kantele.{/i}"
    my "{i}没有你的学识，莫肯的未来会怎样，坎特莱？{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_173cf370:

    # "As you approach, the figure stops his singing. He looks up and grins at you, revealing a charming smile."
    "你走近时，那人停止歌唱。他抬头朝你咧嘴一笑，露出迷人的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_566970b2:

    # my "Well met, traveller! Didn't expect audience in zis vast land."
    my "幸会，旅行者！没想到在这片广袤的土地上还能遇到听众。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_b74aa0ab:

    # my "What brings you to these parts?"
    my "是什么风把你吹到了这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_f4b450e4:

    # "He exclaims in a sing-song voice, with a hint of a medieval accent."
    "他用唱歌般的语调说道，声音中带着一丝中世纪口音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_96fde489:

    # e "I'm just passing through. Looking to explore the land a bit."
    e "我只是路过，想在这片土地上四处探索一番。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_5eb731ba:

    # my "Ah, an adventurer! How exciting! Pirkka's the name, I'm just a 'umble bard, wand'rin' from town to town to spread the joy of music."
    my "啊，冒险者！真令人兴奋！我叫皮尔卡，不过是个卑微的吟游诗人，走村串镇，只为传播音乐的喜悦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_e0cd55c7:

    # "The bard smiles, strumming a few chords on his lute."
    "吟游诗人微笑着，在鲁特琴上弹奏了几个和弦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_ebe78af1:

    # e "My name is [e]. It was nice to meet you, Pirkka."
    e "我叫[e]。很高兴认识你，皮尔卡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_4af83b03:

    # e "I couldn't help but hear your song from afar. It was quite lovely."
    e "我在远处就忍不住听到了你的歌。唱得真是动听。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_dfd93719:

    # p "Ah, thank you kindly, it's not often I get to perform for such a fine audience."
    p "啊，多谢你的美意！能为如此出色的听众演奏，可不是什么常有的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_28a5f4de:

    # "Pirkka replies, giving a small bow. And your cheeks blush of bright red."
    "皮尔卡回答着，微微鞠了一躬。你的双颊涨得通红。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_5305f7a0:

    # e "Uhm- What's the song you've been singing about?"
    e "呃——你唱的这首歌是关于什么的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_ac0a7d00:

    # p "Ah, that's only improvisation, as ye say, about a long-winding, echoes of tales of yore."
    p "啊，不过是即兴编的，正如你所说，唱的是绵延曲折、回荡着古老传说的调子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_445085e8:

    # "He looks up at you, his eyes twinkling mischievously."
    "他抬头看向你，眼中闪烁着淘气的光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_1d53e339:

    # p "Well, 'nough about me, what brings you on zis journey?"
    p "好了，别说我了，是什么带你踏上这趟旅程？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_d752fcdf:

    # "You notice he'd tone down his accent to match yours subtly."
    "你注意到，他不动声色地收敛了口音，渐渐与你的口音一致。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_61e0b30b:

    # e "I'm not sure, just walking around and discovering new adventures."
    e "我也说不准，就是四处走走，寻找新的冒险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_df726144:

    # "Pirkka pauses for a moment, seemingly pondering something."
    "皮尔卡停顿片刻，似乎在思索着什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_f2ee8b56:

    # p "So, you too are a wand'rer, aye? 'onestly, I find it quite {b}roam-{/b}antic."
    p "所以，你也是个漫游者，对吧？说实话，我觉得这相当{b}漫游{/b}浪漫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_aab8adf8:

    # "Before you can react, Pirkka has already burst into laughter at his own joke."
    "还没等你反应过来，皮尔卡已经为自己的笑话放声大笑起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_e19df7a4:

    # "You can't help but chuckle along with him, despite the corniness of the pun."
    "你也忍不住跟着他笑起来，尽管这个双关实在老套。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_8b47702d:

    # e "Does that mean you wanders around as well?"
    e "这是不是说，你也四处游历？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_c042a50e:

    # p "Of course, I'm a bard. I tell stories with my sweet and kindred voice, everywhere I goes."
    p "当然了，我可是吟游诗人。我用甜美而亲切的声音，到处讲述故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_eec097a4:

    # p "Say, you seem like a sprightly one. Zere's one reason I roam around this beautiful valley, not just for ze sight."
    p "你看起来挺精神的嘛。这片美丽山谷可不只是景色迷人，这正是我四处游荡的原因之一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_afff1775:

    # "The bard leans in closer to you, his eyes lighting up with excitement."
    "吟游诗人向你凑近了些，眼中闪烁着兴奋的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_33b5810b:

    # e "What's the task?"
    e "任务是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_ebb139d9:

    # p "It's simple, really."
    p "其实很简单。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_b6219afb:

    # "Pirkka says, twirling his lute absentmindedly."
    "皮尔卡说着，心不在焉地转动着鲁特琴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_ff70d3b2:

    # p "A group of bandits made off with a precious scroll of mine, and I'm in dire need of its contents."
    p "一伙强盗抢走了我的一卷珍贵卷轴，而我急需其中的内容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_2e0dc6b0:

    # p "A ballad, written by ze ancient poet Kantele, who's also my ancestor. It's the original text zat 'olds true to my heart of passion."
    p "坎特莱"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_4fd65787:

    # e "And how can I help with that?"
    e "那我能帮上什么忙？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_e297d51c:

    # p "I need you, to sneak into their camp and retrieve ze scroll for me."
    p "我需要你潜入他们的营地，替我取回卷轴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_2a903f5e:

    # p "So, 'ow you say? I smell a certain grit and bravery in ze air." nointeract
    p "那么，你意下如何？我能从空气中嗅到一丝坚毅与勇气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_9579c28c:

    # "You hesitate for a moment, but the gleam in Pirkka's eyes is infectious."
    "你犹豫了片刻，但皮尔卡眼中的光彩极具感染力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_63f60736:

    # e "Alright, I'm in."
    e "好吧，我加入。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_53976138:

    # "You shake your head."
    "你摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_a49d5b69:

    # "Pirkka looks disappointed, but he quickly puts on a smile."
    "皮尔卡看起来很失望，但很快又挤出笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_0b460b91:

    # p "Ah, zat's not good. me friend. But I'll find a way to retrieve it on my own."
    p "啊，这可不太妙，我的朋友。不过我会想办法自己把它取回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_65dbde5c:

    # e "I'm sorry, Pirkka. It's too dangerous of a task."
    e "对不起，皮尔卡。这个任务太危险了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_2e78527c:

    # p "Understood, understood."
    p "明白，明白。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_c7b1f7a5:

    # "The bard says with a wave of his hand."
    "吟游诗人挥了挥手说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_21cb6016:

    # p "May your journey be filled with wondrous adventures and grand tales to tell, [e]."
    p "愿你的旅途充满奇妙的冒险，也满载值得讲述的宏大故事，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_7ca63ebc:

    # e "And... you too!"
    e "还有……你也是！"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_1dc6376a:

    # "With a bow, Pirkka bids farewell to you and set off onto a different path."
    "皮尔卡向你鞠躬道别，踏上了另一条路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_c282fc8d:

    # "As you walk away, you can still hear Pirkka humming a familiar tune, the one he sang earlier."
    "你走远时，仍能听见皮尔卡哼着一支熟悉的曲调——就是他之前唱过的那首。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_229f1f9f:

    # "Despite their separate paths, you couldn't help but feel a connection to Pirkka and his quest."
    "尽管你们走上了不同的道路，你还是不由得对皮尔卡和他的追寻产生了共鸣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_6716f01b:

    # "It may have been the last you two will ever see each other."
    "这或许就是你们两人此生最后一次见面了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_94ba02af:

    # "Or perhaps, you would meet again someday, and Pirkka would regale you with more of his whimsical tales."
    "又或者，某天你们还会重逢，而皮尔卡会再用更多奇趣的故事为你娓娓道来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_4e4d1e73:

    # "Though you never want to mess with the bandits, looking at the pleading eyes of Pirkka, you can't help but to make his smile brighter."
    "虽然你从不想招惹那些强盗，但看着皮尔卡哀求的双眼，你还是忍不住让他的笑容更加灿烂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_849bda75:

    # e "I've sneaked into the bandit's place earlier, actually."
    e "其实我之前偷偷潜入过强盗的地盘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_e9d6a5fd:

    # p "Oh, you already did? That's perfectly splendid!"
    p "哦，你已经潜入过了？那可真是太棒了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_4c62e457:

    # p "Did you find the scroll?"
    p "你找到那卷轴了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_4a16823f:

    # e "Sadly, no. But I found some clues as to where it went."
    e "很遗憾，没有。不过我找到了一些关于它去向的线索。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_a526b1eb:

    # e "They sold it to someone else in the village, I suppose it's Lusterfield?"
    e "他们把它卖给了村里的另一个人，我想那个村子就是卢斯特菲尔德吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_db9a7126:

    # "Perhaps you can take advantage of the bandit boss recognising you as one of them."
    "或许你可以利用强盗头目把你认作自己人这一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_696d577e:

    # e "I can get into their camp quite easily, actually."
    e "其实我很容易就能潜入他们的营地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_c27bd045:

    # p "Are you saying what I think you're saying?"
    p "你是说我想的那个意思吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_6d8fc4d8:

    # "You nod slowly."
    "你缓缓点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_c53ebf5f:

    # p "Say, you're a t-zief in disguise, aren't you, lad."
    p "话说，你是个乔装打扮的盗贼，对吧，小子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_3084bb50:

    # e "I just happen to stumble upon their boss at the right time. I'm not a fan of stealing someone else's property."
    e "我只是碰巧在恰当的时候撞见了他们的头目。我可不喜欢偷别人的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_6a57a463:

    # p "Eh? So am I gonna be grateful ye aren't stealing the rest of my {b}lute{/b}?"
    p "啥？那我是不是还得感谢你没把我剩下的那把{b}鲁特琴{/b}也偷走？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_4ac4a938:

    # "His pun flew through your head for a moment, until Pirkka waves his instrument, and you both chuckles loudly over that stupid pun."
    "他的双关让你一时没反应过来，直到皮尔卡挥了挥手里的乐器，你们俩才都为这个蠢双关大笑起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_1cc4b9f4:

    # "You've looked into the camp when there were no one but the bandit boss, perhaps you can get into there quite easily again."
    "你曾在营地里只有强盗头目一人时进去探查过，或许还能再次轻松潜入那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_6a5e5b64:

    # e "I know where they're hiding. I've been to their place a while ago."
    e "我知道他们藏在哪里。我前段时间去过他们的地盘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_e0a4d487:

    # e "H-heh... The boss was all alone when I beat him to submission."
    e "呃、呃呵……我把那头目打到屈服时，他身边就他一个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_87733724:

    # "Pirkka's eyes widened in surprise."
    "皮尔卡惊讶得睁大了双眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_ef95c23c:

    # p "By the deities, you have? That's impressive, you're a brave one indeed."
    p "众神在上，你真的做到了？真了不起，你确实是个勇敢的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_874b0db5:

    # p "If you be willing to help me retrieve the lost prose? I'll make it worth your while, and it would mean the world to me."
    p "如果你愿意帮我找回遗失的文稿，我一定不会让你白忙活，这对我来说意义非凡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_036a7c90:

    # "The bard stares at you with admiration, and he holds his hand onto yours expectantly."
    "吟游诗人满怀敬意地注视着你，满怀期待地把手搭在你的手上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_2ccc9000:

    # "Pirkka's enthusiastic smile has definitely worked on you. And almost immediately, you nod your head."
    "皮尔卡热情的笑容显然打动了你。你几乎立刻就点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_39a024c2:

    # e "And I... I can only say the bandit boss's not one to be underestimated."
    e "而我……我只能说，那个强盗头目可不能小看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_35d7d677:

    # "Pirkka chuckles at your words."
    "皮尔卡听了你的话，轻笑起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_6eda07dc:

    # p "Aye, at the least you're not taken captive and has all your {b}lute{/b} stolen."
    p "没错，至少你没有被俘，整把{b}鲁特琴{/b}也没有被偷走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_83e293d7:

    # "His pun flew through your head for a moment, until Pirkka waves his instrument, and you both chuckles a little."
    "他的双关笑话在你脑中掠过片刻，直到皮尔卡晃了晃手中的鲁特琴，你们都轻笑起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_1397020f:

    # p "Fear not, my friend, for with your help, we shall retrieve the lost prose and teach those bandits a lesson they won't soon forget!"
    p "别担心，我的朋友，有你的帮助，我们一定能找回失落的文稿，也会给那些强盗一个让他们久久难忘的教训！"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_88ffec22:

    # "You can't help but smile at his enthusiasm."
    "你也不禁被他的热情逗得微微一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_107051b4:

    # "The rat thief you've met wasn't quite the stud you were expecting, but surely given that you've tracked him down successfully. It'd be the same for a whole band of bandit."
    "你遇到的那个鼠人窃贼并没有你预想中那么厉害，不过既然你已经成功追踪到了他，想来对付整伙强盗也会一样顺利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_55516f02:

    # e "One of them stole from our farm recently. But I don't know where they're hiding in."
    e "他们最近有一个人从我们的农场偷了东西。但我不知道他们藏在哪里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_08a926aa:

    # "Pirkka grins."
    "皮尔卡咧嘴一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_679d885e:

    # p "Ah, that's the beauty of it. I already have the location of their camp, thanks to a little birdie."
    p "啊，这正是其中的妙处。多亏一只小鸟告诉了我，我已经知道他们营地的位置了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_8f6b60d0:

    # p "All you have to do is find the scroll and bring it back to me."
    p "你只需要找到那卷卷轴，再把它带回来给我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_First_Meet_5898120d:

    # e "Sounds easy enough."
    e "听起来倒也不难。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Begin_67167d57:

    # e "What exactly happened between you and the bandits?"
    e "你和那些强盗之间究竟发生了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Begin_13cdb314:

    # p "The thieving rascals took my prose, in the middle of the road, they came in groups, and alas, I wasn't able to stop them."
    p "那些该死的小偷在路中央成群结队地出现，抢走了我的文稿。唉，我没能阻止他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Begin_bfbd61c7:

    # e "W-why would they take some pieces of paper?"
    e "可、可他们为什么要拿走几张纸？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Begin_a390057c:

    # p "Well, they were invaluable to those who understands ancient tales, I guess they knows."
    p "嗯，对那些了解古老传说的人来说，那些东西可是无价之宝。我想，他们自己也知道这一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Begin_8aa0d993:

    # p "It was a delicate parchment, bound with a faded red ribbon with ancient markings."
    p "那是一张精美的羊皮纸，用一条褪色的红丝带捆着，上面还绘有古老的标记。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Begin_0df3c0f1:

    # "Pirkka shrugs, but his smile doesn't fade."
    "皮尔卡耸了耸肩，但脸上的笑容并未消退。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Begin_fae08e0c:

    # e "I will get it back for you."
    e "我会帮你把它拿回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Begin_171cc573:

    # p "Aye, I trust in you, adventurer. May Gods ever be in your favour."
    p "没错，我相信你，冒险者。愿诸神永远眷顾你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Begin_35711f94:

    # p "And it's time for me to start moving, [e]. I can feel inspiration coming in waves after waves."
    p "我也该动身了，[e]。我能感觉到灵感正如潮水般一阵接一阵地涌来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Begin_ede338a7:

    # p "Perhaps my new ballad will be for a bard ever be in patronage for a brave soul."
    p "或许我的新歌谣会献给一位永远守护勇敢灵魂的吟游诗人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Begin_d1ccd914:

    # p "May we meet once more."
    p "愿我们还能再次相见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Begin_b516a0f8:

    # e "See you, Pirkka."
    e "回头见，皮尔卡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Begin_615a1960:

    # "Pirkka walks away, he positions his hand on the lute, and begins singing."
    "皮尔卡转身离去，将手放到鲁特琴上，开始吟唱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Begin_bba639b9:

    # p "{i}-Oh, fair listener, lend me your ears.{/i}"
    p "{i}-哦，善良的听众，请借我你的双耳。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Begin_a8dc2fe7:

    # p "{i}And I'll sing a tale of a hero who appears.{/i}"
    p "{i}我要为你吟唱一位英雄现身的故事。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Begin_c85ec1c1:

    # p "{i}To vanquish the bandits who caused such fea-{/i}"
    p "{i}去击溃那些带来如此恐-{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Begin_2f32723b:

    # "You glance at the back of the wandering bard, he's walking further and further away, along with a simple tune that eventually fades."
    "你望着那名吟游诗人的背影，他越走越远，伴随着一段简单的曲调，最终也渐渐消散。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_3c9025d0:

    # p "But we have a lead, at least. Let's think... who in this land has a particular fondness for ancient tales?"
    p "不过，至少我们有线索了。让我想想……这片土地上，谁特别喜欢古老的故事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_1282ce25:

    # "You two pause for a long while, as Pirkka's face falls lower."
    "你们两人沉默了好一会儿，皮尔卡的脸色也越来越沮丧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_7447bbf3:

    # p "Alas, I don't know anyone in Lusterfield."
    p "唉，我在卢斯特菲尔德谁也不认识。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_9b1bbec7:

    # e "I don't think I know one either."
    e "我想我也不认识这样的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_1cdda191:

    # p "Oh, that's a darn shame. We had our hopes up, didn't we?"
    p "唉，真是太可惜了。我们之前还满怀希望来着，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_348c8e51:

    # e "I'm sorry, Pirkka. I've tried my best to find the script."
    e "对不起，皮尔卡。我已经尽力去找那份文稿了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_178c4adb:

    # p "Don't fret about it, friend. I'm grateful for your help nonetheless."
    p "别为这事烦恼，朋友。无论如何，我都很感激你的帮助。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_0efcab95:

    # p "Maybe it'll pop up again, somewhere. Here's the 150 gold, for your trouble."
    p "也许它还会在某个地方再次出现。给，这是你辛苦跑这一趟的150枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_ea24c63d:

    # "The bard strums a few chords as he hands you the gold."
    "吟游诗人把金币递给你时，拨了几下琴弦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_9eca2693:

    # "You ponder over your words for a moment."
    "你思索了片刻自己说过的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_86342969:

    # e "Do you want to go back to Lusterfield with me? I suppose we can find the buyer over there."
    e "你想和我一起回卢斯特菲尔德吗？我想我们可以去那里找买家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_05965628:

    # e "Plus, staying here can be dangerous, those bandits might come again."
    e "再说，留在这里可能会有危险，那些强盗也许还会回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_4b3e6400:

    # p "I wander over the plains, it's what bestows me, call it inspiration for new songs."
    p "我在平原上四处游荡，这让我有所收获——你可以把它称作创作新歌的灵感。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_5450b9e4:

    # e "Do you want to stay over at our village for the nights?"
    e "你想在我们村子里住上几晚吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_4288804b:

    # "Pirkka taps on his lute for a few times."
    "皮尔卡轻轻敲了几下他的鲁特琴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_2b91ac4d:

    # p "Is there a Tavern?"
    p "有酒馆吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_d0106044:

    # e "Yes, Nocturnal Trunk. I bet the keeper is going to like you, a lot."
    e "有，夜夜椿酒馆。我敢说，老板一定会非常喜欢你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_2e48468d:

    # p "I should rent a room in the Tavern, like you said, it's dangerous to stay in the wild at night."
    p "就像你说的，我应该在酒馆租个房间，晚上待在荒野里太危险了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_665702c0:

    # p "And I should find the prose with you, my friend."
    p "而且，我也该和你一起找回那份文稿，我的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_9d337e58:

    # "Another huge grin is plastered over his face as he hurries to put out the campfire."
    "他脸上又挂起灿烂的笑容，赶忙去熄灭篝火。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_ae6e7d4c:

    # p "Making sure I'm not burning down the whole place."
    p "得确保我不会把整个地方都烧掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_57f5688b:

    # "He gets up soon, making sure he didn't drop anything at all."
    "他很快起身，确认自己什么东西都没落下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_2dc0e9d1:

    # p "C'mon then. Lead the way!"
    p "那还等什么？带路吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_40588402:

    # "You two begin to walk towards the direction of Lusterfield."
    "你们两人开始朝卢斯特菲尔德的方向走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_9e9761fa:

    # e "So, how did you hear about the village?"
    e "那么，你是怎么听说这个村子的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_6d6961da:

    # p "I've traveled from taverns to taverns, everywhere in Mokken. Theirs are one of the fews I've yet to visit."
    p "我走遍了莫肯各地的酒馆，一家家跑过去。这里的酒馆是少数几个我还没来过的地方之一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_aa90cc39:

    # e "If you've visited everywhere, then you must be very famous, no?"
    e "如果你走遍了所有地方，那一定很有名吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_4f9a94fa:

    # p "Famous is a word up for debate, but I aspire to be a legendary bard one day, like Kantele."
    p "坎特莱"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_fde23d67:

    # e "Was he the poet who wrote the prose we're looking for?"
    e "他就是写下我们要找的那份文稿的诗人吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_68f0566b:

    # "Pirkka nods."
    "皮尔卡点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_105897fd:

    # p "Say, the one that bought the prose from bandits, maybe they took an interest in Kantele's work."
    p "坎特莱"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_cd6dec2b:

    # e "And the buyer couldn't be anywhere too far, he's a regular to the bandits."
    e "买家不可能离这里太远，他可是强盗们的常客。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_63d89fb0:

    # p "Ah, fair. T'is but a mere challenge for a young adventurer and a bard, we'll find him, soon 'nough."
    p "啊，说得在理。这不过是年轻冒险家和吟游诗人的小小挑战，我们很快就能找到他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_d38c02c4:

    # "Along the way, Pirkka shares with you another sweet tunes, this time without the singing."
    "一路上，皮尔卡又为你演奏了一首悦耳的曲子，这次没有歌唱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_79dc07ac:

    # "He's much more lively, strolling the path with fleet footworks."
    "他活泼多了，迈着轻快的步子漫步在路上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_81b9ab6c:

    # "It's a long of fun talking with the tiger, his soft-spoken voice is just calming to your ears."
    "和这只老虎聊天真是乐趣无穷，他轻声细语的嗓音听起来十分舒缓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_223a619f:

    # "And after crossing the farm, you've arrived to Lusterfield."
    "穿过农田后，你们抵达了卢斯特菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_8f962c01:

    # p "Ah, 'tis a fine village ye've brought us to, lad."
    p "啊，你带我们来到的这个村子真不错，小伙子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_3d358946:

    # p "I can smell the ale already. Let's go find ourselves the mysterious Nocturnal Trunk."
    p "我已经闻到麦酒的香味了。咱们去找那个神秘的夜夜椿吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_6da162aa:

    # "As you entered the tavern, Pirkka looked around and noticed a few locals staring at him curiously."
    "你们走进酒馆时，皮尔卡环顾四周，注意到几名当地人正好奇地盯着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_052f374c:

    # p "By my troth, this is a lively place."
    p "依我看，这地方可真热闹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_cf249601:

    # p "Good evening, good folks!"
    p "诸位晚上好！"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_707107f2:

    # "Pirkka exclaims, and immediately walks towards the counter, with Cane working on cleaning the silverwares."
    "皮尔卡高声说道，随即朝柜台走去；凯恩正在那里擦洗银器。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_47888f26:

    # c "Welcome to the Nocturnal Trunk! Ye' a bard? Haven't been fancied by a singing one for a while."
    c "欢迎来到夜夜椿！你是吟游诗人？好一阵子没碰上会唱歌的吟游诗人了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_e390a176:

    # c "And ya, good lad. C'mon here."
    c "还有你这位好小伙，过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_74c22ef9:

    # "You sits comfortably on the seat besides Pirkka, as Cane gives your head a light pat."
    "你在皮尔卡身旁的座位上舒服地坐下，凯恩轻轻拍了拍你的脑袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_b34e6962:

    # c "How shall I call ye, lad? Mine's Cane."
    c "小伙子，我该怎么称呼你？我叫凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_13bacb1e:

    # p "I'm Pirkka. I'm travelling from Tavern to Tavern, looking for inspiration and all."
    p "我叫皮尔卡。我在各家酒馆间游历，四处寻找灵感什么的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_0ffc0cad:

    # c "Talkin inspiration, it's all we have over here at Nocturnal Trunk, maybe [e] here can teach ye one thing or two with his skills and all."
    c "说到灵感嘛，夜夜椿里可不缺这个；说不定这里的[e]还能凭本事教你一两招什么的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_780a7638:

    # "You blush intensely over Cane's comment."
    "你因凯恩的话涨红了脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_bd7a9095:

    # e "W-well, not the one Pirkka is looking for."
    e "呃——嗯，不是皮尔卡要找的那种。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_daa6c323:

    # p "Ha. I'm also looking for a lost prose, good sir. It was sold by a bandit, somewhere near, I reckon."
    p "哈。我也在找一份遗失的文稿，阁下。听说是被某个强盗在附近什么地方卖掉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_29d04336:

    # c "Prose? I'm afraid I don't know anything about songs and such, ye shall go ask that cheeky little lion, over at King's Pawn, maybe he'll meet more buyers."
    c "文稿？恕我不懂歌曲之类的东西。你去问问国王之兵那边那头调皮的小狮子吧，说不定他能遇到更多买家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_09bb513e:

    # p "Well, 'tis better than nothing. Many thanks."
    p "好吧，总比没有强。多谢了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_0ea821eb:

    # "Pirkka ponders for a moment."
    "皮尔卡沉思了片刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_35d9b1fb:

    # p "And may I stay for a night here?"
    p "我可以在这里住一晚吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_e5514511:

    # c "Price's 75 gold, per night. But since my lad invited you here, it's 25 gold."
    c "价格是每晚75枚金币。不过既然是我的小伙计邀请你来的，就收25枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_7a2a93f1:

    # c "Our rooms are big, but probably just barely big enough for ye hunky ass."
    c "我们的房间挺大，不过恐怕也就勉强容得下你这壮硕的大屁股。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_622205ad:

    # p "Ohh!"
    p "哦！"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_8f44e090:

    # "The bard exclaims with a hint of surprise."
    "吟游诗人略带惊讶地叫了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_6c35b8e3:

    # p "And might I sit in front of your lively hearth, I shall grace your tavern with my sweet tunes."
    p "那我能坐在你们温暖的炉火前吗？我会用悦耳的曲调为你的酒馆增添光彩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_f0521b7b:

    # c "Aye, be my guest."
    c "当然，请便。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_28359482:

    # "Cane hands a key to Pirkka, as the latter briskly shoves the gold forward."
    "凯恩把钥匙递给皮尔卡，后者则爽快地把金币推了过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_2d6ca27d:

    # c "This is for the room upstairs, should be quieter if ye like privacy."
    c "这是楼上的房间钥匙。你若喜欢清静，那里应该会安静些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_7933e00a:

    # p "I enjoy a lovely company, but solitude is better with eyes closed. Thank you, Cane."
    p "我喜欢与人相伴，但闭上眼睛独处更好。谢谢你，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_23a9f7fa:

    # p "And thank you, [e], for leading me to this village with many merriment."
    p "也谢谢你，[e]，带我来到这个欢乐多多的村子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_7ac8cbd4:

    # p "Please, if you can. Ask around the village to see where my prose ends up."
    p "拜托了，如果你能帮忙的话，去村里打听一下，看看我的文稿最后落到了哪里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Bandit_Quest_Report_a586c9e6:

    # "You smile, and Pirkka strums a few chords before taking his leave."
    "你微笑着，皮尔卡在离开前拨了几个和弦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_6f2eac01:

    # e "Where are we heading, Pirkka?"
    e "我们要去哪儿，皮尔卡？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_d25dd520:

    # p "The tavernkeeper rented me a room for free. And, with his consent, I figured we shall repurpose that space into a performance room for today."
    p "酒馆老板免费租给我一间房。而且，既然得到他的同意，我想今天把那里改成表演室。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_4e1d0976:

    # e "A performance room?"
    e "表演室？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_0f91ffa7:

    # p "Yes, yes. I did recall promising a certain red dragon fellow with a personal performance of the ancient prose."
    p "对，对。我想起来了，我曾答应过某位红龙先生，为他单独表演那篇古老的文稿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_262c194b:

    # p "So perhaps this would be a perfect opportunity to show you the wonder of poetry."
    p "所以，这或许正是让你领略诗歌奇妙之处的绝佳机会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_05db5760:

    # e "Is that, me."
    e "是说我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_612c8c11:

    # p "Call it, an invitation to a magical journey. And my gratitude for your perseverence to locate this precious prose." nointeract
    p "就把它称作一场魔幻旅程的邀请吧，也聊表我对你费心找回这份珍贵文稿的感激。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_d6367fff:

    # e "Well, lucky me. I wouldn't miss it for the world."
    e "哎呀，真走运。我绝不会错过这场盛事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_340eed80:

    # p "Come, my muse, allow me to escort you to ze front-row seat."
    p "来吧，我的缪斯，容我引你前往前排座位。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_1510991e:

    # "Pirkka winks, his eyes sparkle mischievously."
    "皮尔卡眨了眨眼，眼中闪烁着调皮的光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_98a98f69:

    # "From there, he leads you to the door closest to the stairs, a sign with Pirkka's name hangs lazily on the door."
    "他从那里领着你走向离楼梯最近的那扇门，门上懒洋洋地挂着一块写有皮尔卡名字的牌子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_0ebba9bc:

    # "In the room, it was filled with papers and books, some notes left on the table as you noticed the returned prose still presented on top of the pile of books."
    "房间里堆满了纸张和书籍，桌上还留着几张便笺；你注意到，那份归还的文稿仍然放在书堆最上方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_a90ee7b5:

    # p "What do you think, m' dearest companion. Isn't zis room special?"
    p "你觉得怎么样，我最亲爱的同伴？这房间是不是很特别？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_ff5623c4:

    # e "It's a delight indeed. Can't believe you've decorated his room with such delicacy already."
    e "确实令人愉悦。真不敢相信，你这么快就已经把他的房间装点得如此精致了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_f407e1a8:

    # p "Cane offered me a place to live, and in return I shall transform his place into a stage full of enchanting presence."
    p "凯恩给了我一个居住之所，而作为回报，我会把他的地方变成一座充满迷人氛围的舞台。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_b37d208e:

    # "He turns around, eyes staring right at you."
    "他转过身来，目光直直地落在你身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_96146291:

    # p "You offered me a second chance at my prose, and in return..."
    p "你让我有机会重新拿回自己的文稿，而作为回报……"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_4b5fb646:

    # "Pirkka pauses, then raises the corner of his mouth, showing an infectious smile."
    "皮尔卡停顿片刻，随后扬起嘴角，露出一个富有感染力的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_5d9f0cbc:

    # "He closes the door behind you, and all of a sudden, the noise from the tavern simmered down into silence."
    "他在你身后关上门，酒馆里的喧闹声突然渐渐平息，归于寂静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_4421b254:

    # "And the only thing you can focus on, is the purple tiger in front of you."
    "此刻，你唯一能专注的，便是面前那只紫色老虎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_50778846:

    # p "I shall sing you the prose you've recovered for me."
    p "我要把你替我找回的诗篇唱给你听。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_f399288c:

    # "He sits on the chair, hand positioning on the strings of the lute. Slowing adjusting the tunes."
    "他坐到椅子上，将手放到鲁特琴的琴弦上，缓缓调整着曲调。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_63bc5157:

    # "At the same time, you quietly finds the corner of the bed to sit on, heart pounding in anticipation of his singing."
    "与此同时，你悄悄坐到床角，心脏因期待他的歌声而怦怦直跳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_cb0863d1:

    # p "Legends of Mokken, part three, by Kantele Koskin."
    p "坎特莱·科斯金"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_62bb1c28:

    # p "{i}In days of yonder, when the world was fair,{p}A monster, Etch, trapped beneath the darkest lair.{/i}"
    p "{i}在往昔岁月，世间尚美好，{p}一头名为埃奇的怪物，被困于最黑暗的巢穴。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_3f8fca7e:

    # p "{i}With a flaming soul and ominous hair, {p}he threatened and reigned over the land of bare.{/i}"
    p "{i}它灵魂燃烧，长发阴森可怖，{p}它威吓四方，统治着荒芜之土。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_dec98041:

    # "Pirkka begins with the ancient ballad, you can hear such gritty details contrasted with his soft and pleasant voice."
    "皮尔卡开始吟唱这首古老的歌谣，你能听见其中粗粝的细节，与他柔和悦耳的嗓音形成鲜明对比。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_17c9f53a:

    # p "{i}Its power immense, its wrath so rare,{p}Of mortals and lizards, their mind molten and bare.{/i}"
    p "{i}它的力量无穷，怒火罕见，{p}凡人与蜥蜴的心智，都被熔化、剥空。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_4399d21d:

    # p "{i}But a wandering hero, with sword in hand,{p}Did march forth to fight this foul demand.{/i}"
    p "{i}然而一名浪迹天涯的英雄，手持长剑，{p}毅然踏上征途，要与这场邪恶的劫难抗争。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_6c8c1d26:

    # p "{i}He fought so long, he fought so well,{p}And with his might, the beast did still.{/i}"
    p "{i}他奋战许久，始终英勇无双，{p}凭借自身力量，终于将那头野兽制服。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_95566cf6:

    # "Between verses, he shares fleeting glances with you, his orange eyes lingering for a moment longer than necessary."
    "每段诗句之间，他都会与你短暂对视；那双橙色的眼睛在你身上停留的时间，似乎比必要的更久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_489481e8:

    # p "{i}Yet the monster was crafty, and did deceive,{p}It played on the hero's sense of believe.{/i}"
    p "{i}然而怪物狡猾，施计欺骗，{p}利用英雄轻信的弱点。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_7ada0079:

    # "Your pupil widens, losing focus, entirely magnetized to the depth of his glistening pupil."
    "你的瞳孔放大，视线失去焦点，完全被他闪烁瞳孔的深处吸引。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_4b0ef090:

    # p "{i}A shadow room, and a reckless ruler,{p}came to his rescue, but naught the warrior.{/i}"
    p "{i}一间幽暗的房间，还有一位鲁莽的统治者，{p}前来救他，却没能救下那名战士。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_11b78840:

    # p "{i}Futile was the wicked turns and tricks,{p}for at long last, our hero set free of sticks.{/i}"
    p "{i}邪恶的诡计终究徒劳，{p}因为我们的英雄终于摆脱了木棍的束缚。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_2dda25e5:

    # p "{i}With a final strike, the beast was slain,{p}but the hero too, was taken in pain.{/i}"
    p "{i}随着最后一击，野兽被斩杀，{p}但英雄也在痛苦中被带走。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_3b0d7f7d:

    # "He winks playfully as he starts tuning his lute, fingers dancing over the strings with finesse."
    "他俏皮地眨了眨眼，开始为鲁特琴调音，手指灵巧地在琴弦上跳跃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_b1c4b926:

    # p "{i}Cursed by the wicked hex it bore,{p}the monster's essence forevermore.{/i}"
    p "{i}被它承受的邪恶诅咒缠身，{p}怪物的精魂将永世长存。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_182fd7d1:

    # p "{i}And so the hero fell, yet also arose,{p}for his soul weakened, the end was close.{/i}"
    p "{i}英雄就此倒下，却又重新站起，{p}灵魂日渐衰弱，末日已然临近。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_3f2a494e:

    # "The melody is lively, and his voice, rich with emotion, fills the air around you."
    "旋律明快，他的嗓音饱含深情，回荡在你四周。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_2cb183cd:

    # p "{i}The champion wandered, as his husk hollowed, {p}drifted by the wind, until death followed.{/i}"
    p "{i}勇士四处游荡，躯壳渐被掏空，{p}随风漂泊，直至死亡降临。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_262effcd:

    # p "{i}Wandering Spirit, protector of the forests,{p}blessed by the seasons, bestowed us our harvests.{/i}"
    p "{i}游荡之灵，森林的守护者，{p}受四季祝福，赐予我们丰收。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_a89991a8:

    # p "{i}Messenger, Walker, roam this land with your might,{p}and may all spectres be doused in fright.{/i}"
    p "{i}信使，行者，尽展你的力量游历这片土地，{p}愿所有幽魂都沉浸在恐惧之中。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_03bbe241:

    # p "{i}A song of sacrifice, in whispers and tale,{p}and hear, everyone, a brave soul is now at rest.{/i}"
    p "{i}牺牲之歌，在低语与故事中传唱，{p}听啊，众人，一颗勇敢的灵魂如今安息。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_4c602ac3:

    # p "{i}A hero's struggle, a soul in despair,{p}in tapestry of time, shall the story live on in air.{/i}"
    p "{i}英雄苦战，灵魂绝望，{p}在岁月织成的锦缎里，故事将于空中流传。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_8037204e:

    # "As the last note fades away, Pirkka takes a bow, his gaze fixed on you."
    "最后一个音符渐渐消散，皮尔卡向你鞠了一躬，目光始终落在你身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_c23e16c4:

    # "He stands up once more, fur scruffles softly, leaving you with a warmth that transcends the lively ambiance of this room."
    "他再次站起身来，身上的毛发轻轻拂动，留给你的温暖超越了这间屋子里热闹的氛围。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_48e4401b:

    # p "How's the poem, Kantele's words are certainly a perfect blend of story and heroism, no?"
    p "坎特莱的词句"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_ebeb9cf9:

    # "Your eyes refuse to lift off of his handsome face, completely oblivious to what he just said."
    "你的目光完全舍不得从他英俊的脸上移开，根本没注意到他刚才说了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_3c6a9d30:

    # p "Oi!"
    p "哎！"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_f94c3a1c:

    # "His fluffy ears perk up as he notices your drooling mouth. His face blushing with a mix of embarrassment and flattery."
    "他注意到你流着口水的嘴，毛茸茸的耳朵顿时竖了起来。他的脸因羞窘与受宠若惊交织在一起而泛红。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_1ca14415:

    # e "O-oh. Yeah. I love your voice by the way, Pirkka."
    e "呃、哦。对了，顺便说一句，我很喜欢你的声音，皮尔卡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_4faa8338:

    # p "Never have I experienced such an reaction from mine audience, you're one of a kind, [e]."
    p "我从观众那里得到这样的反应，还真是头一回。你真是独一无二，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_4b82b97e:

    # e "Your hand moves like magic. I can never figure out how it works with this instrument."
    e "你的手动起来简直像魔法。我一直弄不明白，你到底是怎么用这件乐器做到的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_a1a02085:

    # "The bard paces lightly, taking a seat by your side."
    "吟游诗人轻快地踱了几步，在你身边坐下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_b4ee2dcd:

    # p "Sounds like someone wants to learn to play my lute! No?"
    p "听起来，某人是想学弹我的鲁特琴！对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_e206f31b:

    # e "Of course!"
    e "当然！"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_8ba93ba4:

    # p "Alright, first thing first, ze posture is important, crucial even."
    p "好，先说最重要的：姿势很重要，甚至可以说至关重要。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_dfa9447e:

    # "Pirkka sits upright, puffing his chest outwards, you watch on the side, gasping as his puffy front bulges out of his cape."
    "皮尔卡坐直身子，挺起胸膛；你在一旁看着，惊得倒吸一口气，他那鼓起的胸前从斗篷下凸显出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_f09a81e9:

    # p "Come, try it yourself. Show me you're confident."
    p "来，自己试试。让我看看你有多自信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_778ba60a:

    # "He puffs up once more, showing you his sturdy physique. You watch and mimic his posture."
    "他又一次挺起胸膛，向你展示结实的身躯。你看着他，模仿他的姿势。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_ee26336e:

    # e "Am I doing it right?"
    e "我做得对吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_fd523cd5:

    # p "Yes, yes. Perfect. Now hold onto ye posture."
    p "对，对，完美。现在保持住这个姿势。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_1a29b6b7:

    # "He gently places his hands onto yours, the soft fur on his finger soothes the gaps between your paws, causing you to flinch a little."
    "他轻轻把手覆到你的手上，手指上的柔软绒毛抚过你爪子间的缝隙，让你不由得轻轻一颤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_4d1c4fb3:

    # "A tender grasp sends warmth down to your spine, he adjusts to sit closer, just to reach onto your hand better."
    "这温柔的握持让暖意顺着你的脊背流下；他挪近了些，好更方便地够到你的手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_d0e47681:

    # "Pirkka positions your hands onto his wooden lute."
    "皮尔卡引导着你的双手，放到他的木鲁特琴上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_73655a22:

    # p "Cradle my lute as if it were a delicate lover of yours, not too tight, not too loose."
    p "把我的鲁特琴当作你娇弱的情人般轻轻抱住，别太紧，也别太松。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_9907b037:

    # p "Ye gotta feel ze curve, as if ze wood's speaking to you."
    p "你得感受它的曲线，仿佛木头正在对你说话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_39e83896:

    # "You awkwardly move your fingers along with Pirkka's movement, quickly come to a realisation that they're much stiffer than Pirkka's."
    "你笨拙地随着皮尔卡的动作移动手指，很快意识到自己的手指比他的僵硬得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_5f29e694:

    # e "Damn, that's harder than I imagined."
    e "该死，这比我想象的难。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_1ece98de:

    # p "Oy, relax, try touching it gently instead. My lute's a shy darling."
    p "哎，放松，试着轻轻触碰它。我的鲁特琴可是个害羞的小宝贝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_fbcc6904:

    # "His hand presses onto you, signaling for you to move in his direction."
    "他的手按了按你，示意你朝他的方向靠近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_577e4bd1:

    # e "Okay."
    e "好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_4cb2c2fe:

    # "With a plinch, you pluck your fingers onto the instrument, eliciting a loud squeaking sound."
    "你猛地一颤，手指拨过乐器，发出刺耳的吱吱声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_9860f076:

    # p "Not quite right, mine muse. Not too timidly, not too boldly, feel the vibrations beneath your fingertips."
    p "还不太对，我的缪斯。别太怯，也别太莽，感受指尖下的颤动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_223c2689:

    # "Pirkka leans in on you, getting incredibly close, his breath almost tickling your ear."
    "皮尔卡向你俯身靠来，近得令人难以置信，他的呼吸几乎搔得你耳朵发痒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_7a0ddf04:

    # p "Follow my lead here, [e]."
    p "跟着我的引导来，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_98c663ed:

    # "You can feel his heartbeat from behind you, his embrace warming you up into a gentle craddle."
    "你能感受到他从身后传来的心跳，他的拥抱温暖着你，将你轻柔地搂在怀中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_96247add:

    # "The bard begins to lead you through a simple, alluring tune, all the while he's gazing into you with a twinkle in his eyes."
    "吟游诗人开始引导你弹奏一段简单而迷人的曲调，同时眼中闪烁着光芒，凝视着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_2008eff8:

    # "It was such a mesmerising experience, having this reputable bard essentially hugging you from behind, at the same time learning to play such music to your ears."
    "这真是一段令人着迷的体验：这位声名远扬的吟游诗人几乎从身后将你抱住，而你同时学会了弹奏如此悦耳的音乐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_9b4c4a51:

    # p "Oh my oh my, you have the touch of a maestro now, see. The lute responds with your desire, music is a conversation, no?"
    p "哎呀，哎呀，你现在已经有大师的手感了，瞧。鲁特琴会回应你的心意，音乐不就是一场对话吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_ae8827ca:

    # "The warmth from the back of your neck sends you shiver as he speaks."
    "他说话时，后颈传来的温热让你不禁战栗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_82955ae7:

    # p "It's all about the intimacy between the musician and the instrument."
    p "音乐家与乐器之间，最重要的就是这份亲密。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_d47afca8:

    # e "It's mostly your doing, Pirkka. I wasn't moving much on my own."
    e "主要都是你的功劳，皮尔卡。我自己可没怎么动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_c76f385f:

    # p "Well, it'z your first time, but now you've learnt it, try it on your own!"
    p "不过这是你第一次，但你现在已经学会了，试着自己来吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_c85ce820:

    # "The bard behind you releases his clutches, making you feel so cold, it's almost as if you've lost something outright."
    "身后的吟游诗人松开了抱住你的手，让你感到一阵寒冷，仿佛突然失去了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_d5f2477b:

    # p "Picture someone you hold dear to your heart, let the music tell your story, like a love letter to the heart."
    p "想象一个你深爱的人，让音乐替你诉说，就像一封写给心灵的情书。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_cb0adaf9:

    # "Suddenly, he taps onto your leg, humming to the tunes you've just played."
    "突然，他轻拍你的腿，哼唱着你刚刚弹奏的曲调。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_5144e2de:

    # p "Ready?"
    p "准备好了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_c7c1ca3b:

    # "You get your hands in position, keep reminding yourself the advice Pirkka just gave you."
    "你摆好双手的位置，不断回想皮尔卡刚才给你的建议。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_16bceccd:

    # "He hums again, slapping onto your thigh playfully as you begin to straddle the lute."
    "他又哼起歌来，嬉闹般拍了拍你的大腿，而你开始跨坐到鲁特琴上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_8940d708:

    # "He's flicking your finger messily to his tunes, sometimes out of rhythm."
    "他随着曲调凌乱地拨弄你的手指，偶尔还会跟不上节拍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_ed22eb31:

    # "It was a short and simple tune, yet so catchy that you're beginning to hum to it over and over."
    "那是一段短小简单的曲子，却十分朗朗上口，你开始一遍又一遍地哼唱起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_dc1e9c72:

    # e "Pirkka, I think I-"
    e "皮尔卡，我想我——"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_2098ef2d:

    # "With the end of the tune, you turn around to look at Pirkka's reaction, only to see his gaze lingers onto your eyes."
    "曲调结束时，你转身想看看皮尔卡的反应，却发现他的目光久久停留在你的双眼上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_2633f44a:

    # e "Am I getting the hang of it?"
    e "我算是掌握诀窍了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_3a7a4a46:

    # p "Very."
    p "非常好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_2505b44f:

    # "You're embarrassed by his comment, obviously your first time playing was a mess, but his enthusiasm is coursing through your body like a charm."
    "你被他的话说得有些难为情，显然你第一次演奏时一团糟，但他的热情却如魔法般在你体内流淌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_b3b41100:

    # p "I'm already thinking about a duet with you, [e]."
    p "我已经开始考虑和你来一段二重奏了，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_6ff126eb:

    # "He whispers under his warm breath, and it's all you can hear."
    "他带着温热的气息低声耳语，而那声音成了你唯一听见的声响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_2d32ebe1:

    # p "Sad we don't have a second lute around here."
    p "真可惜，这附近没有第二把鲁特琴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_d71b9647:

    # "The corner of his lips raises, slowly revealing an alluring smile, of which you can't help but to follow."
    "他的嘴角上扬，缓缓露出一个诱人的笑容，你也不由自主地跟着笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_541a7266:

    # "Your lips are so close to touching each together, Pirkka tilts his head slightly, seemingly adjusting to meet your face."
    "你们的嘴唇近得几乎要碰在一起，皮尔卡微微歪过头，似乎在调整角度，好迎上你的脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_57929ecc:

    # "In an instant, you reach out to kiss Pirkka, it almost feel like an instinct, your lips just attracted to each other like magnets."
    "刹那间，你几乎出于本能地凑上前去吻皮尔卡；你们的嘴唇仿佛磁石般彼此吸引。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_41f7c6b1:

    # "It almost comes as a shock to Pirkka at first, he pulls out for a second, your saliva dripping in his maw."
    "起初这几乎让皮尔卡措手不及，他退开了一瞬，你的唾液从他口中滴落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_de203287:

    # "You stare at each other in lustful gaze, then again, reaching out for another kiss at the same time."
    "你们含情脉脉地凝视着彼此，随后又同时伸手，想要再次亲吻对方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_96864d5e:

    # "This time, it was much longer, your teeth grazing against his lower lips, savoring the aroma of his taste."
    "这一次持续得久多了，你的牙齿轻轻擦过他的下唇，细细品味着他唇齿间的气息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_764a5c17:

    # "You close your eyes, fully submerge yourself into the delight of kissing this handsome tiger. He's not more experienced as you thought, but you can tell he's enjoying the moment also."
    "你闭上双眼，彻底沉浸在亲吻这只英俊老虎的愉悦中。他并没有你想象中那么有经验，但你能看出，他也很享受这一刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_6d7fec35:

    # "His tongue makes way into your mouth, exploring, licking clean inside while you do the same."
    "他的舌头探入你的口中，四处探索，舔舐着里面的一切，而你也同样回应着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_69c6cc38:

    # "Slowly, you wrap your arms around Pirkka, holding him tight as you continue smooching this tiger man."
    "你慢慢伸出双臂，紧紧抱住皮尔卡，继续亲吻这个虎人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_862be371:

    # "Both of you are so immersed in the moment, that you've almost forgotten to breath, but, a part of you wish this moment will never end."
    "你们都深深沉浸在这一刻，几乎忘了呼吸；但你心里的一部分，真希望这一刻永远不要结束。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_5a4c2bd9:

    # "When it's time, you pull out, just to breath in his hot breath. You open your eyes, gazing deep into his eyes as he reaches out once more."
    "时机到了，你抽身出来，只为吸入他灼热的呼吸。你睁开双眼，深深凝视着他的眼睛，而他又一次向你伸出手来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_12dcedb2:

    # "The bard smiles, then laugh loudly."
    "吟游诗人笑了起来，随后放声大笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_5f28d409:

    # p "I didn't expect that."
    p "我没想到会这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_5bb80a41:

    # e "Me neither."
    e "我也是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_987ac446:

    # p "You're a great kisser, [e]."
    p "你吻技真棒，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_7df71ac0:

    # e "Thanks, you too."
    e "谢谢，你也一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_936e9f99:

    # e "I... I just admire you too much. From the time we met, I feel that whenever you play the music, I just get pulled in in front of you."
    e "我……我只是太仰慕你了。从我们相遇的那一刻起，我就觉得，每当你奏起音乐，我都会不由自主地被吸引到你面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_ddef3ef6:

    # "Pirkka raises his eyebrows in awe, his tail wags on the bed excitedly."
    "皮尔卡敬畏地挑起眉毛，尾巴在床上兴奋地摇摆着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_6204f5d7:

    # p "You're such an inspiration to me, my muse. Even being a courier, everywhere in zis Lusterfield village, I hear your name spoken fondly."
    p "你对我而言就是灵感，我的缪斯。即使我只是个信使，在这座卢斯特菲尔德村庄的各处，我都能听到人们亲切地谈起你的名字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_ee2191dc:

    # p "Like ze ancient heroes sung by us bards."
    p "就像我们吟游诗人歌颂的那些古代英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_ba8d7c59:

    # e "Pirkka, you're too flattering."
    e "皮尔卡，你太会夸人了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_10ecb760:

    # p "What can I say, you embody that definition pretty well, my prose-keeper."
    p "我还能说什么呢？你确实很符合那个定义，我的文辞守护者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_c5fe1018:

    # "The bard grins wholeheartedly, all the while he's staring at you at mere few inches. He's still so close."
    "吟游诗人由衷地咧嘴笑着，同时近在咫尺地凝视着你。他依然离你很近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_4dd0ee7d:

    # e "I am no hero, I just like walking around the world, maybe helping people."
    e "我不是什么英雄，只是喜欢四处游历，也许顺便帮助一些人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_90818be5:

    # p "If you're no hero, you will be one now, come."
    p "如果你还不是英雄，那你现在就会成为英雄。来吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_c94863b7:

    # "Pirkka smirks as he grabs his lute, climbing to the back of the bed."
    "皮尔卡拿起鲁特琴，露出一抹坏笑，爬到了床的后方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_6414e1ee:

    # e "What are you doing, Pirkka."
    e "皮尔卡，你在做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_7c1eafd2:

    # "You exclaim as you turn your head curiously."
    "你疑惑地转过头，惊呼出声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_c254b49c:

    # p "Singing a song for you. Of course."
    p "当然是唱首歌给你听。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_009617f4:

    # "He adjusts the instrument, hands warming up to the tunes he has in mind."
    "他调整着乐器，双手为脑海中的曲调热起身来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_d0b27120:

    # "You place your hands on the bed, curious as to what he has come up."
    "你把双手放在床上，好奇他究竟准备了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_f04ad687:

    # p "Here goes what I heard from the people in Lusterfield, of this legendary character in front of me, [e]."
    p "接下来是我从卢斯特菲尔德的人们那里听来的，关于眼前这位传奇人物的故事，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_c7280ead:

    # "Pirkka clears his throat, and begins to sing."
    "皮尔卡清了清嗓子，开始吟唱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_eb5fbf15:

    # p "{i}A dragon of origin, a goat of history, {p} raised from a village from another world.{/i}"
    p "{i}起源之龙，历史之羊，{p}在另一个世界的村庄里长大。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_36ee0b60:

    # "Pirkka's fingers move effortlessly across the strings, creating a mesmerizing tune."
    "皮尔卡的手指毫不费力地拨过琴弦，奏出令人着迷的曲调。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_8e89eae7:

    # p "{i}Stammering, searching out, {p}a dear friend's trail, in his path he hurled.{/i}"
    p "{i}结结巴巴，四处寻觅，{p}他沿着挚友的踪迹，投身前路。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_ecd02d75:

    # p "{i}Out of your depth, A change of hart, {p}he channels a door out the other side.{/i}"
    p "{i}超出你的深浅，心境变迁，{p}他引出一道通往彼端的门。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_13adf983:

    # p "{i}Your eyes of stars, night's reflection, {p}fades before setting off for a sleigh r-ide.{/i}"
    p "{i}星辰般的双眸，夜色的倒影，{p}在启程乘雪橇前渐渐褪去。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_9632d34b:

    # "It's mind-blowing how much he has heard about your backstory, without you ever telling him."
    "你从未告诉过他自己的过往，可他听说过的细节之多，实在令人难以置信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_117d4c1a:

    # p "{i}Out of this land, the wanderer has drifted, {p}where he's been, an echo of slumber.{/i}"
    p "{i}离开这片土地，漫游者漂泊而去，{p}他所到之处，只余沉睡的回声。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_318b5a01:

    # "He leans in, strumming the lute with an almost hypnotic rhythm. You're too busy listening to the lyrics in this way."
    "他俯身向前，以近乎催眠的节奏弹奏鲁特琴。你正全神贯注地听着这样的歌词。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_9f3ba333:

    # p "{i}A stranger, a lion. Someone is awoken. {p}The world has been shifted, does he still remember.{/i}"
    p "{i}一个陌生人，一头雄狮。有人醒来了。{p}世界已经改变，他是否还记得。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_fcffe6de:

    # p "{i}Taken in, a pawn shop in Lusterfield. {p}A friendly custodian offered the role of courier.{/i}"
    p "{i}被收留在卢斯特菲尔德的一家当铺。{p}一位友善的管理员让他担任信使。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_140a05e2:

    # p "{i}And there he went, a brand new life, {p}adventures lied ahead of our new traveler.{/i}"
    p "{i}于是他启程了，迎来全新的生活，{p}冒险正等待着我们的新旅人。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_4cf8e60b:

    # "Pirkka gives you a playful wink, and licks his lips. You lean in closer, just to feel his warmth."
    "皮尔卡俏皮地朝你眨了眨眼，舔了舔嘴唇。你向他靠近，只为感受他的温度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_d0fc12a3:

    # p "{i}Slime, Buggbears, evil monsters {p}emerged from deepmost of the forest.{/i}"
    p "{i}史莱姆、熊地精，还有邪恶的怪物，{p}从森林最深处冒了出来。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_9cdef98f:

    # p "{i}He slashed, trampled, under his weapon {p}no contender put him to the test.{/i}"
    p "{i}他挥砍践踏，在他的武器之下，{p}无人能与他一战。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_07fea4af:

    # "The bard praises you like a real hero, something you never did hear anyone say."
    "吟游诗人把你夸得像个真正的英雄，这可是你从未听任何人说过的评价。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_d034284a:

    # p "{i}And soon he arrived, a tribe of goats, {p}weavers of magic sent him on a conquest.{/i}"
    p "{i}不久，他抵达山羊部族，{p}魔法编织者派他踏上征途。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_f0c82ec3:

    # p "{i}A treaty of peace, stuck between two factions, {p}he sees a calm before the tempest.{/i}"
    p "{i}两派之间缔结和平条约，{p}他看见了暴风雨前的宁静。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_724c8899:

    # p "{i}Apprentice of a great hunk, he embarks an adventure, {p}together they encountered a figure of moss.{/i}"
    p "{i}伟岸壮汉的学徒踏上冒险之旅，{p}两人一同遇见了一个苔藓身影。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_60b03c03:

    # p "{i}A weird stone, nonetheless. {p}He traces to the chief of buck a stream across.{/i}"
    p "{i}不过，那是一块古怪的石头。{p}他循着踪迹，跨过溪流追向雄鹿首领。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_b751642d:

    # "Pirkka does make writing a poem sounds so easy, taking only a brief pause in between each sentences."
    "皮尔卡让写诗听起来轻而易举，每句话之间只需短暂停顿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_49d2aa9e:

    # p "{i}Through twists and turns, the chief is no where to be seen, {p}goat village erupts in chaos.{/i}"
    p "{i}辗转曲折之间，首领不见踪影，{p}山羊村陷入混乱。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_e6e763bc:

    # p "{i}But he emerged, a journey in the damp cave, {p}a lump of moss and stone, it's the boss.{/i}"
    p "{i}可他还是从潮湿的洞窟中走了出来，历经一番旅程，{p}化作一团苔藓与石头——这就是首领。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_be573889:

    # p "{i}So the wanderer fought, brave and wild. {p}Your eyes of fire dawned on the maddened spirit.{/i}"
    p "{i}于是流浪者勇猛而狂野地战斗。{p}你燃烧的双眼照亮了那疯狂的灵魂。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_1ea43880:

    # p "{i}Under the crumbling golem, he saved the chief, {p}with the heroic act it comes merit.{/i}"
    p "{i}在崩塌的魔像下，他救出了首领，{p}如此英雄之举，自当赢得荣耀。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_fae00d9c:

    # "His fingers dance on the lute, the music wrapping around the air like a gentle embrace."
    "他的手指在鲁特琴上起舞，琴声如温柔的拥抱般包裹着空气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_49917819:

    # p "{i}The people of forest furnished the wanderer, {p}he's a courier of the village, but hero of the goat.{/i}"
    p "{i}森林之民款待了这位流浪者，{p}他是村子的信使，却也是山羊的英雄。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_e691f417:

    # p "{i}He's an icon, a figure of inquisition. {p}For he has travelled far and wide, with his pride afloat.{/i}"
    p "{i}他是个象征，是调查者的身影。{p}因为他远走四方，骄傲始终高扬。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_6be1d095:

    # p "{i}[pirkkasverse1]{/i}"
    p "{i}[pirkkasverse1]{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_2a025095:

    # p "{i}[pirkkasverse2]{/i}"
    p "{i}[pirkkasverse2]{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_6be1d095_1:

    # p "{i}[pirkkasverse1]{/i}"
    p "{i}[pirkkasverse1]{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_2a025095_1:

    # p "{i}[pirkkasverse2]{/i}"
    p "{i}[pirkkasverse2]{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_f5dad20c:

    # p "{i}In a fateful encounter, this wanderer meets with a graceful bard. {p}His curiosiiity intrigued this fortuitous tiger.{/i}"
    p "{i}在一次命运般的相遇中，这位流浪者遇见了一名优雅的吟游诗人。{p}他的好奇心吸引了这只幸运的老虎。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_eeb0b5b3:

    # p "{i}A dance, a song, a ballad of ancient hero. {p}It was stolen by no one but the baneful bandits over.{/i}"
    p "{i}一支舞，一首歌，一曲古老英雄的歌谣。{p}它被那些可恶的强盗偷走了。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_6698ec30:

    # p "{i}He barges in the bandit's den, a challenge no one feated, {p}the robbers and thieves all ran elsewhere.{/i}"
    p "{i}他闯进了强盗的巢穴，这是无人敢面对的挑战，{p}盗匪们全都逃到了别处。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_7a6d5fba:

    # e "Well, I didn't beat every bandits in their hideout, just sneaking the place."
    e "好吧，我可没在他们的藏身处打败所有强盗，只是偷偷溜进去而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_3b02ffbf:

    # p "Okay, it was all but pretty words mixed with some stories I've heard here and zere, but let me think of a better way."
    p "好吧，那不过是些漂亮话，掺杂着我在这里听到的几则故事而已，不过让我想想更好的说法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_b7a932d0:

    # p "{i}He sneaks in, past the glimpses of the ever-vigilant evilness, {p}an endeavor no one dared, but he did so for a total stranger.{/i}"
    p "{i}他潜入其中，避过那始终保持警戒的邪恶目光，{p}这件无人敢做的事，他却为了一个素不相识的人做到了。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_ba71ddaa:

    # p "{i}Yet, the prose was not placed within, {p}instead it was basked in the very place where resides the wanderer.{/i}"
    p "{i}然而，故事并未留在那里，{p}反而在流浪者居住的地方铺陈开来。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_7f4818a5:

    # p "{i}There, he invited the minstrel to the village he now lives. {p}A deal with his fellow, and the prose is back.{/i}"
    p "{i}在那里，他邀请吟游诗人来到自己如今居住的村庄。{p}与同伴达成约定，故事又接续了下去。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_a682c61d:

    # p "{i}The bard could not have forgotten, his face, his laughter, {p}and an affectionate heart, despite the courage of the pack.{/i}"
    p "{i}吟游诗人不可能忘记他的面容、笑声，{p}以及那颗温柔的心，尽管那群伙伴勇气十足。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_287af209:

    # p "{i}Now in this room, the wanderer's desireful eyes, {p}so let the lute speak, and the story shall be continued written.{/i}"
    p "{i}此刻在这个房间里，流浪者的双眼饱含欲望，{p}就让鲁特琴代为诉说，故事也将继续写下去。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_25c8c513:

    # "You lean your head forward, the distances between you two are mere inches now."
    "你向前探头，你们之间的距离如今只剩几英寸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_82b1a77b:

    # "A mischievous smile playing on his lips as you get closer, he is almost anticipating what is coming."
    "你靠近时，他唇边浮现调皮的笑容，仿佛几乎已经在期待接下来会发生什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_38428022:

    # "But he doesn't stop singing."
    "但他并没有停止歌唱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_2cf3cf6e:

    # "You reach out, trying to grab Pirkka's face, but he nudges your hand out of it."
    "你伸手想抓住皮尔卡的脸，但他轻轻把你的手拨开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_f48a9392:

    # p "Your laughter, a melody, your touch is a rhyme. In face of a performance, you never slack, a symphony of pleasure."
    p "你的笑声是一支旋律，你的触碰便是押韵。面对这场表演，你从不懈怠，宛如一曲欢愉的交响乐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_36c12c33:

    # "His smile widens, an enchanting wink from him just teases your heart more."
    "他的笑容更加灿烂，那迷人的一记眨眼更撩拨你的心弦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_b66adc46:

    # p "{i}All along, you wander, your trail left on every inch of Mokken's soil.{/i}"
    p "{i}一路走来，你的足迹遍布莫肯的每一寸土地。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_f3bd3b15:

    # "Pirkka notices your distance has gotten further, but he doesn't bother."
    "皮尔卡注意到你离得更远了，但并不在意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_46d6d018:

    # p "{i}On the darkest night, the restless day, {p}the hopeless place, you show up, never foil.{/i}"
    p "{i}在最深沉的黑夜，躁动不安的白昼，{p}在无望之地，你总会现身，从不让人失望。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_fd124ced:

    # "Your attention is all focused on his music and the lyric. At least, you've never been praised like this before."
    "你的注意力全在他的音乐和歌词上。至少，你从未受到过这样的赞美。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_de871911:

    # p "{i}Because he is the symbol of a hero, {p}a brave adventurer no one wish to stand in his way.{/i}"
    p "{i}因为他是英雄的象征，{p}是无人敢挡其路的勇敢冒险者。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_e771fed2:

    # p "{i}A foreign visitor, a traveller at heart, {p}he will flourish, by the blessing of this bard.{/i}"
    p "{i}一位异乡来客，骨子里的旅人，{p}在这位吟游诗人的祝福下，他将大放异彩。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_719ef12c:

    # "He points at himself, before bowing half-heartedly on the bed."
    "他指了指自己，然后在床上敷衍地鞠了一躬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_f5c11199:

    # "You clap your hands loudly, admiring the entire performance from the beginning to the end."
    "你用力鼓掌，从头到尾欣赏着整场表演。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_150f0242:

    # p "How's it? Does it do you justice enough?"
    p "怎么样？把你表现得还算到位吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_3f8f4f83:

    # e "I love it, though, I'm still not believing I'm actually qualified to be a hero here."
    e "我喜欢极了，不过，我还是不敢相信自己真的有资格在这里当英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_997ade66:

    # p "Every hero starts somewhere, I'll sing this song to the tavern regulars, and maybe add some polish and fantasy."
    p "每位英雄都是从某处起步的。我会把这首歌唱给酒馆的常客听，也许再润色一番，添点幻想色彩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_f63bb847:

    # p "They'll soon think you're a hero regardless."
    p "不管怎样，他们很快就会把你当成英雄了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_6835b9f2:

    # "You both grin brightly, before the room fall silent to the lack of music."
    "你们相视灿然一笑，随后没有音乐的房间陷入寂静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_75ad8225:

    # p "Well, you're happy, I'm happy. Again, this was just m' little gift for the prose."
    p "嗯，你开心，我也开心。再说一次，这只是我为那篇文稿准备的小礼物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_42b723e1:

    # p "Do you want to head out? I'm ready to play some more music for the tavern."
    p "要出去吗？我已经准备好再为酒馆演奏一会儿了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_7365e21e:

    # e "Sure."
    e "好啊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_0d20747f:

    # "As such, he strums a few chords as usual, before leaving the room with you."
    "于是，他像往常一样拨了几个和弦，便和你一起离开了房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_7b1a1aa6:

    # e "There's something else I need to work on, Pirkka."
    e "皮尔卡，我还有别的事要处理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_8ae9232f:

    # p "Okay, but I'm not leaving the village anywhere soon."
    p "好吧，不过我近期不会离开村子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Pirkka_Show_bc19c7e6:

    # "He shoots you a wide grin, before fiddling with his lute once more."
    "他朝你咧嘴一笑，又摆弄起他的鲁特琴来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Prose_Ask_ee627328:

    # e "Hey, Lothar. Have you seen a prose?"
    e "嘿，洛萨尔。你见过一篇文稿吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Prose_Ask_270be95f:

    # l "Oh don't tell me you've talked with that stupid bard, disciple."
    l "哦，别告诉我你跟那个蠢吟游诗人说过话，徒弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Prose_Ask_f333f500:

    # e "W-what, Pirkka?"
    e "什、什么，皮尔卡？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Prose_Ask_4148768b:

    # l "Yeah, stupid, annoying, totally ruins the vibe we've had in the Tavern with his supposed music to the ears."
    l "没错，蠢得烦人，还彻底毁了我们在酒馆里的气氛——就凭他那自以为悦耳的音乐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Prose_Ask_32457fdc:

    # l "And no, I have not seen any Kantele, any prose, any paper in the existence of the entire Mokken."
    l "坎特莱"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Prose_Ask_dca2b34f:

    # e "Did he piss you off?"
    e "他是不是把你惹毛了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Prose_Ask_c860cfd5:

    # l "I don't like how he talks, now the regulars in the trunk calls me 'Nocturnal Hunk' instead of 'Hero of Lusterfield', thanks to him."
    l "我不喜欢他说话的方式。多亏了他，树干里的常客们现在都叫我“夜行猛男”，不叫“卢斯特菲尔德英雄”了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Prose_Ask_886dc32c:

    # e "I think that fits you mor- I mean, uh... both are good."
    e "我觉得那个称呼更适合你——不，我是说……呃……两个都不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Prose_Ask_f1957b48:

    # l "Ugh, anyway, no prose. I don't deal with the bandits so I have no idea how you get them to trade."
    l "唉，算了，反正没有文稿。我不跟土匪打交道，所以完全不知道你是怎么让他们拿东西来交易的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Prose_Ask_91cf55fc:

    # e "Well, thank you anyway for letting me know."
    e "嗯，不过还是谢谢你告诉我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Prose_Ask_05a105ae:

    # e "Seb, have you seen a prose?"
    e "塞巴斯，你见过文稿吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Prose_Ask_283e0037:

    # s "Hey roomie. What's the prose look like?"
    s "嘿，室友。文稿看起来是什么样的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Prose_Ask_486bbec2:

    # e "It's... a parchment, paper? There's a red ribbon with ancient markings on it."
    e "是……羊皮纸，还是普通纸？上面系着一条带有古老标记的红丝带。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Prose_Ask_d91246d3:

    # s "Well, I don't think I've had been pawned a prose lately. Last one was a few months before."
    s "嗯，我想最近应该没人拿文稿来典当。上一份还是几个月前的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Prose_Ask_921715ea:

    # e "There's a bard, Pirkka. Who are looking for the stolen prose."
    e "有个叫皮尔卡的吟游诗人，正在寻找被偷走的文稿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Prose_Ask_13685e08:

    # s "Another friend of yours? How's the old Wuldon you've brought to us last time?"
    s "又是你的朋友？你上次带来的老伍尔顿最近怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Prose_Ask_b67d1ec9:

    # e "He's doing just fine."
    e "他好得很。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Prose_Ask_09437e1a:

    # s "Well well, Mister Ole over there are always there reading books and whatnot."
    s "哎呀，奥利先生就在那边，总是在看书什么的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Prose_Ask_31763719:

    # s "But he's not the thief type, though. So maybe you're looking at someone smaller."
    s "不过他不像是会偷东西的人。所以，你找的也许是个个头更小的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Prose_Ask_9622e0b7:

    # e "Thanks, Seb."
    e "谢谢你，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Prose_Ask_5852d121:

    # s "Good luck with your friend."
    s "祝你和你的朋友好运。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_81a1434c:

    # e "Hello, Rahim. May I ask if you've seen any prose in Lusterfield?"
    e "你好，雷希姆。请问你在卢斯特菲尔德见过什么文稿吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_1b771e77:

    # "Rahim raises an eyebrow towards you."
    "雷希姆朝你挑了挑眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_470a1a5d:

    # r "Prose?"
    r "文稿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_0627904e:

    # e "Yeah. I suppose it's a ballad."
    e "对。我想应该是一首歌谣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_90883622:

    # r "What's it about?"
    r "讲的是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_4c4b19ce:

    # e "It's about an old hero... who killed a monster or some sort. I've not read the whole thing yet."
    e "讲的是一位昔日的英雄……杀死了某种怪物。我还没读完整篇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_044b83e9:

    # r "Old hero."
    r "老英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_974a37ee:

    # r "Monster."
    r "怪物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_c55d96ba:

    # "Rahim taps on his needle."
    "雷希姆敲了敲手里的针。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_c34f50c3:

    # "He stares on the floor for a while."
    "他盯着地板看了一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_df3dc88c:

    # r "I don't have the prose."
    r "我没有那份文稿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_808e2878:

    # e "Uhm... do you know about any other people with a prose?"
    e "呃……你还知道有谁手里有文稿吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_812afdf7:

    # r "Ole had one before, rolled. He showed it to me a while ago."
    r "奥利以前有一份，卷起来的。他前阵子给我看过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_245680af:

    # "Rahim goes back to work once more, you're not sure if he has ended the conversation alltogether."
    "雷希姆又继续干活，你不确定他是不是已经彻底结束了这场谈话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_3b59ed57:

    # e "Thanks, Rahim."
    e "谢谢你，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Prose_Ask_23f57c1f:

    # "The bull gives you another glance, and nods as you leave."
    "那头公牛又看了你一眼，在你离开时点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_50030f6e:

    # e "Hey, Amble, have you seen a prose? Or anyone that's interested in poems and ballads?"
    e "嘿，安布，你见过文稿吗？或者认识对诗歌和民谣感兴趣的人吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_d1dfa7a3:

    # a "Oh, hey there, puny friend."
    a "哦，嘿，小弱鸡朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_390031a4:

    # "Amble scatches his chin."
    "安布挠了挠下巴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_e9eba489:

    # a "I- I don't think so. I've only been chopping wood around the village, and Jog's not the one to read."
    a "我——我觉得不是。我只是在村子周围砍砍木头，乔格也不是会读书的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_593fdd58:

    # j "Maybe that lizard."
    j "也许那只蜥蜴吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_0c9349ab:

    # "Jog exclaims from afar."
    "乔格从远处喊道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_2e890f1c:

    # j "Ole seems like the guy to read books, I've lived with him long enough."
    j "奥利看起来像是会读书的人，我跟他一起住了这么久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_888eb8a6:

    # e "Oh?"
    e "哦？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_d5071b57:

    # a "Aha, I've heard him talk about collecting some paper as well, maybe he's your guy?"
    a "啊，我听他说过要收集一些纸张，也许他就是你要找的人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_22c163e9:

    # a "But Rahim, on the other hands tells stories that are good for bedtime, I think he reads a lot too."
    a "不过雷希姆倒是会讲些适合睡前听的故事，我觉得他应该也读很多书。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_d3ef8f4b:

    # j "That's not poems, ya oaf."
    j "那不是诗，笨蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_fa250801:

    # a "Oh!"
    a "哦！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_c90f4935:

    # "Amble brushes the back of his head."
    "安布摸了摸后脑勺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_a388557b:

    # e "Well, thank you you two for the help, I'll go ask the others."
    e "好吧，谢谢你们两位的帮助，我去问问其他人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Prose_Ask_2d2e7bc5:

    # a "Good luck to you!"
    a "祝你好运！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_bf210b69:

    # e "Ole, have you seen a prose?"
    e "奥利，你见过文稿吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_8a2080e6:

    # o "Uhm... prose?"
    o "呃……文稿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_4c8cad40:

    # e "Yeah. There's an ancient marking on a red ribbon that bounds the parchment."
    e "是的。羊皮纸边缘那条红色缎带上，有一道古老的印记。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_af8f9d48:

    # "Ole looks uncomfortable, he puts down the brush and slightly nudges on his dewlaps."
    "奥利看起来有些不自在。他放下画笔，轻轻碰了碰自己的喉囊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_2eca18f9:

    # o "Can we go to your room?"
    o "我们能去你的房间吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_1b99c36a:

    # "Your cheeks instantly blush."
    "你的脸颊瞬间红了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_662e4448:

    # e "It's in the middle of the day! I'm not ready-"
    e "现在可是大白天！我还没准备好——"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_e20a49d8:

    # o "It's something important."
    o "这件事很重要。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_b7c4d90f:

    # "The lizard leads you to your own room, he closes the door delicately before turning to you."
    "那只蜥蜴领着你回到自己的房间，轻轻关上门，然后转身面对你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_c30e3dad:

    # o "Uhm... well. Let's talk."
    o "呃……好吧。我们谈谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_cffee1ac:

    # e "Ole, why are we in this room?"
    e "奥利，我们为什么要在这个房间里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_fdbcf1ee:

    # o "Seb's not going to like what we're going to talk about."
    o "塞布不会喜欢我们要谈的事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_780bfde3:

    # o "But first, why are you looking for the prose?"
    o "不过先说说，你为什么要找那篇文稿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_789d1d8c:

    # e "There's a bard, Pirkka. Who recently got stolen the prose from a bandit."
    e "有个吟游诗人叫皮尔卡，他的文稿最近被一个强盗偷走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_9ebbdb50:

    # "He sits on your bed, trying to close the windows shut."
    "他坐在你的床上，试着把窗户关严。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_22c70ff4:

    # o "I can't hide anything from you, can I?"
    o "我果然什么都瞒不过你，是吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_4c2529df:

    # o "His prose is upstairs."
    o "他的文稿在楼上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_a55f89be:

    # "You gasp in surprise, but Ole puts a finger in front of your mouth."
    "你惊讶地倒吸一口气，但奥利把一根手指竖在你嘴前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_808bfd21:

    # o "[e], I don't take pride with dealing with bandits, but they've just found a work I've been collecting."
    o "[e]，我可不以和强盗打交道为荣，但他们刚刚发现了一部我一直在收集的作品。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_8ba369c5:

    # e "Collecting?"
    e "收集？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_b6528b4c:

    # o "I collected a lot of books, prose, all manuscripts, they're all right upstairs."
    o "我收集了很多书、文稿，还有手稿，它们全都在楼上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_8c9ff642:

    # "Ole sits close to you, you can almost smell his breath as he nervously speaks."
    "奥利坐得离你很近，你几乎能闻到他说话时呼出的气息，而他显得十分紧张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_36b18919:

    # o "It's been a while since I last bought... collected anything."
    o "我已经有一阵子没买……没收集东西了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_9a48debd:

    # o "It's really been a while, until I saw it in the alleyway. They'd been trying to get me to buy stuff for years."
    o "确实已经过去很久了，直到我在小巷里看到了它。他们这些年来一直想让我买东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_eab158ad:

    # o "I didn't know what I was thinking, I bought the prose with 3000 gold. You must not tell Seb about this."
    o "我当时也不知道自己在想什么，竟然花了三千枚金币买下那篇文稿。你千万不能把这件事告诉塞布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_3984d8a1:

    # e "T-that... that's a lot of gold, Ole."
    e "这、这……那可是很多金币啊，奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_9de69a41:

    # o "Not just about the gold, but I promised myself I'm not collecting anything like them ever again."
    o "不只是因为那些金币，我还发誓再也不收集类似的东西了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_75baa351:

    # o "I don't know what's going on, but ever since you came, I've not been the one who I was proud of being."
    o "我不知道这是怎么回事，但自从你来了，我就不再是那个令自己自豪的自己了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_d4d9c1ee:

    # "Ole exclaims, he seems much more fidgety than usual."
    "奥利惊叫一声，看起来比平时坐立不安得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_9d2f2d12:

    # e "Alright."
    e "好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_0995d6b5:

    # o "The prose should go back to its owner."
    o "这份文稿该物归原主了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_b052b2b3:

    # o "W-where's Pirkka?"
    o "皮尔卡在哪儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_8df2b267:

    # e "He's in the Tavern."
    e "他在酒馆里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_757c30f8:

    # o "Let's go then. I should apologise to him personally."
    o "那我们走吧。我该亲自向他道歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_a21b29ee:

    # "The lizard pats your back, before you both get up from the room."
    "蜥蜴拍了拍你的后背，然后你们一起从房间里起身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_fa7ab824:

    # "You look up as Ole tells the lion to take care of the shop for a moment."
    "你抬起头，只见奥利让狮子暂时照看一下店铺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_77a21238:

    # "Sebas stares at both of you with a puzzled look as Ole goes upstairs to retrieve the poem."
    "奥利上楼去取诗稿时，塞巴斯困惑地盯着你们两个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_06891b07:

    # s "Hey, buddy. What's going on with my big O?"
    s "嘿，伙计。我家大奥利这是怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_cb8f196f:

    # s "Don't tell me he's done stuff in your room."
    s "别告诉我他在你房间里做了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_81d6c63b:

    # e "Seb, it's nothing like that."
    e "塞巴斯，事情不是那样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_cac464be:

    # s "Ha, you're just making me much more curious now."
    s "哈，你这么一说我反而更好奇了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_6a8ea4da:

    # "Sebas pauses as Ole arrives with a side glance."
    "奥利斜着眼走过来时，塞巴斯停顿了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_16eb5094:

    # s "Uhm, I see nothing."
    s "呃，我什么都没看见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_695f2079:

    # "The lizard gestures you to follow him."
    "蜥蜴示意你跟上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_ab9f864f:

    # "And soon, you two arrive to the Nocturnal Trunk."
    "没过多久，你们便到了“夜夜椿”酒馆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_37dd854d:

    # "Inside the dimly lit tavern, you and Ole spots Pirkka sitting at a table in the corner, tapping on his lute on a certain beat."
    "在灯光昏暗的酒馆里，你和奥利发现皮尔卡坐在角落的桌旁，正随着某个节拍轻敲鲁特琴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_0004e8b2:

    # p "There you are, come here, my friend."
    p "你们在这儿啊，过来，我的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_7f3563fc:

    # "Pirkka points at you."
    "皮尔卡指向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_576caf6a:

    # p "And who's this fella over here?"
    p "这位小伙子又是谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_235472c9:

    # e "He's Ole, we lived together in a shop nearby actually."
    e "他是奥利。我们之前其实一起住在附近的一家店里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_ab259291:

    # "The bard notices the familiar parchment from Ole's hand."
    "吟游诗人注意到了奥利手中那张熟悉的羊皮纸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_d4892461:

    # p "Greetings, dear Ole. I see you have something that belongs to me."
    p "你好，亲爱的奥利。我看你手上有件属于我的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_faf5e617:

    # o "I apologise, Pirkka. I didn't know it was yours. I can return the prose to you unscathed, with a bit of price."
    o "抱歉，皮尔卡。我不知道那是你的东西。我可以完好无损地把文稿还给你，不过你得付点钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_59bc82e8:

    # p "I'm willing to pay 1000 gold for its safe return."
    p "我愿意出1000枚金币，换回它的完好无损。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_5c473a13:

    # o "But, I can't let it go for any less than 2500 gold. It's a rare piece of literature, you know."
    o "不过，我不能以低于2500枚金币的价格把它交出去。这可是稀有的文学作品，你知道的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_76f8c21c:

    # o "And I bought it for 3000 gold, that 500 gold should cover for all your troubles."
    o "而且我当初可是花了3000枚金币买来的，500枚金币应该足够补偿你的所有辛劳了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_f3682b95:

    # e "H-hey Ole, didn't we talk about this?"
    e "呃——奥利，我们不是说过这事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_3cc78cd4:

    # "You whisper as you grab Ole's arm tightly."
    "你一边紧紧抓住奥利的手臂，一边低声说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_0c87d2c7:

    # o "I didn't tell you I'm letting it go for free."
    o "我可没说要免费把它交出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_307770b0:

    # p "Fair, but [e] here went the trouble to retrieve the prose from the depth of bandit's den. 500 gold can't cover all that."
    p "确实如此，但[e]可是费了不少工夫，才从强盗巢穴深处把文稿取回来。500枚金币可抵不上这些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_ae69c359:

    # p "1500 gold."
    p "1500枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_4a8ee3e5:

    # o "2300, that should be the final price."
    o "2300枚，这应该就是最终价格了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_c5ce6257:

    # p "How about 1700?"
    p "1700枚怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_e5bd78c5:

    # e "H-hey, Ole. Shouldn't you lower the price a little? You said you didn't want to collect them in the first place."
    e "呃——奥利，你不该把价格稍微降一点吗？你之前还说自己一开始根本不想收藏这些东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_16cbbb93:

    # o "That doesn't mean I'm not going for a better price."
    o "那也不代表我不会争取更好的价格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_dff08d2e:

    # o "And I trust Pirkka here has the gold for it."
    o "而且我相信皮尔卡手头有足够的金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_60cfa99b:

    # "Pirkka smiles at Ole's statement."
    "皮尔卡听了奥利的话，笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_1d73e435:

    # e "Ole, the prose was stolen."
    e "奥利，那份文稿是被偷来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_fd76f75a:

    # "It's only now that Ole's stare turns into some realization."
    "直到这时，奥利的目光才流露出几分恍然。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_07abc845:

    # o "..."
    o "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_861902ed:

    # o "Sorry, old habit."
    o "抱歉，老习惯了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_be468dca:

    # e "I thought Seb was the one that deal with the customers and all."
    e "我还以为塞布才是负责接待客人之类的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_0cffb4f9:

    # o "Who do you think taught him all that."
    o "你觉得是谁教会了他这一切？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_523d5c50:

    # "The lizard chuckles."
    "那只蜥蜴咯咯笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_7c1ed92c:

    # o "Yeah, I'm so sorry for pushing it, Pirkka. I'll take 1500 gold."
    o "是啊，皮尔卡，真是非常抱歉，我刚才太过分了。1500枚金币，我收下了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_46ffb0b1:

    # p "Oh? You are so interesting, Ole. But thank you so much."
    p "哦？奥利，你真有意思。不过，真的非常感谢你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_5d18db9e:

    # "You remain silent, waiting for the two men to settle the deal."
    "你保持沉默，等着两人谈妥这笔交易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_b696d767:

    # p "Very well. 2250 gold it is."
    p "好吧，就2250枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_8f138eaa:

    # p "I've never paid for something this expensive, especially those that should've been mine."
    p "我从没花过这么多钱买东西，尤其是本该属于我的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_a7e6221a:

    # o "Sorry, but I bought it fair and square from a bandit."
    o "抱歉，不过这是我光明正大从一个强盗手里买来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_46ab3aa5:

    # p "No need to apologize, you're not the one who stole the prose from me, if anything I should thank you for willing to give it back."
    p "不用道歉，偷走我文稿的又不是你。真要说的话，我还该谢谢你愿意把它还回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_48d526c5:

    # "Pirkka gives Ole a pouch full of gold, and he's returned his prose."
    "皮尔卡把一袋金币交给奥利，也将他的文稿还了回去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_d0afa833:

    # "Both of them stares at the item they have received, before they shake their hand."
    "两人都凝视着收到的物品，然后握了握手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_a2bbc3f6:

    # p "It's been a pleasure seeing you two, but I should store this precious artifact in a better place first."
    p "见到你们两位很愉快，不过我得先把这件珍贵的文物存放到更妥当的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_11aa9fd6:

    # p "I'll be returning to the tavern soon enough, play the full ballad in front of you."
    p "我很快就会回酒馆，到时在你们面前把整首民谣弹完。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_dd82f3ad:

    # p "May we meet again."
    p "希望我们还能再见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_b4c6f9d5:

    # "The bard flings his lute, and he leaves you and Ole with another simple tune."
    "吟游诗人拨响鲁特琴，又给你和奥利留下了一支简单的小调。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_b21354ce:

    # "Ole nods, he pauses for a few moment before standing up."
    "奥利点点头，停了片刻后站起身来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_8c9962d6:

    # o "Kiddo, ready to go?"
    o "小家伙，准备走了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_92f16cc0:

    # e "Yeah."
    e "嗯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_0aafadbf:

    # "You stare at Ole, who only looks at you with a regretful glance."
    "你凝视着奥利，而他只是带着悔意看了你一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_64b26e3f:

    # "Perhaps you now know him more than what he lets you see, you can only hope it's a good thing."
    "也许你现在对他的了解，已经超过了他愿意让你看到的程度；你只能希望这是一件好事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_c372fb80:

    # e "Ole?"
    e "奥利？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_47b3a55c:

    # o "I'm sorry, [e], but I don't want to talk about this yet."
    o "对不起，[e]，但我现在还不想谈这件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_f468a67c:

    # e "Alright, I understand."
    e "好吧，我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_f5ddc967:

    # o "It's all me, please don't blame yourself for what happened."
    o "都是我的错，请别为发生的一切责怪自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_cdcc843a:

    # e "I- I didn't."
    e "我——我没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Prose_Ask_3f96132b:

    # "Ole nods, he smiles at you before leaving the tavern as well."
    "奥利点点头，朝你笑了笑，也离开了酒馆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_d8da8960:

    # "You hear wheat ruffling from afar, it sounds like it was from the plum tree..."
    "你听见远处麦子沙沙作响，听起来声音来自李子树……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2b276959:

    # e "The thief must be here... right now."
    e "那个小偷一定就在这里……现在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2f386a40:

    # "There's no doubt someone's here."
    "毫无疑问，这里有人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_ad5a8517:

    # "Immediately, You race through the grasses back to the plum trees. All the ripe plums you saw just a moment ago are gone. The thief has already taken them all."
    "你立刻穿过草丛奔回李子树旁。刚才还看见的所有熟李子都不见了。小偷已经把它们全拿走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_16b77fa2:

    # e "F-fuck, I have to catch him..."
    e "该死，我得抓住他……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_7a23f3a4:

    # "You can still hear the muffled sound coming from your left, but you see another trail on the right, freshly stomped by someone."
    "你仍能听见左边传来的闷响，但右边有另一条小路，像是刚被什么人踩出来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_4d379e98:

    # "You follow the shuffling noise, raising your ears to detect the source of the sound."
    "你循着窸窸窣窣的声音前进，竖起耳朵辨别声源。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_ca7d6487:

    # "The sound doesn't fade away, instead it's kept constant as you approach."
    "那声音并没有随着你的靠近而减弱，反而始终没有停下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_d7e3edf9:

    # "You try to stay as quiet as possible, for the thief to not notice you."
    "你尽量放轻脚步，免得被小偷发现。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_def47a4b:

    # "Jog had taught you about stealth in one of your training, but you're not sure if you are ever experienced enough to tail a thief who's probably more skilful than you are."
    "乔格曾在一次训练中教过你潜行，但你不确定自己是否有足够的经验，去跟踪一个很可能比你更擅长此道的小偷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_b0eacb23:

    # "But still, it had helped you figure out how to muffle your own noise."
    "不过，这确实帮你学会了如何压低自己的动静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_afcb5cbf:

    # "You crouch, sneaking just below the small grass while the sound somewhere near you continues walking away from the farm."
    "你弓着身子，贴着矮草悄悄前进；附近的声音则继续渐渐远离农场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_eb8969ba:

    # "Suddenly, you hear a loud cracking sound just below your right foot."
    "突然，你听到右脚下方传来一声巨响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_ae90c3b4:

    # "C-CRACK!"
    "咔——咔嚓！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_feebc0da:

    # "Without further glance, you accidentally step on a flail twig. And for a second, your heart sinks."
    "你没再细看，不小心踩断了一根脆弱的树枝。一时间，你的心都沉了下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_77e63caa:

    # "The pacing noise stops, perhaps someone has noticed your presence."
    "脚步声停了下来，也许有人已经察觉到你的存在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_c264b283:

    # "You are unsure if he has noticed you, but if he does, you'd think you're ready for a fight."
    "你不确定他是否发现了你，但如果他真的发现了，你觉得自己已经做好了战斗准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_35b5e4b5:

    # "Something is awry, he might have already seen you and is thinking of the fastest way to escape."
    "情况不太对劲，他可能已经看见你，正在盘算最快的逃跑路线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_0ccc1edd:

    # "You know which direction he is in, and with certain agility, you might as well be able to catch him."
    "你知道他在哪个方向，只要动作够敏捷，或许就能追上他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_715f03f6:

    # "Perhaps the thief was the one that stepped on the stalks, you choose to follow the trails."
    "也许踩倒那些茎秆的就是小偷，于是你决定循着痕迹追去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_d43ec6ff:

    # "Taking the faint footstep by the flattened plants, you walked for a while that the ruffled sound from the other side stopped."
    "你沿着被踩平的植物旁那浅淡的脚印走了一阵，另一边传来的窸窣声停了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_934b159f:

    # "You are still figuring out which direction it leads to, before noticing that as you go forwards, the trail seems to get more and more obscure, until it disappears at one point."
    "你还在辨认它通向哪个方向，却发现继续向前时，痕迹越来越模糊，最终在某处彻底消失了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_8592c8be:

    # "It leads to a muddy footstep that's facing your direction."
    "痕迹通向一个朝着你这边的泥泞脚印。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_7af317a5:

    # "It was a dead end."
    "这是条死路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_085aa496:

    # "You look around one last time, just to make sure the thief is not nearby."
    "你最后环顾了一圈，确认小偷没有藏在附近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_56d8e85e:

    # "But eventually, you return to the farm empty handed, knowing that the plums are gone, again."
    "但最终，你两手空空地回到了农场，知道那些李子又一次被偷光了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_7662cee2:

    # "You run after the thief, solely based on the direction of the sound."
    "你仅凭声音传来的方向追赶小偷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2a70c8df:

    # "The rash movement you've made immediately reveals your presence to him. Now standing tall, you can see a gray figure hidden in grass and flowers."
    "你这番鲁莽的举动立刻暴露了自己的位置。此刻站直身子，你看见草丛和花朵间藏着一个灰色的身影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_63b28fc2:

    # rbd "S-shit."
    rbd "该、该死。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_c300f281:

    # "You hear a hushed voice just in front of you."
    "你听见正前方传来一道压低的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_55fb5705:

    # "The thief starts running away, he looks relatively small in size, and it seems he runs swiftly just like Jog does."
    "小偷开始逃跑了。他看起来个头不大，跑得却和乔格一样快。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_09c227f0:

    # "You speed up, draining all your energy just to catch a glimpse of the thief. but he doesn't slow down as well."
    "你加快速度，耗尽所有力气，只为瞥见小偷一眼，可他也丝毫没有放慢速度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_5aaee271:

    # "You try to run as fast as you can, and you manage to keep a constant distance between you and the thief."
    "你试着以最快速度奔跑，总算能与小偷保持着一段固定的距离。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_3b31daee:

    # "And eventually, he loses stamina pretty quickly, and you closes distance with him bit by bit."
    "最终，他很快就没了力气，而你也一点一点地缩短了与他的距离。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_e5fa3b4b:

    # "Suddenly, you lose sight of him."
    "突然间，你看不见他了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_66be56f1:

    # "Did he just, escaped? There's no way as he was just here seconds ago."
    "他刚刚逃掉了吗？不可能，他几秒前明明还在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_3fba7c31:

    # "There's no sigh of the thief, anywhere."
    "到处都没有小偷的踪影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_a20cefa7_2:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_1b88f674:

    # "SMACK!"
    "啪！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2a43808c:

    # "Suddenly, an enraged rat just jumps in front of you."
    "突然，一只怒气冲冲的老鼠跳到了你面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_4ddfa7fc:

    # "There's no plum on his hands, instead you see daggers pointing towards you."
    "他手里没有李子，取而代之的，是两把指向你的匕首。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_d15e028b:

    # rbd "Let's get over with it, fool."
    rbd "赶紧了结吧，蠢货。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_0437b980:

    # "You try to run as fast as you can, but... he is faster."
    "你试着以最快速度奔跑，可是……他更快。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_8b181bd7:

    # "It doesn't take long before you lose sight of the thief."
    "没过多久，你便看不见小偷的踪影了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_085aa496_1:

    # "You look around one last time, just to make sure the thief is not nearby."
    "你最后环顾了一圈，只为确认小偷没有在附近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_56d8e85e_1:

    # "But eventually, you return to the farm empty handed, knowing that the plums are gone, again."
    "但最终，你两手空空地回到了农场，知道那些李子又一次不见了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_ab2483f5:

    # "You decide to stand still, not moving a single muscle or making a single sound."
    "你决定站在原地一动不动，不挪动一根肌肉，也不发出一丁点声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_cac58dec:

    # "Somehow, the farm is weirdly quiet for a few seconds. You know the thief is looking around, and you can only hope that he doesn't see you."
    "不知怎么的，农场诡异地安静了几秒。你知道小偷正在四处张望，只能祈祷他没有发现你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_ddc74e25:

    # "The twig underneath your foot is still making faint noise from any minor movement."
    "你脚下的树枝依然会因任何轻微的动作发出细微的声响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_0c47fdcd:

    # "You can only lay your weight onto the other foot, waiting for the thief to continue on their way."
    "你只能把重心移到另一只脚上，等待小偷继续离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_39ad214a:

    # "Something moved, you are sure that the thief has started moving around, perhaps he continues on his path, or perhaps he's trying to search for you."
    "有东西动了一下，你确定小偷已经开始四处移动了。他或许会继续沿着自己的路线前进，也或许正试图找出你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_cc3705a0:

    # "You are not coping with the nervousness very well, sweat pours from the side of your head, moistens your fluffy beard."
    "你不太能应付这股紧张感，汗水从头侧淌下，浸湿了你蓬松的胡子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_e7202fe8:

    # "And now that even a drop of sweat has become so noticeable in such a quiet place, there's really nowhere to hide."
    "如今在如此寂静的地方，连一滴汗都变得格外显眼，实在是无处可藏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2ad49062:

    # rbd "Must have been the... scarecrows."
    rbd "应该是……稻草人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_0b356b44:

    # "The thief mutters softly to himself, you are sort of surprised how pleasant his voice sounds, even if you haven't seen his face yet, you still can't imagine the look of a thief with such a high-pitched cadence."
    "小偷轻声自言自语，你有些惊讶于他的声音听起来竟如此悦耳。虽然你还没见过他的脸，却仍然无法想象，一个语调如此尖细的小偷会长什么样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_1a2d8ee1:

    # "You are more certain that the thief has continued on his way now, you sigh a breath of relief silently, and you continue following the man."
    "你更加确信小偷已经继续往前走了，便无声地松了口气，继续跟在他身后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_25116a59:

    # "This time you are a hundred percent careful, and certain that no twigs can make you fumble the mission now, so you ready your items and weapons, in case the target confronts you any time soon."
    "这一次你格外小心，确信不会再被树枝绊住、搞砸任务，于是备好物品和武器，以防目标很快与你正面冲突。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_cedec611:

    # "Luckily, he doesn't, he doesn't even seem to notice your presence, just walking forward, towards somewhere outside of the farm."
    "幸运的是，他没有，似乎甚至没注意到你的存在，只是继续朝农场外的某处走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_3fbc407b:

    # "You wish to continue, but he's walking further and further away from Jog and Arthur's territories. There's just too much uncertainty."
    "你本想继续跟下去，可他正离乔格和亚瑟的地盘越来越远。事情实在太不确定了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_9e72999d:

    # "You figured out that Jog and Arthur were right, there's no reason for you to venture outside the farm."
    "你终于明白乔格和亚瑟说得没错，没理由跑到农场外面去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_a08d91d3:

    # "Plus, you may get caught out there, and no one could have helped you."
    "再说，你可能会在那里被抓住，到时候没人能帮你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_bfd33d72:

    # "The thief doesn't even know he's being followed, perhaps another time you'll just catch him red-handed."
    "小偷甚至不知道自己正被跟踪，也许下次你就能当场抓住他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_7650dd0e:

    # "Regardless, you give up your pursuit and return to Lusterfield."
    "不管怎样，你放弃了追踪，返回卢斯特菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_a2ee38f0:

    # "You decide to follow him out of the farm, he still doesn't notice your presence in the farm, and by the way you sneak past the grass, you might be able to confront him when he takes a rest."
    "你决定跟着他走出农场。他仍没察觉你在农场里的存在；你借着草丛悄悄跟上，说不定能在他休息时与他正面交锋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_5b1313b2:

    # "He walks out of the field very quickly, and you peek over, just to see who this grey figure really is."
    "他很快走出了田地，你探头望去，只想看看这个灰色身影究竟是谁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_b5115812:

    # "You raise your head, from the back of the thief, he looks like... a rat, with a pair of round ears and thin tails."
    "你抬起头，从小偷背后看去，他看起来像……一只老鼠，有一对圆耳朵和细长的尾巴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_69abd296:

    # "He is covered in fur clothing, a leather mask and hard fabric covering his face."
    "他身上裹着毛皮衣物，戴着皮革面具，脸上还遮着硬布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_fb170082:

    # "Definitely someone that walks sneakily, just like Jog usually does."
    "毫无疑问，这是个走路鬼鬼祟祟的人，就像乔格平时那样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_4e49b14a:

    # "Leaving the field, your means of camouflage is rendered obsolete, he is walking towards the green plains, and there's no way you can hide in plain sight..."
    "一离开田地，你的伪装手段就失去了作用。他正朝绿色平原走去，而你根本没法在光天化日之下藏起来……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_cfbd084a:

    # "You decide to wait it out, just for the rat thief to walk far away from you, and you tails him loosely, often taking advantage of small hills as cover."
    "你决定先等一等，等这只鼠人小偷走得离你远些，再松散地跟在他后面，时不时利用小山丘作为掩护。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_6703dc96:

    # "And luckily, he doesn't ever turn back, just tossing his stolen plums around like a circus show."
    "幸运的是，他始终没有回头，只是像在表演马戏一样，把偷来的李子到处抛来抛去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_46ac16a3:

    # "You continue walking for a long time..."
    "你继续走了很长时间……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_a552d4cb:

    # "Soon, the thief arrives at a large hideout. He casually moves inside, looks around and closes the door."
    "没过多久，小偷来到一处巨大的藏身处。他若无其事地走了进去，环顾四周，然后关上了门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_bb6f064f:

    # "There're flags just floating around the stone building, with dried red paint all over the cloth."
    "石头建筑周围飘着几面旗帜，布料上满是干涸的红色颜料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_6da93bea:

    # "No one's watching the door..."
    "没人看守那扇门……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_9b345628:

    # "You try to get close, listening in on whatever is happening inside."
    "你试着靠近，偷听里面究竟发生着什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_a20cefa7_3:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_fdab432e:

    # sbd "Got the plums?"
    sbd "李子拿到了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_d2c9e120:

    # "You hear a gruff voice from the other side of the wall. It is certainly not from the thief you were following."
    "你听见墙另一边传来一个粗哑的声音。那显然不是你一直跟踪的那个小偷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_e67370e4:

    # rbd "Here are the plums, boss."
    rbd "李子在这儿，老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_c2ef9b75:

    # rbd "Almost got eaten alive by that scarecrow."
    rbd "差点就被那个稻草人活活吃掉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_d5125083:

    # rbd "I think the farmers noticed, I've heard footsteps coming back, maybe we shouldn't go there again."
    rbd "我觉得农夫们发现了什么，我还听见脚步声回来了。我们或许不该再去那里了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_a1983bcd:

    # sbd "Who cares what they think- The hyena's got our back."
    sbd "管他们怎么想——鬣狗会给咱们撑腰。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_6786a57e:

    # "The hyena...? Was he talking about Jog?"
    "鬣狗……？他说的是乔格？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2a859e1d:

    # sbd "I'm gonna beat your ass hard if you don't come back with a handful of plums next time."
    sbd "下次你要是没带一把李子回来，我就狠狠揍你的屁股。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_9bf1ec71:

    # rbd "Yes, boss."
    rbd "是，老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_1c76f4ef:

    # "The bandit with a gruff noise begins chomping on the plums, making loud noises across the room."
    "那个声音粗哑的匪徒开始大口嚼起李子，响亮的咀嚼声传遍了整个房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_c763195c:

    # rbd "Where are the others?"
    rbd "其他人呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_4ca31baa:

    # sbd "We've got some drifters out there, they're handling them."
    sbd "外面有几个流浪者，他们正在对付那些人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_59245112:

    # rbd "Are they all gone? I didn't know we are on patrol today."
    rbd "他们全都走了吗？我都不知道今天要巡逻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_938f7c15:

    # sbd "Everyone else all knew, I just told you to get plums for me, clodhopper."
    sbd "其他人全都知道，只有我让你去给我拿李子，你这个笨蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_256cc3de:

    # sbd "Maybe if you stayed quiet and didn't spoil our plan last time I'd trust you with our shit."
    sbd "要是你上次能安静点，别把我们的计划搞砸，我或许还会放心把我们的事交给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_ff612c87:

    # rbd "Boss! Last time was a mistake, I won't disappoint you again."
    rbd "老大！上次只是个意外，我不会再让你失望了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_8e61fb37:

    # rbd "I promise!"
    rbd "我保证！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_25ef101a:

    # "You can hear a loud sigh."
    "你听见一声响亮的叹息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_226a1387:

    # sbd "It's still early, you should join them."
    sbd "现在还早，你应该去和他们会合。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_ea2bbaa5:

    # rbd "Do I get to keep my share of the gold?"
    rbd "我能留下属于我的那份金币吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2a8f6f04:

    # sbd "Half the share."
    sbd "一半的分成。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_9bf1ec71_1:

    # rbd "Yes, boss."
    rbd "是，老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_9dbd49e3:

    # "You hear the sound of the thief promptly leaving the hideout, and you quickly hide behind another wall before he sees you."
    "你听见那个小偷迅速离开藏身处的声音，在他发现你之前，你赶紧躲到另一面墙后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_01cd8aab:

    # "You sigh a breath of relief, and remember what his boss talked about... Jog. He wouldn't betray the farm's interest for them, right?"
    "你松了口气，想起了他老大刚才提到的事……乔格。他不会为了他们背叛农场的利益，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_9e121e14:

    # "And Jog was the one that got his plums stolen, he was the one that sends you on this mission in the first place."
    "而且，李子被偷的就是乔格，也是他最初派你来执行这项任务的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_14fe1d5b:

    # "There's no way he is complicit with a group of bandits."
    "他不可能和一伙土匪勾结。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_688ed111:

    # "But it does explain why he was so hesitant to share his information with you."
    "但这倒是解释了他为什么一直不太愿意把情报告诉你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_46bfc09e:

    # "But, what if Sebas was right about him?"
    "但是，如果塞巴斯说的关于他的事是真的呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_97d04ca4:

    # "You're still pondering the possibility, but a window flying in your face snaps you out of the train of thoughts completely."
    "你还在思索这种可能性，一扇窗户突然飞到你脸上，彻底打断了你的思绪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_d026e418:

    # "SMACK-"
    "啪——"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_87f71252:

    # "The window pane slaps you pretty hard, and you are not quick enough to react before the bandit boss peeks out of it."
    "窗玻璃狠狠拍在你脸上，你还没来得及反应，土匪头目便从窗户里探了出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_38505796:

    # "A shark's face comes staring right at you, he is covered in leather armor, giving you a weird glance."
    "一张鲨鱼脸直勾勾地盯着你。他穿着皮甲，神情古怪地打量着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_8d39d845:

    # sbd "Who the hell are you?"
    sbd "你他妈是谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_61d6eaff:

    # "It takes a few seconds for you to process that you've been caught, you are still pressing on the back of your head."
    "过了几秒，你才反应过来自己被抓到了，手还按在后脑勺上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_6b6aa51f:

    # e "I'm just passing by this place, taking off now."
    e "我只是路过这里，这就走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_3e49f9b6:

    # sbd "Not so easy."
    sbd "没那么容易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_71abbefe:

    # e "Well, you caught me... "
    e "好吧，你抓到我了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_bc8850bd:

    # sbd "I did."
    sbd "没错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_c9ab8aa0:

    # e "I... uh... am new, bandit recruit, boss."
    e "我……呃……是新来的，土匪新兵，老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2be8f457:

    # "The shark squints his eyes."
    "那条鲨鱼眯起了眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_90df77e3:

    # sbd "Hmm... you look like someone I've seen before..."
    sbd "嗯……你看起来像是我以前见过的某个人……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_e69ff1cb:

    # e "Of course, it's because I'm the new recruit, boss."
    e "当然了，因为我是新来的，老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2008dba9:

    # "Suddenly, the shark's eyes widen, feinting a smile of realization."
    "突然，那条鲨鱼的双眼睁大，仿佛恍然大悟般露出笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_c03c2f5e:

    # sbd "N-no! Now I know, you're the adventurer that broke into our camp earlier! Think you can fool me?"
    sbd "不、不是！我想起来了，你就是之前闯进我们营地的那个冒险者！你以为能骗过我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_82738f6b:

    # e "U-uh... no I'm not."
    e "呃……不是我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_dcfe58a8:

    # sbd "New? We haven't had any new recruits for a while."
    sbd "新来的？我们已经有一阵子没招收新兵了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_a8882e4e:

    # e "Did the others not tell you about me? I'm really good at taking... people's things, boss."
    e "其他人没跟你提过我吗？我最擅长拿走……别人的东西，老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_762beba4:

    # "The shark looks at you with a face full of confusion."
    "那条鲨鱼满脸困惑地看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_add45ee7:

    # sbd "I don't recall any goats being a new recruit... well, you know what you should bring me... right?"
    sbd "我不记得有哪只山羊是新来的……算了，你知道该给我带什么来……对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_1a1a0268:

    # e "Bring you?"
    e "带给你？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_50f35578:

    # "He points at his belly, and the surroundings."
    "他指了指自己的肚子，又指了指四周。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_bd165e37:

    # sbd "Everyone of us know."
    sbd "我们每个人都知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_2bbad634:

    # "You prepare to run away from the bandit, but the shark just jumps across the window."
    "你准备逃离这名强盗，可鲨鱼强盗突然从窗前跃过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_e07e7663:

    # "He lands right next to you, holding an axe over his shoulder."
    "他落在你身旁，斧头扛在肩上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_8b432430:

    # "You walk a few steps backwards, your body is trembling, the shark bandit is extremely bulky as compared to you."
    "你往后退了几步，身体微微发抖；相比之下，这名鲨鱼强盗的身躯异常魁梧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_fc7e010e:

    # sbd "A walking bag of gold, huh?"
    sbd "一只会走路的金币袋子，嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Meet_Quest_d586b4b0:

    # sbd "Now, hand over everything, traveler."
    sbd "现在，把所有东西交出来，旅行者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_1f7a14c1:

    # e "Here's your... rose, boss."
    e "这是你的……玫瑰，老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_8e2d60da:

    # sbd "The fuck is this?"
    sbd "这他妈是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_de8a833e:

    # sbd "You wanna propose or something?"
    sbd "你是想求婚还是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_13e46657:

    # e "Here's your meat, boss."
    e "这是你的肉，老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_c6468503:

    # sbd "Ugh, meat?"
    sbd "呃，肉？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_7daeb877:

    # e "Here's the blue berry you need."
    e "这是你要的蓝莓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_15f4af97:

    # sbd "What?"
    sbd "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_7e5be565:

    # e "What?"
    e "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_512ab907:

    # sbd "You're kidding."
    sbd "你在开玩笑吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_f9e2f36d:

    # e "Here's the apple."
    e "这是苹果。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_96bc7f03:

    # sbd "That looks like the plums I have here."
    sbd "这看起来像我这儿的李子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_8a91b2c4:

    # e "Here's your iron, boss."
    e "这是你的铁，老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_e5ed05bb:

    # sbd "What's this, you think I'm a smither?"
    sbd "你拿这东西来干什么，觉得我是铁匠吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_e5742a86:

    # e "Here's the gold, I have 100 of them, boss."
    e "这是金子，我有一百块呢，老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_d1016510:

    # sbd "T-that's a pathetic amount of gold."
    sbd "这、这么点金子也太寒碜了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_8462dda4:

    # e "Here's the cashmere you need, boss."
    e "这是你要的羊绒，老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_786db37a:

    # sbd "What the fuck is the use of these."
    sbd "这些他妈有什么用？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_5bd3d78f:

    # e "It's for knitting, boss."
    e "这是用来织东西的，老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_d0acf6f5:

    # sbd "You think I'm here to fucking knit a sweater for you like an old grandma?"
    sbd "你以为我他妈是来像个老太婆似的给你织毛衣的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_f29dc1e6:

    # e "Uh... Sorry B-boss... I do not have anything ready, yet."
    e "呃……对不起，老、老板……我还什么都没准备好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_9028e2d4:

    # sbd "Nothing?"
    sbd "什么都没有？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_ebe65b0e:

    # "The shark scratches his chin, his impatient look is beginning to worry you."
    "鲨鱼挠了挠下巴，他那副不耐烦的样子开始让你感到不安。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_b8fea578:

    # sbd "Well that means you don't know shit about us then."
    sbd "那就说明你他妈根本不了解我们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_e07e7663:

    # "He lands right next to you, holding an axe over his shoulder."
    "他落在你身旁，斧头扛在肩上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_8b432430:

    # "You walk a few steps backwards, your body is trembling, the shark bandit is extremely bulky as compared to you."
    "你向后退了几步，身体微微发抖；相比之下，这个鲨鱼匪徒壮硕得吓人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_fc7e010e:

    # sbd "A walking bag of gold, huh?"
    sbd "会走路的金币袋子，是吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_d586b4b0:

    # sbd "Now, hand over everything, traveler."
    sbd "现在，把身上所有东西都交出来，旅行者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_ff3b5c9f:

    # sbd "Whatever, it looks fresh red, that's good enough."
    sbd "随便了，看着挺鲜红的，这就够了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_d9e25c51:

    # e "Fresh red?"
    e "鲜红？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_a01e09a4:

    # sbd "Yeah, red food. Did you not know what you were bringing?"
    sbd "对，红色食物。你难道不知道自己带来的是什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_2a20d799:

    # e "Uh... yes of course, red food, right. I love blood, and stealing people's hard-earned food!"
    e "呃……对，当然，红色食物嘛。我喜欢鲜血，也喜欢偷走别人辛苦挣来的食物！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_c2ebdbab:

    # e "May I ask whose are the blood on the flags outside?"
    e "我可以问问，外面那些旗子上的血是谁的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_5c93c78d:

    # sbd "Blood? We don't do blood here."
    sbd "血？我们这里不搞血。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_050072d0:

    # sbd "It's food paint, we're not killing travelers left and right just to paint these fucking flags."
    sbd "那是食物颜料。我们可不是为了给这些该死的旗子上色，就到处杀死路人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_8e1f59ef:

    # sbd "But they do scare off a few of those pesky local heroes trying to prove their worth."
    sbd "不过，它们确实能吓跑几个烦人的本地英雄——那些人总想证明自己的本事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_45c3dd6f:

    # sbd "Also, why are you asking?"
    sbd "还有，你为什么要问这个？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_7567a411:

    # e "Uh, just curious, boss."
    e "呃，就是好奇，老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_14895990:

    # sbd "Suspicious, but well. You've passed my test, which is the official one, not the riddles those goons been doing."
    sbd "你很可疑，不过算了。你通过了我的测试——这是正式测试，不是那些喽啰出的谜语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_337d2d60:

    # e "Thank you, boss."
    e "谢谢你，老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_81310a5e:

    # sbd "Now, go out and patrol, or whatever you were doing."
    sbd "现在，出去巡逻，或者继续做你之前在做的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_e2a62376:

    # sbd "Don't stand here again. Next time I open the window it's gonna smash your face in."
    sbd "别再站在这里。下次我打开窗户，它就会把你的脸砸烂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_c140f559:

    # sbd "And bring me some red food when you get them."
    sbd "你拿到红色食物后，给我带一些回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_8b6587d6:

    # e "Got it, boss."
    e "明白了，老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_024429c4:

    # "The shark returns back inside the hideout, he casually sits on the table with the newly acquired plums and other food."
    "鲨鱼回到藏身处，随意坐在桌上，身边放着刚弄来的李子和其他食物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_cb25db42:

    # "You stare at the bandit boss, he's just munching down on the food like you're not here."
    "你盯着土匪头子，他只顾大口吃着东西，仿佛根本没把你放在眼里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_6e23df8b:

    # "But he quickly picks up on your glare."
    "但他很快就察觉到了你的瞪视。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_83ffded4:

    # sbd "Get lost, meathead."
    sbd "滚蛋，肌肉脑袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_b4120b98:

    # "You take your leave, and run away as fast as you can. The shark doesn't seem to mind that though."
    "你转身离开，以最快的速度跑开了。不过，鲨鱼似乎并不在意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_82e16557:

    # "What just happened...? Everything happened so quickly..."
    "刚才发生了什么……？一切都发生得太快了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_2922413b:

    # "Are you a bandit now? That doesn't sound like a proper bandit initiation, but to be honest, you aren't sure how bandits are recruited either."
    "你现在算是土匪了吗？这听起来不像正经的入伙仪式，不过说实话，你也不知道土匪到底是怎么招募的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_2639284c:

    # "He does seem to believe you are a bandit..."
    "他看起来确实相信你是个土匪……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_be70da55:

    # "Perhaps you can return here later to see if the shark recognised you..."
    "也许你之后可以再回来，看看鲨鱼是否还认得你……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_80051a5f:

    # "It... would be extremely unlikely that you'd willingly return here though."
    "不过……你自愿回到这里的可能性实在微乎其微。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_ccc46f4b:

    # "...and."
    "……然后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_72fd962f:

    # "Plums. You still haven't stopped the thief, yet. Perhaps you'd have to catch him red-handed later."
    "李子。你还没阻止那个小偷呢。也许之后得当场抓住他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Shark_b7ab094e:

    # "You return to the farm with thoughts about the bandits along the way."
    "你一路想着那些土匪，回到了农场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Fail_3c02012e:

    # e "B-boss n-no...I-"
    e "老、老大，不……我——"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Fail_19727bee:

    # sbd "You're clearly either deaf or aren't my bandit."
    sbd "你要么是聋子，要么就不是我的土匪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Fail_0a3d2a8c:

    # sbd "In both case you're dead!"
    sbd "不管是哪种情况，你都死定了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Fail_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Recruit_Fail_5fd8e39d:

    # sbd "Dead-f..."
    sbd "死、死……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_db97f52c:

    # "As you touch the flute, your vision suddenly darkens as new memories flood your mind."
    "你一碰到长笛，视野便突然暗了下来，新的记忆如潮水般涌入脑海。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_ecca64bc:

    # "Jog lounged atop a pile of hay, twirling his flute absentmindedly, his gaze distant."
    "乔格懒洋洋地躺在一堆干草上，心不在焉地转着长笛，目光飘向远方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_cb0501d9:

    # a "This is a death wish, Lot. You cannot go through with it."
    a "这是在找死，洛萨尔。你不能继续下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_2b2c6b39:

    # "Lothar, perched on a tree stump, waved off the warning with a grin."
    "洛萨尔坐在树桩上，咧嘴一笑，挥手示意不用在意这番警告。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_8f202aae:

    # l "Don't underestimate me, Amble. I'm the hero of Lusterfield! A few bandits won't stop me!"
    l "别小看我，安布。我可是卢斯特菲尔德的英雄！几个强盗可拦不住我！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_18321fc6:

    # "The wolf declared, his voice was brimming with confidence. Amble rose from the wall, shaking his head."
    "狼自信满满地说道。安布从墙边起身，摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_d7497d25:

    # a "That's the problem, Lot. We're not in Lusterfield anymore. If they catch you off guard for even one second, I don't know who can even save you."
    a "问题就在这里，洛特。我们已经不在卢斯特菲尔德了。要是他们哪怕只出其不意地抓住你一秒，我都不知道还有谁能救你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_f72f6088:

    # l "You worry too much, Amble. I will easily make them pay for what they did to our village."
    l "你太过担心了，安布。我会轻易让他们为对我们村子所做的一切付出代价。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_2afbaea6:

    # l "The villagers looked up to me, did you know how much they fawned over me after I said it'd be an easy job?"
    l "村民们都很敬仰我，你知道我说这活儿很简单后，他们有多么巴结我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_38ce7f10:

    # l "I can't let them down after that. Plus, those bandit are just a few stealing thieves, what can even go wrong?"
    l "我已经不能让他们失望了。而且，那些强盗不过是几个偷鸡摸狗的贼，能出什么岔子？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_26021b0d:

    # "Amble sighed, he tried to reason with Lothar, but he couldn't find a word."
    "安布叹了口气，想和洛萨尔讲讲道理，却一时找不到话说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_6e7231ff:

    # l "Hey, Jog, you coming or what?"
    l "喂，乔格，你到底来不来？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_3b1b6731:

    # "Lothar turned away from the big guy to face the lounging hyena."
    "洛萨尔转身离开那个大块头，面向那头悠闲的鬣狗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_4eb0de49:

    # "They briefly exchanged a gaze, and Jog leaped onto the fence, spinning the flute once more before tucking it into his belt."
    "两人短暂地交换了一个眼神，乔格跃上栅栏，又转了一圈长笛，随后把它插进腰带。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_c2f1d372:

    # j "Sure... You'll need me to scout anyway, so let's get this done before the night comes."
    j "好吧……反正你需要我探路，那我们还是在天黑前把这事办完吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_a9e543b0:

    # "Lothar grinned, his eyes gleaming."
    "洛萨尔咧嘴一笑，眼中闪着光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_eacd4199:

    # l "I knew you'd come through! If only Amble here would stop being such a fucking prick."
    l "我就知道你会来的！要是安布这个他妈的混蛋能别那么讨人嫌就好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_27ac3608:

    # l "Guess we'll leave without you then, Amble. Us two will handle this the grown-men way, and maybe we'll even bring you back a piece of that shark meat."
    l "那我们就不等安布了。咱们两个用成年人的方式解决这事，说不定还能带块鲨鱼肉回来给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_42dffa7c:

    # "Amble shook his head, he opened his mouth briefly, but Lothar is already walking away from the village."
    "安布摇了摇头，刚张了张嘴，洛萨尔却已经转身离开村子了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_43339e0b:

    # a "Jog, this isn't safe. You know that, right?"
    a "乔格，这不安全。你知道的，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_5495a5e8:

    # "The logger called out to Jog, who was already halfway to the gate."
    "那名伐木工朝乔格喊道，而乔格已经走到大门一半的位置了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_1e75eda6:

    # "Jog turned, blocking Lothar's view, and whispered in the bear's ear."
    "乔格转过身，挡住了洛萨尔的视线，随后在熊耳边低声说了几句。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_a5e0074e:

    # j "Trust me, Amble. I'll keep him safe. He won't ever set foot inside that bandit fort."
    j "相信我，安布。我会保证他的安全。他绝不会踏进那座强盗堡垒半步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_fb42b0df:

    # j "Not ever..."
    j "绝不会……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_30885a14:

    # "Jog put on his devious smile, before turning around and catching up to Lothar."
    "乔格露出一抹狡黠的笑容，随后转身追上了洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_4a2ab6a1:

    # "The two set off toward the bandits' hideout, trodding past the green grass up the hills."
    "两人朝强盗的藏身处出发，踏过碧绿的草地，向山丘上走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_d313548b:

    # j "So, Lothar."
    j "那么，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_1d864c60:

    # j "What's your master plan when we reach their place? Charge in, sword swinging, and hope for the best?"
    j "我们到了他们的地盘后，你的宏伟计划是什么？冲进去，挥剑乱砍，然后听天由命？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_20ad644e:

    # "Jog twirled his bow between his fingers."
    "乔格用手指转动着自己的弓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_d8073462:

    # "Lothar laughed, striding on the tall grass confidently."
    "洛萨尔笑着，自信地迈步走在高高的草丛中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_f191581c:

    # l "Something like that, Jog. I know they're not expecting us, and I can take them by surprise."
    l "差不多吧，乔格。我知道他们没料到我们会来，我可以杀他们个措手不及。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_f2c763b7:

    # l "You'll be my eyes and ears, right? Make a distraction while I slip in and take down their boss."
    l "你来当我的眼睛和耳朵，明白吗？制造点动静分散他们的注意，我趁机溜进去干掉他们的老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_27f669b1:

    # "He clapped a hand on Jog's shoulder, nearly knocking him off balance."
    "他一巴掌拍在乔格肩上，差点把他拍得失去平衡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_f7b6b963:

    # "The hyena scowled silently."
    "那只鬣狗默默地皱起了眉头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_d9916fcb:

    # j "Is this the famous origin of the Hero of Lusterfield? Sneaking into the most guarded camp without getting caught?"
    j "这就是卢斯特菲尔德英雄的传奇起点？偷偷潜入戒备最森严的营地，还不被发现？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_99d42065:

    # l "Exactly! I'll take their leader's head, and the rest will scatter like rats."
    l "没错！我会割下他们首领的脑袋，剩下的人就会像老鼠一样四散而逃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_7af35009:

    # j "Oh, right. You must be somehow walking stealthier than I do."
    j "哦，对了。你肯定是用了什么办法，比我走得还悄无声息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_10d69e56:

    # "Jog couldn't help but furrowed his brow awkwardly. This was all too reckless, even for Lothar. But he played along nonetheless."
    "乔格不由尴尬地皱起眉头。这实在太鲁莽了，就连洛萨尔也不该如此。不过，他还是顺着演了下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_3cead8bc:

    # "On any other day, he would laugh in front of Lothar's face, and tell him how stupid he was."
    "换作平时，他早就会当着洛萨尔的面嘲笑他一番，告诉他有多蠢了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_a338be98:

    # "But this time, the wolf was stubborn enough to go through with it, and it made him utterly irked."
    "可这次，这头狼固执得非要坚持到底，着实让他恼火至极。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_ca0a41b0:

    # "Jog sighed, his eyes scanning the horizon. The green meadow stretched out before them, a sea of swaying weed."
    "乔格叹了口气，目光扫过地平线。绿色的草甸在他们面前铺展开来，如同一片随风摇曳的草海。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_4b6aa44b:

    # "They are not far from the bandit's camp now, the only thing between them was the vast plain of Prattlefell."
    "他们现在离土匪营地不远了，横亘在两者之间的只有普拉特费尔广袤的平原。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_ae00dcf5:

    # j "I'm going to scout ahead."
    j "我去前面侦察。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_f81e5dd7:

    # l "Wait-"
    l "等等——"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_82a383fb:

    # j "Just stay here Lot. It won't be long."
    j "你就待在这儿，洛萨尔。不会花太久的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_974be182:

    # "Before Lothar could respond, Jog had already slipped away into the tall grass, his form quickly disappearing from view."
    "洛萨尔还没来得及回应，乔格就已经钻进了高高的草丛中，身影很快消失不见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_0e34ccb0:

    # l "Now I'm stuck here waiting... great!"
    l "现在我只能困在这里等着……真棒！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_27eb1d4b:

    # "Lothar stood alone on the path, tapping his foot impatiently, his hand resting on the hilt of his sword."
    "洛萨尔独自站在小路上，不耐烦地用脚点着地，手搭在剑柄上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_3fb8b88d:

    # l "How dare he allowed a hero like me to wait for him, what a witless brat."
    l "他竟敢让像我这样的英雄等他，真是个没脑子的臭小子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_69b6a52f:

    # "As the hero continued to rant, Jog climbed a nearby tree, using its branches to get a better view of the surrounding."
    "英雄还在继续咆哮时，乔格爬上了附近的一棵树，借助树枝看清周围的情况。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_fbb71411:

    # "He crouched low, peering through the leaves to spot any signs of the bandits, but all he could see was the endless expanse of grass."
    "他低低地蹲下，透过叶片寻找土匪的踪迹，但映入眼帘的只有一望无际的草地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_871a6f63:

    # "A grin spread across his face as he spotted something else, a flicker of movement in the distance."
    "当他发现远处还有别的动静——一闪而过的身影时，脸上浮现出笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_e06162b8:

    # j "There they are."
    j "他们在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_882e0347:

    # "Jog glances at the clueless wolf standing alone amidst the tall grass, his fingers brushed the flute at his belt, and he pulled it free."
    "乔格瞥了眼独自站在高高草丛中的那头毫无察觉的狼，手指拂过腰间的长笛，随后将它抽了出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_1127983c:

    # "He brought it to his lips, hesitating for a moment, then, softly, he began to play."
    "他把长笛送到唇边，迟疑片刻，随后轻轻吹奏起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_92c1aee5:

    # "Slowly but surely, a long, grueling whine could be heard, as if it was a wild creature's calling to his mates."
    "渐渐地，一声漫长而艰涩的呜鸣传来，仿佛野兽在呼唤自己的同伴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_495e7053:

    # "Lothar's ears perked up at the strange, yipping sound. He raised his head, trying to locate the source."
    "奇怪的呜叫声让洛萨尔竖起了耳朵。他抬起头，试图找出声音的来源。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_1f3ee005:

    # l "Jog?"
    l "乔格？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_fd8cdad1:

    # "His claws unsheathed, sword tightly held in hand, eyes darting as he searched for any sign of danger."
    "他的利爪弹出，手中紧握长剑，双眼四处扫视，寻找任何危险的踪迹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_19eed26b:

    # "The yipping grew louder, more frantic, and Lothar's heart raced. He could feel the tension in the air, the anticipation of a fight."
    "呜叫声越来越响，也越来越急促，洛萨尔的心跳随之加快。他能感受到空气中的紧张，以及一场战斗一触即发的气氛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_eef5c7b9:

    # l "Who's there? Show yourself."
    l "是谁在那里？出来！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_194318ad:

    # "Jog hid behind the leaves, he watched Lothar's every move as he put away the flute."
    "乔格躲在树叶后，在洛萨尔收起长笛时观察着他的一举一动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_9b960be6:

    # "It was dangerous to put his own friend in a situation like this, but Lothar was too reckless, too stubborn to listen to reason, he thought."
    "他心想，把自己的朋友置于这种境地实在太危险了，可洛萨尔太鲁莽，也太固执，根本听不进劝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_8fdb9e69:

    # "Maybe this will teach him a lesson."
    "也许这能给他一个教训。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_0b6483b2:

    # "Soon, a group of gnolls followed the voice of the flute to the clearing, their eyes locked on to the hero wolf."
    "很快，一群豺狼人循着长笛声来到空地，目光牢牢锁定了那名狼族英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_8f316dbd:

    # l "What the- Where did yall come from?"
    l "什么——你们是从哪儿冒出来的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_12b486ac:

    # l "No matter, just a few small fries like you won't stop me!"
    l "不管了，区区几个你们这样的杂鱼，还拦不住我！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_96754ae0:

    # "He roared, readying himself for battle."
    "他咆哮一声，摆好了战斗架势。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_f666b560:

    # "The gnolls stared at him intently, saliva dripping from their maws."
    "豺狼人们死死盯着他，唾液从它们的血盆大口中滴落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_7c26f639:

    # "The leader gnoll stepped forward, his eyes fixed on the wolf before it."
    "豺狼人首领迈步上前，目光紧紧盯着面前的狼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_222e884b:

    # gnl "Need help, pup?"
    gnl "要帮忙吗，小崽子？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_5f139400:

    # "He growled, and Lothar's eyes widened in shock."
    "那名豺狼人低吼一声，洛萨尔震惊地瞪大了双眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_6c263708:

    # l "Who are you calling a pup, damn it! I am the mighty Lothar, hero of Lusterfield!"
    l "我可是卢斯特菲尔德的英雄，洛萨尔！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_8096c687:

    # "The gnolls laughed, pointing at the annoyed face of Lothar."
    "豺狼人们大笑起来，指着洛萨尔那张恼怒的脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_60d9e210:

    # gnl "Lotta? Gnolls know lotta folks, but no know such name."
    gnl "洛塔？豺狼人认识很多人，可不认识这个名字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_dccf6189:

    # "They growled menacingly, circling around him."
    "他们一边威胁地低吼，一边绕着他转圈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_594a4fda:

    # "Lothar backed up slowly, keeping a wary eye on them."
    "洛萨尔缓缓后退，警惕地盯着他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_93aae193:

    # l "Such arrogant beasts... Fine, have it your way!"
    l "真是一群傲慢的畜生……好吧，那就如你们所愿！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_ed8f38be:

    # "He unsheathed his sword, ready to fight back."
    "他拔出长剑，准备反击。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_68c4a6c5:

    # gnl "Gnolls' way?"
    gnl "豺狼人的规矩？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_00d27f10:

    # "The leader gnoll chuckled, and the rest of them jeered amongst themselves."
    "豺狼人首领轻笑起来，其余豺狼人也彼此嘲弄起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_089b240b:

    # gnl "We chase Lotta."
    gnl "我们追洛塔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_36c025e0:

    # "Suddenly, the gnolls scattered, disappearing into the tall grass."
    "突然，豺狼人四散奔逃，消失在高高的草丛中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_7156972d:

    # l "What the hell are these little wimps doing?"
    l "这些小孬种到底在搞什么鬼？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_315764cc:

    # "He muttered, unsure of what to do next."
    "他喃喃自语，不知道接下来该怎么办。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_db964e4d:

    # l "Show yourselves, evil creatures! Fight me like a real man."
    l "邪恶的生物，给我现身！像个真正的男人一样跟我战斗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_09b58fa0:

    # "He shouted, but there was no response."
    "他大声喊叫，却没有得到任何回应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_b6f77fd1:

    # "He felt a chill run down his spine as he realized that he was truly alone, facing a group of wild gnolls that seemed to be playing a dangerous game with him."
    "当他意识到自己真的孤身一人，正面对着一群似乎在与他玩危险游戏的野蛮豺狼人时，一股寒意顺着他的脊背窜过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_d380e28b:

    # l "You guys better watch out, this is not a joke, I am going to-"
    l "你们最好小心点，这可不是开玩笑，我要——"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_a2d76d41:

    # "Lothar couldn't finish his sentence as he felt something poking his ass."
    "洛萨尔感觉有什么东西戳了戳他的屁股，话没说完。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_2884b236:

    # l "Ouch! What the..."
    l "好痛！什么鬼……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_c6a05c69:

    # "He turned around and saw a gnoll, laughing at him."
    "他转过身，看见一只豺狼人正对着他哈哈大笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_b09479da:

    # gnl "Haha... Lotta no like that?"
    gnl "哈哈……洛塔不喜欢这样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_02be06e8:

    # "It taunted, and Lothar turned red with anger."
    "它出言挑衅，洛萨尔气得满脸通红。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_ab492302:

    # l "I will make you regret that!"
    l "我会让你为此后悔的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_92a1211d:

    # "He shouted as he swung his sword at the wild hyena, but another gnoll appeared, swatting his sword away."
    "他挥剑砍向那只野鬣狗，同时大声喊道，可另一只豺狼人突然出现，一巴掌把他的剑拍开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_59fccfea:

    # gnl "Not so fast, pup."
    gnl "没那么快，小崽子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_ee76db88:

    # "It snarled as the sword toppled on the ground."
    "它咆哮着，剑掉落在地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_af7787a6:

    # j "Lot, I'm back!"
    j "洛特，我回来了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_d2f7155e:

    # "Jog called, shaking Lothar awake."
    "乔格喊着，摇醒了洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_b9cd4c3d:

    # j "Almost didn't make it back alive, those damn bandits found me, and I had to lead them on a wild chase."
    j "差点就没命回来了，那群该死的强盗发现了我，我只好带着他们疯狂兜圈子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_654277e4:

    # "The hyena yawned, stretching his arms."
    "鬣狗打了个哈欠，伸了伸双臂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_4fd604cb:

    # l "What, it's been hours! Where were you? You left me alone out here!"
    l "什么？都过去好几个小时了！你去哪儿了？你把我一个人丢在这儿！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_be397563:

    # "Lothar snapped, rubbing his eyes."
    "洛萨尔揉着眼睛，没好气地说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_89573879:

    # j "Sorry Lot, but you know how it is. Can't let the bandits catch me, can I?"
    j "抱歉，洛萨尔，但你也知道事情就是这样。总不能让土匪抓到我吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_1080e5c1:

    # "Jog shrugged, lying down next to him."
    "乔格耸耸肩，在他身旁躺下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_ca23e364:

    # j "So, were you waiting this whole time... naked?"
    j "所以，你一直就这么光着等着？"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_51a96c50:

    # "He teased, nudging Lothar with his foot. Lothar scowled, looking away."
    "他打趣道，用脚轻轻碰了碰洛萨尔。洛萨尔皱着眉，别开了视线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_bd176de7:

    # l "None of your business."
    l "不关你的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_e9091985:

    # "He mumbled, standing up and gathering his clothes."
    "他低声嘟囔着，站起身来收拾衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_07304ed6:

    # j "...Fine then, shall we continue to the bandit camp? I'll be extra careful this time around."
    j "……好吧，那我们继续去土匪营地？这次我会格外小心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_56546b30:

    # "Jog asked, grinning. Lothar shook his head, putting his clothes on."
    "乔格咧嘴笑着问道。洛萨尔摇了摇头，穿起了衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_02092cd1:

    # l "No way, that's it for me. I'm going home."
    l "才不要，我就到此为止了。我要回家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_0bf814af:

    # "He declared, heading back towards the village."
    "他一边宣告着，一边朝村子的方向走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_16053970:

    # j "Aw, come on! Don't let those bandits get the best of you!"
    j "哎呀，别这样！别让那些土匪占了你的上风啊！"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_a721e853:

    # "Jog called after him. But Lothar didn't reply, he just kept walking, leaving his friend behind."
    "乔格冲他喊道。但洛萨尔没有回应，只是继续往前走，把朋友留在了身后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_672d1c44:

    # "The hyena watched him go, laughing softly to himself as he noticed the wet stain on the back of his pants."
    "那只鬣狗看着他离去，注意到他裤子后面的湿痕，暗自轻笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_bbe5f4e3:

    # j "Gotta clean that up later..."
    j "回头得清理一下……"

translate schinese_rewrite Keepsake_Lothar_Gnoll_993bd2af:

    # "He whispered softly, sheathing the flute into his pocket."
    "他轻声低语着，把长笛收进自己的口袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_6ad987ce:

    # "A considerable crowd has gathered all around the carousal. Drinks and snacks are being passed around, the air thick with the smell of roasted meat, spiced ale, and festival excitement."
    "旋转木马周围已经聚集了相当多的人群。饮料和零食在人群中传递，空气里弥漫着烤肉、香料麦酒和节日狂欢的气息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_b9806eb9:

    # "At the center of the tents stands a large makeshift stage, lit by floating orbs and flickering bonfires. In the middle of it, a short, hooded rabbit stands proudly, cape billowing even though there's barely any wind."
    "帐篷中央立着一座大型临时舞台，漂浮的光球和摇曳的篝火将其照亮。舞台中央，一只戴着兜帽、个头矮小的兔子骄傲地站着，尽管几乎没有风，他的斗篷仍在猎猎作响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_89e1af4a:

    # rb "Welcome, welcome everyone, to the grand opening of Ribba's Ribald Magic Show!"
    rb "欢迎，欢迎大家来到里巴的淫荡魔法秀盛大开幕式！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_820c1a87:

    # rb "Tonight, your twitchy little host will dazzle you with the most wondrous, the most marvelous, the most downright lewd feats of magic you've ever seen!"
    rb "今晚，你们这位活蹦乱跳的小主持人将用你们见过的最奇妙、最精彩、简直下流至极的魔法绝技让你们大开眼界！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_3d7e9af9:

    # "The rabbit's voice is surprisingly loud for his size, carrying easily across the meadow. Despite his height - or maybe because of the cheeky confidence - he commands the entire crowd's attention, yours included."
    "这只兔子的声音对他的身材而言出奇地洪亮，轻松传遍整片草地。尽管个头不高——又或者正是因为那股厚脸皮的自信——他吸引了全场的注意，包括你的目光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_99b0f646:

    # "You stand near the back, craning your neck to get a better view as he begins waving his wand with theatrical sweeps."
    "你站在后方，伸长脖子想看得更清楚些，这时他开始以戏剧性的动作挥舞魔杖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_db24c24a:

    # rb "For my first trick... I shall make this very wand disappear right before your eager eyes!"
    rb "作为我的第一个戏法……我将让这根魔杖就在你们急切的眼前消失！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_589b7dd5:

    # "With a dramatic flourish, he snaps his fingers."
    "他夸张地一挥手，打了个响指。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_a1938130:

    # rb "Boof!"
    rb "噗！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_5349152c:

    # "In an instant, the wand vanishes from his paw."
    "转眼间，魔杖便从他的爪子里消失了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_bfcb1bae:

    # "The crowd gasps, then erupts into applause. You find yourself clapping along as Ribba takes a low, exaggerated bow, ears flopping forward."
    "人群先是一阵倒吸凉气，随后爆发出热烈的掌声。瑞巴低低地夸张鞠了一躬，耳朵向前耷拉着，你也不由自主地跟着鼓起掌来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_599687d2:

    # rb "Not bad, eh? But we're just warming up!"
    rb "还不错吧？不过我们才刚刚热身呢！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_2c72083d:

    # "He grins wide, showing a flash of sharp little teeth."
    "他咧嘴露出灿烂笑容，几颗尖利的小牙一闪而过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_2f8d6d90:

    # rb "Next! I shall conjure dozens of the juiciest carrots... straight from the depths of my mysterious hood!"
    rb "接下来！我要从我神秘兜帽的深处，变出几十根最鲜嫩多汁的胡萝卜……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_135d7dec:

    # "The rabbit opens his mouth wide-impossibly wide-and reaches in with both paws."
    "兔子张大嘴巴——大得简直不可思议——然后把两只爪子伸了进去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_d93831bf:

    # "You watch, half in disbelief, half in morbid fascination, as he pulls out one long, glistening carrot... then another... then another."
    "你半信半疑，又带着几分病态的着迷，看着他拉出一根又长又水亮的胡萝卜……接着又一根……再一根。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_79b418a6:

    # "They're slick, coated in saliva, dripping slightly as they pile up on the stage in a messy, suggestive heap."
    "它们湿滑无比，沾满唾液，堆在舞台上时还微微滴着水，乱糟糟地聚成一堆，透着暧昧的意味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_e61fb6dd:

    # "The crowd cheers louder. A few whistles pierce the air, someone in the front row laughs nervously."
    "人群的欢呼声更响了。几声口哨划破空气，前排有人紧张地笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_9c4a0792:

    # crowd "Was that... actually in his throat the whole time?"
    crowd "那东西……一直就在他的喉咙里吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_fef6a367:

    # crowd "No way. It's gotta be hidden somewhere inside the hood, maybe?"
    crowd "不可能。也许是藏在兜帽里面的某个地方吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_d2d10668:

    # crowd "I don't even care anymore. Keep going!"
    crowd "我已经不在乎了。继续啊！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_d3452b94:

    # "You can't look away. The carrots keep coming, each one wetter than the last, until the pile is almost comically obscene."
    "你根本移不开视线。胡萝卜还在不断出现，每一根都比上一根更湿，直到那堆东西几乎荒诞得不堪入目。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_a556a532:

    # "Ribba finally stops, wiping the saliva off his mouth theatrically with the back of his paw."
    "瑞巴终于停了下来，还故意用爪背擦去嘴边的唾液。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_99e423ea:

    # rb "See? Magic should always leave you a little... moist."
    rb "看见了吧？魔法总该让你多少变得有点……湿润。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_f4a71ccb:

    # "The laughter is louder now, edged with hungrier guffaws."
    "笑声如今更加响亮，其中还夹杂着更为饥渴的狂笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_0d61595c:

    # "He continues through several more tricks - cards that flutter out of his ears and land on volunteers' laps, illusory contours that traces his plump hips under the thin costume."
    "他又接连变了好几个戏法——纸牌从耳朵里飘出来，落到志愿者们的腿上；薄薄的服装下，还浮现出虚幻的轮廓，勾勒着他丰满的臀部。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_aa97cc62:

    # "And a silk scarf that ties the rabbit tightly against the wall, as it teasingly flutters between his thighs all by itself."
    "还有一条丝巾，把兔子紧紧捆在墙上，同时又自顾自地在他的双腿之间挑逗地飘动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_c87c26a2:

    # "With each act, the cheers grow rowdier. More drinks are downed. And voices start calling out."
    "每进行一个节目，欢呼声就变得更加喧闹。更多人灌下了酒，叫喊声也开始此起彼伏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_ac77b526:

    # crowd "Show us something really spicy, bunny!"
    crowd "让我们看看真正火辣的节目，小兔子！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_0970d4b0:

    # crowd "Come on, Ribba! Give us the good stuff!"
    crowd "来嘛，瑞巴！把真正精彩的拿出来！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_154d395d:

    # "Ribba pauses mid-bow, ears perking straight up. His grin turns sly."
    "瑞巴鞠躬鞠到一半停了下来，耳朵笔直地竖起。他的笑容变得狡黠起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_7630fe8f:

    # rb "Oh-ho? My lovely crowds are feeling frisky tonight, aren't they?"
    rb "哦呵？我可爱的观众们今晚都兴致勃勃的，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_e2ef5e40:

    # "He hops to the edge of the stage, leaning forward, voice dropping into a teasing purr that still somehow carries to the back."
    "他蹦到舞台边缘，身体前倾，声音压低成带着挑逗意味的咕噜声，却不知怎么依然传到了最后排。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_da5dbe2d:

    # rb "I hear you. I do. But a magician's got to save the really naughty bits for the encore..."
    rb "我听见了。我真的听见了。不过，真正淘气的部分，魔术师得留到返场才行……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_08dc35c4:

    # rb "Can't show all my tricks up the sleeves so soon, after all."
    rb "毕竟，不能这么快就把袖子里的所有把戏都亮出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_0ba13f07:

    # "He winks directly toward the thicker part of the crowd, though you swear his eyes flick toward you for half a second."
    "他朝人群较密处直抛了个媚眼，可你敢发誓，他的目光有那么半秒掠过了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_fd90b2ec:

    # "The murmurs rise, excited and impatient."
    "窃窃私语声渐渐高涨，既兴奋又急不可耐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_43640fcd:

    # "Still, he straightens up, cape swirling dramatically."
    "不过，他还是挺直了身子，披风夸张地旋舞起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_a3156639:

    # rb "That's the end of tonight's main show! Thank you all for coming - and for coming so loudly!"
    rb "今晚的主秀到此结束！感谢大家前来——还来得这么声势浩大！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_68742eb8:

    # "The crowd roars with laughter and applause. A few people surge forward, kneeling at the stage edge, reaching up to touch his fluffy feet or the hem of his cape."
    "人群爆发出阵阵笑声与掌声。几个人涌到台边跪下，伸手想摸他的毛绒绒的脚，或是他的披风下摆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_8ddf4b61:

    # "Ribba jumps back, swatting their hands away with mock scandal."
    "里巴猛地向后一跳，假装大惊失色地挥手拍开他们的手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_4266e435:

    # rb "Ah-ah! That's not included in today's show! It could be in the next one, maybe."
    rb "啊啊！今天的演出可不包括这个！下次演出或许会有，没准呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_fc9c6cde:

    # "He gives one last flourishing bow, then hops off the back of the stage in a puff of glittering smoke."
    "他最后优雅地鞠了一躬，随后在一团闪闪发光的烟雾中蹦下舞台后方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_49d5bcdb:

    # "The crowd slowly disperses, buzzing with chatter and half-drunken theories about how he did it. Some linger near the stage, hoping for one last glimpse."
    "人群慢慢散去，伴随着喧闹的交谈，以及半醉之人对他究竟如何做到的种种猜测。有些人仍在台边逗留，希望能再看他最后一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_eb8d2dfa:

    # "Soon, you find yourself almost alone in front of the now-quiet platform. The floating orbs dim. Only the crackle of dying bonfires and distant festival music remains."
    "平台前几乎只剩下你一个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_3f91d6b9:

    # "The short rabbit magician is nowhere in sight... but you can still smell the remnant of his salacious scent, lingering in the air."
    "那个矮小的兔子魔术师已经不见踪影……但空气中仍残留着他那股撩人的气味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Show_973a2437:

    # "You wonder if he's already preparing for the next show he teased about."
    "你不禁想，他是不是已经在为自己提到的下一场演出做准备了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_20c5237e:

    # "The rabbit magician is collecting some of his props from the ground, as you approach him."
    "你走近时，那名兔子魔术师正从地上收拾他的道具。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_39d8fed9:

    # rb "Oh-ho! What's this I spy with my twitchy little eye? It's a stranger who wanders in the yonder."
    rb "哦呵！我这双扑闪的小眼睛瞧见了什么？原来是个在远方游荡的陌生人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_6fbcf740:

    # rb "You, yes, you. Are you lost? No matter, come hop closer and help me grab that thing."
    rb "你，对，就是你。迷路了吗？没关系，蹦跶着靠近点，帮我拿下那个东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_cd738eff:

    # "The rabbit gestures to a small pouch lying on the tall shelf. It was right on the edge, but the short rabbit couldn't seem to reach it."
    "兔子指向高架子上搁着的小袋子。它正好在边缘，可这只矮兔子似乎怎么也够不着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_b6c417c5:

    # e "Yeah, sure. Need a lift?"
    e "好啊，当然。要我托你一把吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_809b0e5d:

    # "He crosses his arms, looking up at you with a frown."
    "他抱起双臂，皱着眉抬头看你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_a4eea615:

    # rb "I'm not stooping that low to get a lift, tallie! Just a hand."
    rb "我才不弯腰求你托我呢，高个子！只要搭把手就行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_843fc205:

    # e "Yeah, sure."
    e "好啊，当然。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_6c789994:

    # "You step forward, and reach for the pouch. It was surprisingly easy."
    "你上前一步，伸手拿下了袋子。出乎意料地容易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_5979e435:

    # "It was a small leather bag, with a fake pocket inside that seems to be bottomless. You scratch your head as you hand it to the rabbit below."
    "那是个小皮袋，里面还有一个看起来深不见底的假口袋。你挠了挠头，把它递给下方的兔子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_cb693b07:

    # rb "Boof! Saw my little secret there, didn't you."
    rb "噗！你看到我的小秘密了，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_4f801fd9:

    # "The rabbit snatches the pouch from you slickly."
    "兔子利索地一把从你手里夺走了袋子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_ba74e647:

    # rb "A magician never reveals his tricks, but since you happen to catch it in a happy little happenstance, we'll call it even then."
    rb "魔术师从不泄露自己的戏法，不过既然你碰巧在这么个令人愉快的小意外中看到了，那我们就算扯平吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_dad4370c:

    # e "What's even?"
    e "什么算扯平？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_2353447a:

    # rb "Why, you help me out, and in return, you've seen my little trick."
    rb "你帮了我，而作为回报，你也看到了我的小把戏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_aa4fb683:

    # e "Little trick for a little guy, what does that make me? Two gold?"
    e "给小个子配上小把戏，那我算什么？两枚金币？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_d09e0f29:

    # rb "Hey! Stop with your stupid short jokes."
    rb "喂！别再拿身高开你那无聊的玩笑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_e9541d5a:

    # e "S-sorry! I'm just kidding alright."
    e "对、对不起！我只是开个玩笑，行了吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_3c180394:

    # e "Sorry, I'm in a hurry."
    e "抱歉，我赶时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_9e4b6357:

    # rb "Wait no, hey! Don't be a rude little rutabaga now, wouldn't ask ya if I've got arms longer than my legs."
    rb "等等，不，喂！别这么没礼貌，小萝卜头。要是我的胳膊比腿长，我才不会求你呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_86d46942:

    # e "Nah..."
    e "才不是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_efa5534a:

    # "You watch as the rabbit sighs as he hops a few times more, just barely reaching the pouch."
    "你看着那只兔子叹了口气，又蹦跶了几下，勉强够到了那个袋子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_e319198e:

    # rb "Not in a hurry to watch me stumble, huh? Fine, fine. You teensy little tease."
    rb "你就这么不急着看我摔跟头，是吧？行行行，你这个小小的捉弄鬼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_a4e96f39:

    # "The rabbit grumbles, before he climbs on his own wand and leaps up high enough to grab it. He lands back on the ground with a thud."
    "兔子嘟囔着，爬上自己的魔杖，纵身一跃，终于够到了它。他砰的一声落回地面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_7fe2afd3:

    # rb "How's that? Still got it, don't I?"
    rb "怎么样？我还没老到不中用，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_1cfa71ca:

    # "You clap lightly."
    "你轻轻鼓了鼓掌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_edd21d1f:

    # e "That's impressive for your-"
    e "以你的——"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_ee8946d7:

    # rb "Hey, don't call me short! I know you're thinking that!"
    rb "喂，别叫我矮子！我知道你就是这么想的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_b02faba4:

    # e "No, I wasn't."
    e "才没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_49a1eff3:

    # "The rabbit huffs, crossing his arms."
    "兔子哼了一声，抱起双臂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_05cdec6f:

    # rb "Sure you weren't. I know what you're thinking."
    rb "你当然没有。我知道你在想什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_4e676040:

    # e "I wasn't. Swear."
    e "我没那么想。我发誓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_e2f9f24b:

    # "He stares at you with squinting eyes, until a grin spreads across his face again."
    "他眯起眼盯着你，直到脸上再次露出笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_138db419:

    # rb "Anyway, I'm Ribba, the greatest magician in all of the land!"
    rb "不管怎么说，我是里巴，全大陆最伟大的魔法师！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_6e257199:

    # "Ribba spreads out his arms. A wide grin on his hooded face."
    "里巴张开双臂，兜帽下的脸上挂着灿烂的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_a382c1bc:

    # rb "And you are..."
    rb "而你是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_d81dea2f:

    # e "I'm-"
    e "我是——"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_f48f9495:

    # rb "No, no. Don't tell me. I knew I knew. Yes- oh yes. You are..."
    rb "不，不，别告诉我。我就知道，我肯定知道。对——啊，对了。你是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_9e1a786c:

    # rb "You are [e], right? And a busty courier from the lusty Lusterfield, a must-see, I must say."
    rb "你就是[e]，对吧？还是个来自风骚的卢斯特菲尔德、让人一见难忘的丰满信使，我得这么说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_728a1d02:

    # "The rabbit winks at you, and you feel your cheeks flush."
    "兔子朝你眨了眨眼，你顿时双颊发热。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_711a45c9:

    # e "H-how do you know that?"
    e "你、你怎么知道的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_1c07027c:

    # rb "A magician's secret. Don't fuss about it."
    rb "魔术师的秘密。别大惊小怪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_e7a93ae3:

    # "After a pause, the rabbit feints a mischievious grin as he swirls his wand around the pouch."
    "停顿片刻，兔子故意露出淘气的笑容，挥着魔杖在袋子周围转了一圈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_c85ff08c:

    # rb "Oh, never mind. Fuss about it. Cause I've got your bad little Badge."
    rb "哦，算了。你就尽管大惊小怪吧。因为我拿到了你那枚调皮的小徽章。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_7267d511:

    # "The rabbit suddenly pulls out a small badge, and you recognise it immediately."
    "兔子突然掏出一枚小徽章，而你一眼就认出了它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_9ba13d47:

    # e "That's... mine! How did you do that?"
    e "那……是我的！你是怎么做到的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_fa2fd219:

    # e "It wasn't even in my bag! Where did you get it?"
    e "它甚至都不在我的包里！你从哪儿弄到的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_7bfec14a:

    # rb "Like I said, magic..."
    rb "就像我说的，魔法……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_a5a27d85:

    # rb "It's a good thing you didn't help me, or else I would feel bad about it."
    rb "幸好你没帮我，不然我可要过意不去了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_2914b571:

    # e "Hey! Give that back to me."
    e "喂！把那个还给我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_ee177e3e:

    # "You reach for the badge, but the rabbit pulls it back quickly."
    "你伸手去拿徽章，但兔子迅速把它拉了回去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_2914b571_1:

    # e "Hey! Give that back to me."
    e "喂！把那个还给我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_cebce229:

    # rb "Even though you helped me, you tallies are still due a proper lesson."
    rb "虽说你帮了我，不过你这个高挑仔还是得好好上一课。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_11419299:

    # e "What's a tallie?"
    e "什么是高挑仔？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_116cc863:

    # rb "A tall little tease like you, of course."
    rb "当然是像你这样又高又会撩人的小淘气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_67fc377b:

    # e "I-I'm not even that tall! Have you seen anyone else back in the village?"
    e "我、我也没那么高！你在村子里还见过其他人吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_9adad114:

    # "The rabbit chuckles, shaking his head."
    "兔子咯咯笑着，摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_012b6153:

    # rb "Now, now. Don't be hasty. I can give it back to you, but only if you do something for me first."
    rb "好了好了，别急。我可以把它还给你，但你得先替我做件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_4d13d04b:

    # rb "You see, my audience, I didn't know they're so... excited about the show, horny, to be concise."
    rb "你看啊，观众们……我没想到他们对演出这么兴奋，简单说就是都色得不行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_285c72cb:

    # rb "They wanted to see more of me, and I can't just let the show become all about my cock, can I?"
    rb "他们想多看看我，可我总不能让整场演出都围着我的鸡巴打转吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_ce3a00b3:

    # rb "So, I'll need someone to prepare some props for me. A sweet little treat with fleet footwork."
    rb "所以，我需要有人替我准备一些道具。得是个甜甜的小可爱，脚下还得麻利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_27f0e9b1:

    # rb "You look like you fit the bill, [e]. What do you say?" nointeract
    rb "你看起来正合适，[e]。意下如何？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_13b047f1:

    # e "Sure, I can help you out."
    e "当然，我可以帮你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_df7cfb32:

    # e "Sorry, I can't help you right now."
    e "抱歉，我现在帮不了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_2cbfaeb7:

    # rb "Oh... I see. Well, that's a shame. I'll keep your badge safe though."
    rb "哦……我明白了。唉，真遗憾。不过我会替你好好保管徽章的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_5ee8cfbc:

    # e "What? No, I want it back."
    e "什么？不，我要拿回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_91a8094f:

    # rb "Sorry, can't do that."
    rb "抱歉，这可办不到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_bb77350a:

    # e "Why not?"
    e "为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_347bf33b:

    # rb "Well, I can't very well give it back to you if you don't help me out, can I?"
    rb "你不帮我，我总不能把徽章还给你吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_First_Encounter_f39955ea:

    # "You grumble under your breath, before leaving the stage to the magician."
    "你低声嘟囔了几句，随后把舞台让给了魔术师。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Dialogue_d695eee5:

    # "You see the magician, busy moving around the stage for the performance ahead."
    "你看见魔术师正忙着在舞台上四处走动，为接下来的表演做准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Dialogue_a5ce8c21:

    # rb "Psst! Hey, you! About to ask me something?"
    rb "嘘！嘿，说你呢！正准备问我什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Dialogue_88841c39:

    # e "O-oh, you've caught me."
    e "呃——你发现我了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Dialogue_c14ad092:

    # rb "Ah, my dear little toy! Ready for another day of work?"
    rb "啊，我亲爱的小玩具！准备好迎接新一天的工作了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Dialogue_f1421cd8:

    # e "Yes, master."
    e "是的，主人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Dialogue_7b469244:

    # rb "Oh, my assistant, inquisitive as always. Back for more questions, yes?"
    rb "哦，我的助手，你还是一如既往地爱刨根问底。回来继续问问题了，是吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Dialogue_6977b09e:

    # e "Yeah, I had a few things to ask you."
    e "嗯，我有几件事想问你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Normal_Talk_264ffab5:

    # rb "Yes, master. What do you need?"
    rb "是的，主人。你需要什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Normal_Talk_64e2a26a:

    # rb "Quick, quick. What's on your mind?"
    rb "快点，快点。你想问什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Normal_Talk_6c81ea39:

    # e "Actually, Ribba, you know... I can help you out with the props."
    e "其实，里巴，你知道……我可以帮你准备道具。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Normal_Talk_1eabc85c:

    # e "Alright, Ribba. After a bit of thinking... I'm ready to be your assistant."
    e "好吧，里巴。我想了一会儿……已经准备好当你的助手了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Normal_Talk_3355241c:

    # e "[ribba_title!t], I think I'm ready to choose a prop."
    e "[ribba_title!t]，我想我准备好挑选一件道具了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Normal_Talk_d5b00d9c:

    # e "More devices for the show?"
    e "要为表演准备更多装置吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Normal_Talk_099c29cb:

    # e "[ribba_title!t], are there any other devices that you want me to help make?"
    e "[ribba_title!t]，还有其他装置是你想让我帮忙制作的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Normal_Talk_05606864:

    # e "That's all I wanted to ask. Thank you, [ribba_title!t]."
    e "我想问的就这些了。谢谢你，[ribba_title!t]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Normal_Talk_b4634a5d:

    # rb "Yes, master. I'll be here."
    rb "是的，主人。我会在这里等着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Normal_Talk_5c7901e0:

    # rb "Anytime, anytime."
    rb "随时都行，随时都行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_4150f9c5:

    # e "[ribba_title!t], I'm ready for the show."
    e "[ribba_title!t]，我准备好参加表演了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_bed124c4:

    # rb "Oh, are you now? Well, well. I've planned for a solo show tonight."
    rb "哦，是吗？好啊，好啊。今晚我已经安排了独角戏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_0051ea20:

    # rb "Can't very well have you stealing my spotlight every day, can I?"
    rb "总不能让你每天都抢我的风头吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_6d601511:

    # e "Well... what I am supposed to do now?"
    e "那我现在该怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_6fc3abb7:

    # rb "Watch in the crowd, if you wish, or do something else. You can perform tomorrow."
    rb "你想的话，就在观众中看着吧，或者去做别的事。你明天再表演。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_b2fec3ec:

    # rb "Wait. Wait... where is your costume? To whom will you perform, without your costume, I assume no one?"
    rb "等等，等等……你的服装呢？没有服装你要表演给谁看？我想应该没人愿意看吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_3ebbc183:

    # e "Oh... right. I forgot to bring it with me."
    e "哦……对了。我忘了带。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_2784dc83:

    # rb "Hmph. Go get it then. I can't have you performing without your proper attire."
    rb "哼，那就去拿来。我可不能让你不穿合适的服装就上台表演。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_ec193614:

    # rb "Wait. Wait... where is your costume?"
    rb "等等，等等……你的服装呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_85d67e67:

    # e "H-here! Here!"
    e "在、在这里！这里！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_39fba56e:

    # rb "Oh, do you mean for me to put them on for you...? I did promise that... but never did I figured you'd dare."
    rb "哦，你是想让我替你穿上吗……？我确实答应过……但我从没想过你真敢这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_31e86c2b:

    # e "Y-yes, [ribba_title!t]. Please."
    e "是、是的，[ribba_title!t]。拜托了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_bd823c36:

    # "The magician sighs, he signals you to the chair, and begins to strip off all your clothes."
    "魔术师叹了口气，示意你坐到椅子上，然后开始脱去你身上的所有衣物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_250e0645:

    # "With a slick motion, your bare body is exposed to the open air, and the rabbit brushes his hands all over your fur."
    "他动作利落地让你赤裸的身体暴露在空气中，兔子用双手抚过你全身的毛发。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_0a18ce8e:

    # "He grabs the pairs of the glove and tightly wraps them around your wrist."
    "他拿起那对手套，紧紧缠绕在你的手腕上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_61b128ff:

    # "Then, he takes the corset, and laces it up tightly around your chest, making sure to accentuate your figure."
    "然后，他拿起束身衣，紧紧系在你的胸前，确保将你的身材曲线衬托出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_77e9905c:

    # rb "Lookie there, are you shy now all of a sudden."
    rb "瞧瞧，怎么突然害羞起来了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_7c3484af:

    # "His hands occassionally brushes against your member, and he wouldn't hesitate to give it a light squeeze."
    "他的手偶尔擦过你的肉棒，还毫不犹豫地轻轻捏上一把。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_f2e9aa6c:

    # rb "Hmm, nice and hard, just how I like it."
    rb "嗯，又硬又漂亮，正合我的心意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_477bcd3c:

    # "With experienced hands, he puts thigh-high socks on your legs. Around your neck, he fastens a tie, completing the look."
    "他用熟练的双手替你穿上过膝长袜，又在你颈间系好领带，整个造型就完成了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_3a5641ad:

    # "Finally, the rabbit adjusts the rubber corset around your crotch, making sure it was snug and secure while accentuating your plump chest."
    "最后，兔子调整着你胯间的橡胶束身衣，确保它贴合又牢固，同时衬托出你丰满的胸部。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_2abc0e40:

    # rb "There, all done. How do you feel?"
    rb "好了，全部弄完了。感觉怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_0caecc5c:

    # e "A bit... tight. Isn't it a bit restrictive? I don't think I can move very naturally, or even at all."
    e "有点……紧。是不是太束缚了？我觉得自己没法自然地活动，甚至根本动不了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_c8fdafc5:

    # rb "Well, that's the perfect news - you don't."
    rb "那可真是再好不过了——你就不必动了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_2b444e7b:

    # rb "Look at you, all dressed up and ready to go."
    rb "瞧瞧你，打扮得漂漂亮亮的，已经可以出发了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_c4152381:

    # e "Y-yes, [ribba_title!t]."
    e "是、是的，[ribba_title!t]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_871a5df5:

    # rb "How do you feel? All tight and snugly, I bet."
    rb "感觉怎么样？我敢打赌，你浑身都绷得紧紧的，很贴合吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_af0a10bb:

    # e "I feel tight, yes. The rubber around my crotch... it's like it's squeezing it, just like my chest, they feel so heavy."
    e "我感觉很紧，没错。裆部周围的橡胶……就像在挤压那里一样，和胸口一样，沉甸甸的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_d9ac3d83:

    # rb "Good, good. That's how it's supposed to feel."
    rb "好，好。就是该有的感觉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_a98f5448:

    # rb "Now stop wasting any time and come get prepared for the show."
    rb "别再浪费时间了，过来准备演出。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_af482deb:

    # rb "Right, right, then put on the custume altogether will you?"
    rb "对，对，那就把整套服装穿上，行了吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_2b444e7b_1:

    # rb "Look at you, all dressed up and ready to go."
    rb "看看你，已经穿戴整齐，随时可以出发了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_9b6ac846:

    # "The rabbit signals you to the drawing board, with the available props lying around."
    "兔子示意你来到画板前，周围摆着可用的道具。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_203e5ff5:

    # rb "Which show shall we do tonight?" nointeract
    rb "今晚我们演哪一出？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_8dfef350:

    # rb "Ribba bows his head and waits for your cue."
    rb "里巴低下头，等着你的提示。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_8dfef350_1:

    # rb "Ribba bows his head and waits for your cue."
    rb "里巴低下头，等着你的提示。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_8dfef350_2:

    # rb "Ribba bows his head and waits for your cue."
    rb "里巴低下头，等着你的提示。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_8dfef350_3:

    # rb "Ribba bows his head and waits for your cue."
    rb "里巴低下头，等着你的提示。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_2b776769:

    # e "You know what, maybe I should join the next one instead..."
    e "你知道吗，也许我还是参加下一场吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_9436e799:

    # rb "Oh? Why...?"
    rb "哦？为什么……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_0eb26aef:

    # rb "Alright, don't tell me. I might get jealous. Come back when you're done with your side quests."
    rb "好吧，别告诉我。我可能会吃醋。等你做完支线任务再回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_910fe225:

    # msg "Quest Finished! You gained a level up point! Check your inventory to distribute your points!"
    msg "任务完成！你获得了一个升级点数！查看物品栏来分配点数！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_cc72e962:

    # "You also gained 150 gold from performing in the show."
    "演出结束后，你还获得了150枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_241065f2:

    # "You gained 150 gold from performing in the show."
    "你通过演出获得了150枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_d64f34a8:

    # "You wake up the next morning, at Ribba's tent."
    "第二天早晨，你在里巴的帐篷里醒来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_6259162d:

    # e "[ribba_title!t], about that prop you wanted me to make..."
    e "[ribba_title!t]，关于你想让我制作的那个道具……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_938792f0:

    # rb "Ah, still choosing, are we? Pick one properly first, then I'll do the nagging."
    rb "啊，还在挑选呢？先好好选一个，之后我再来催你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_6259162d_1:

    # e "[ribba_title!t], about that prop you wanted me to make..."
    e "[ribba_title!t]，关于你想让我制作的那个道具……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_4a145ddc:

    # rb "Yes, yes. The prop. What about it?"
    rb "是，是。道具。怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_f612948b:

    # e "What exactly do you want me to make again?"
    e "你到底又想让我做什么来着？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_264e7aa6:

    # rb "Oh... "
    rb "哦……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_6949236d:

    # rb "The Portal Ring. I've given you the recipe haven't I?"
    rb "传送门戒指。我不是已经把配方给你了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_d39c659d:

    # rb "Be careful with these things, nothing happens with one single ring."
    rb "小心这些东西，光靠一枚戒指可不会发生任何事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_489dbb8a:

    # rb "A Growth Potion. I've given you the recipe haven't I?"
    rb "成长药剂。我不是已经把配方给你了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_afbd5f9e:

    # rb "Just make sure you don't drink it, nothing will happen to you but it'll taste really bad."
    rb "只要记住别喝下去就行，虽然不会对你造成什么影响，但味道会非常糟糕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_11c51b83:

    # e "Then... [ribba_title!t], how would you grow bigger?"
    e "那么……[ribba_title!t]，你要怎么变大？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_1df66a56:

    # rb "Like I said, magic is an illusion. Don't fuss about the details."
    rb "我说过了，魔法只是一种幻觉。别在细节上纠结。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_c7aea8bb:

    # rb "A Bondage Box. I've given you the recipe haven't I?"
    rb "束缚箱。我不是已经把配方给你了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_419c9262:

    # rb "Just make sure you make it the right size, you can't very well fit in a box that's too small."
    rb "一定要做成合适的尺寸，箱子太小了可装不下你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_1f69ac7d:

    # rb "Well, I guess you can try, but I don't think you'll like it when I ask my crowd to carry you around."
    rb "嗯，我想你可以试试，不过要是我让我的人抬着你到处走，我觉得你不会喜欢的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_5b3af14c:

    # rb "A Command Controller. I've given you the recipe haven't I?"
    rb "指令控制器。我不是已经把配方给你了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_b7da12fb:

    # rb "Just because I give you control... doesn't mean you should try to use it on me outside of the stage, g-got it?"
    rb "我把控制权交给你……不代表你该在舞台外面拿它来对付我，明、明白了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_fc275967:

    # e "Yes, [ribba_title!t]..."
    e "是的，[ribba_title!t]……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Device_93fd00f3:

    # rb "Good, good. Now, get to work, I need that prop as soon as possible."
    rb "很好，很好。现在，赶紧动手，我需要你尽快把道具做出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_f73d8b51:

    # e "[ribba_title!t], I've made the prop you wanted."
    e "[ribba_title!t]，你想要的道具我做好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_2d8753b5:

    # rb "Which prop, exactly? You need to choose one first, my eager little assistant."
    rb "具体是哪个道具？你得先选一个，我这位急性子小助手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_f73d8b51_1:

    # e "[ribba_title!t], I've made the prop you wanted."
    e "[ribba_title!t]，你想要的道具我做好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_15bac6c8:

    # rb "You have? Yes, oh yes. Let me see, let me see."
    rb "你做好了？是的，太好了。让我看看，让我看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_89350d3a:

    # "You hand the prop to the rabbit, who inspects it closely."
    "你把道具递给兔子，他仔细地检查起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_b1fabe20:

    # rb "Ah, splendid! It's perfect!"
    rb "啊，太棒了！完美！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_6c42fa5b:

    # "The rabbit says as he duplicates the ring with ease. Pulling a ring over his arm, it quickly appears out of the other portal."
    "兔子说着，轻松地复制出了戒指。他把一枚戒指套过手臂，戒指很快便从另一道传送门里出现。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_9e424250:

    # rb "Now, you should be able to use this on stage, excited?"
    rb "现在，你应该可以在舞台上使用这个了，兴奋吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_73db75c4:

    # rb "Oh my, it's the potion I've wanted."
    rb "哎呀，这就是我一直想要的药剂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_edae2eee:

    # rb "No one is gonna call me short after drinking this."
    rb "喝下它之后，就没人会再叫我矮个子了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_c811844a:

    # "The rabbit takes a sip of the potion, and you watch as he grows in a bit of size."
    "兔子抿了一口药剂，你看着他的身形稍微变大了一些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_4ae6aa87:

    # rb "I can feel it, my meat is going to be huge! You'll see when we're on stage!"
    rb "我能感觉到，我的肉棒要变得巨大了！等我们登台时你就知道了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_234647d4:

    # rb "Yes, yes! Such an elegant little box."
    rb "是，是！真是个精巧的小盒子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_f8925670:

    # rb "Perfect size for a goat toy like you!"
    rb "对你这样的山羊玩具来说，尺寸刚刚好！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_e5983c04:

    # rb "You just need to hop in, and put your tight little pucker over that hole, I'll take it from there."
    rb "你只要跳进去，把紧致的小屁眼对准那个洞，接下来交给我就行了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_b484e4ea:

    # rb "Oh! The controller! Such a great design."
    rb "哦！控制器！设计得真棒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_15b7eb03:

    # e "Should we... test it a bit?"
    e "我们要不要……稍微试试？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_8e5ed8e0:

    # rb "W-wait, don't use it on me yet. I'll keep it, until we're both on stage."
    rb "等、等等，先别用在我身上。我会拿着它，等我们一起登台时再用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_6186867a_1:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_050c9546:

    # rb "Thank you, my dear assistant. You've done well."
    rb "谢谢你，我亲爱的助手。你做得很好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_20a10dbc:

    # rb "Now, I think it's time for you to become my official assistant."
    rb "现在，我觉得你该成为我的正式助手了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_adecd603:

    # rb "We will be performing together from now on, and I expect you to be ready for it."
    rb "从现在起，我们要一起表演，我希望你能准备好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_c4152381:

    # e "Y-yes, [ribba_title!t]."
    e "是、是，[ribba_title!t]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_cba62312:

    # rb "Good, good. Now, just come back to me at night, and we'll make a great showing with this nice prop here."
    rb "好，好。现在，晚上回来找我，我们就用这里这个漂亮道具演出一场精彩的节目。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_77f5ace3:

    # rb "Now we have another routine together added to my pockets, yes! The audience is going to love it."
    rb "现在我们又多了一套共同表演的节目，没错！观众一定会喜欢的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_b477db3e:

    # e "Yes, [ribba_title!t]. I'm sure they will."
    e "是的，[ribba_title!t]。我相信他们会喜欢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Device_de0def61:

    # rb "Good, good. We can choose which one we'd want to perform now. Such a good idea, this is going to make a great scene with the crowd."
    rb "好，好。现在我们可以选择想表演哪一套了。真是个好主意，这一定能和观众演出精彩的一幕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_8ff26628:

    # rb "Yes, yes! That's the spirit!"
    rb "对，对！就是这个劲头！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_f5410261:

    # rb "Now, an assistant like you must be properly dressed for the occasion."
    rb "现在，像你这样的助手必须为这个场合穿戴得体。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_f0735449:

    # rb "Here, take this, you'll need to put them on for my show."
    rb "来，拿着这个。你得在我的演出中把它们穿上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_41a10ded:

    # "The magician hands you a few pieces of black and white cloth."
    "魔术师递给你几块黑白布料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_90339fa6:

    # e "Oh, that... doesn't look like a lot of fabric."
    e "哦，这……看起来没多少布料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_3d2ca61a:

    # rb "What else do you want, little tallie, you're here to get the crowd riled up, while I perform my trick."
    rb "你还想要什么，小高个？你来这里就是要在我表演魔术时把观众煽动起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_23498a16:

    # rb "You must put them on before stepping foot on my stage, or... I will put them on for you."
    rb "你必须在踏上我的舞台前把它们穿上，否则……我就替你穿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_dd0ebc56:

    # rb "Speaking of which, I reckon, an assistant should obey his magician whenever the show is on..."
    rb "说到这个，我觉得，演出时助手就该服从他的魔术师……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_92a219f0:

    # rb "Oh Yes! Yes! You shall address me as Master from now on."
    rb "从现在起，你得称呼我为主人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_6018fbaf:

    # e "I... calling you master?" nointeract
    e "我……要叫你主人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_397d689e:

    # e "A-alright, master. I'll follow your order."
    e "好……主人。我会听你的吩咐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_e47cb6d7:

    # rb "Good, good. Little assistant. That's right."
    rb "好，好。小助手。就是这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_6a54e2c4:

    # e "No! I'm your assistant, not your servant. We should be seen as equal partners if you want me to work for you."
    e "不！我是你的助手，不是仆人。要是你想让我为你工作，我们就该被视为平等的伙伴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_4486e88d:

    # "The rabbit raises his open palms in surrender."
    "兔子举起摊开的双掌，做出投降姿势。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_f8b30c76:

    # rb "E-equal? Fine, fine. Call me Magician, or Ribba as you wish... No need to shout like you own the place."
    rb "平……平等？好吧，好吧。你想叫我魔法师，还是里巴，都随你……别一副这里由你做主的样子大喊大叫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_2561d885:

    # rb "Now, to the crux of the matter, we need a new performance routine! Something for the crowd to ogle about."
    rb "现在说正事，我们需要一套新的表演节目！得弄点让观众大饱眼福的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_7e6050fc:

    # rb "I've had several ideas, but none of them I've had the materials to craft..."
    rb "我有好几个点子，可一直都没有制作它们所需的材料……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_b60e2524:

    # rb "That's where you come in, my dear assistant. You will gather the materials I need, and prepare them for me."
    rb "这就要靠你了，我亲爱的小助手。你去收集我需要的材料，再替我准备好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_2d731ba2:

    # "The magician shows you a few stacks of notes, each pile a blueprint for a new prop and device."
    "魔法师给你看了几摞笔记，每一摞都是一种新道具和装置的蓝图。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_New_Prop_Begin_62e7322a:

    # "He flips through them, showing you the sketches and designs."
    "他翻阅着那些笔记，给你展示其中的草图和设计。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_a505015f:

    # rb "Looks like we're out of new blueprints for now. A tragic day for innovation, yes."
    rb "看来我们暂时没有新的蓝图了。真是创新的悲惨之日，对吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_6a4acb26:

    # rb "Yes, yes, I have more shows to perform, with my little toy."
    rb "是，是，我还有更多节目要表演，带上我的小玩具。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_256de67d:

    # rb "Of course, which of the remaining catches your eyes here?"
    rb "当然了，这里剩下的东西中，哪个吸引你的目光？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_ddade3e1:

    # rb "So, my little toy, choose wisely."
    rb "那么，我的小玩具，仔细挑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_9f88ef81:

    # rb "So, which prop do you prefer, partner?"
    rb "那么，搭档，你更喜欢哪个道具？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_dcf95178:

    # e "That one looks interesting."
    e "那个看起来挺有意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_493c68d0:

    # rb "Ah, yes. A classic. With these rings, I can fix it around any part of your body, and it'll poke out on the other side."
    rb "啊，对，经典款。有了这些环，我可以把它固定在你身体的任何部位，然后让它从另一边戳出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_20b37710:

    # e "A-any part?"
    e "任……任何部位？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_6ee32f27:

    # rb "Well, not any part, I can't teleport your insides out. No, ha-... just kidding."
    rb "呃，也不是任何部位，我可没法把你的内脏传送出来。不，哈——……开玩笑的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_31343dc2:

    # e "Is this even safe?"
    e "这东西真的安全吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_39cedd9b:

    # rb "Very. Oh, don't even worry, my dear. You'll feel everything on the other side."
    rb "非常安全。哦，别担心，亲爱的。你会感受到另一边的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_90346bb2:

    # e "What about this, the growth potion?"
    e "那这个呢，成长药剂？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_e9497aad:

    # rb "Oh, this recipe is special, with it I can finally be as big as I'd like, not that I'm not already big..."
    rb "哦，这个配方很特别。有了它，我终于能长到自己想要的大小了——当然，我现在也已经够大了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_4fc8face:

    # rb "This way, I can finally get revenge on those tallies, all 'em bullies who tried to mock my height."
    rb "这样一来，我终于能向那些高个子报仇了，那些曾经嘲笑我身高的恶霸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_199dd881:

    # rb "...who will be played by you, of course."
    rb "……当然由你来扮演。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_dfd7494e:

    # "You gulp nervously, on the blueprint it depicts a very huge Ribba... and a bite size... you."
    "你紧张地咽了口唾沫；蓝图上画着一个巨大无比的里巴……还有一个迷你尺寸的……你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_b021180f:

    # e "What's the use of this box?"
    e "这个箱子有什么用？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_f5c6f251:

    # rb "Oh, this is no ordinary box, its size is perfectly fit for your body only. leaving marginally no space inside."
    rb "哦，这可不是普通的箱子，大小只刚好容得下你的身体，里面几乎一点空隙都不留。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_11bed0a7:

    # rb "Just hop in, and try your best to fit in, you'll be packed like a compact size, easy-to-carry suitcase that you are."
    rb "只管跳进去，尽量把自己塞进去，你会被压成一个小巧、方便携带的行李箱大小。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_6090dd32:

    # e "What's that hole down there then?"
    e "那下面的洞又是做什么的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_41c03806:

    # rb "Well, obviously a traveller would have pent up urge needing to release, so all they need is to insert his cock into this hole of you."
    rb "很明显，旅行者总会有憋着的欲望需要释放，所以只要把他的肉棒插进你身上的这个洞里就行了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_7db7febe:

    # e "This one doesn't even look like anything I've seen before."
    e "这个看起来甚至不像我以前见过的任何东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_c84993fe:

    # rb "Because it's my design! Well, due to the popular demand of my dear crowd, I... I might be subjected to this little gadget's control."
    rb "因为这是我的设计！不过，应我亲爱的观众们强烈要求，我……我可能得接受这个小装置的控制。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_8122d816:

    # rb "If you make this, I'll give the ownership of this device to you. B-but only for the purpose of the performance only."
    rb "要是你把它做出来，我就把这个装置的所有权给你。可、可这只能用于表演。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_205e8145:

    # e "Alright, but what does this one do actually?"
    e "好吧，不过这一个到底是做什么的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_55824a47:

    # rb "It's a device to control one's mind. To make him do anything as the owner wishes."
    rb "这是用来控制人的思想的装置。能让他做出主人想让他做的任何事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_1719690c:

    # e "A-anything?"
    e "任、任何事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_bf2fbaeb:

    # rb "I have to preface this, this is all illusions, just a performance. I do mind, if you control my mind outside of the stage..."
    rb "我得先说清楚，这一切都是幻术，只是一场表演。要是你在舞台之外控制我的思想，我可不接受……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_c1a3b9de:

    # e "I'll think about it."
    e "我会考虑一下的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_2b678d76:

    # rb "Well, well? Don't sleep on it, whatever that prop is, that is."
    rb "嗯？别磨蹭了，不管那究竟是什么道具。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_df3d6dd4:

    # rb "So?" nointeract
    rb "所以呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_e1dea96b:

    # e "Okay, I'll make this one."
    e "好吧，我就做这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_d5ed0841:

    # rb "So, the Portal Ring it is then."
    rb "那就选传送门戒指了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_27523d34:

    # rb "Right, my next performance will be the Growth Potion."
    rb "我下一场表演会用成长药剂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_fa25bf54:

    # rb "A Bondage Box, alright."
    rb "束缚箱，行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_79353a4a:

    # rb "Ah, the Command Controller... interesting."
    rb "啊，指令控制器……有意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_05639f26:

    # rb "Wait. Which one did you mean again? Choose a prop first, then we can make it official."
    rb "等等，你刚才说的是哪个来着？先选一个道具，然后我们才能正式确定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_972cd0a8:

    # rb "Great, then I shall give you the recipe you need. And you'll prep my prop."
    rb "太好了，那我就把你需要的配方给你。你来准备我的道具。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_92d190ff:

    # "The magician explains as he hands you the blueprint, detailing the ingredients required."
    "魔术师一边把蓝图递给你，一边解释所需的材料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_f1421cd8:

    # e "Yes, master."
    e "是，主人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_e0e8f67b:

    # e "Alright, I'll be back with everything you need."
    e "好的，我会把你需要的一切带回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_bc793fab:

    # rb "On you go then, shoo shoo."
    rb "你去吧，去吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_b7477923:

    # e "How about the other ones?"
    e "那其他的呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Choosing_Devices_e0820ee7:

    # rb "Be my guest!"
    rb "请便！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_a1e2b6b3:

    # rb "Yes, yes. The Command Controller. A very special little prop for a very curious crowd."
    rb "指令控制器"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_65248665:

    # rb "And one that makes me a touch nervous, nevertheless."
    rb "不过，这东西还是让我有点紧张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_3b37736f:

    # "Backstage, Ribba turns the metal device over in his paws, checking each button and crystal with unusual care."
    "在后台，里巴用爪子翻看着金属装置，格外仔细地检查每个按钮和水晶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_12055fef:

    # "It is small enough to fit in one hand, but it looks far more serious than Ribba's usual props."
    "它小得一只手就能握住，但看起来比里巴平时使用的道具严肃得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_fa65d38f:

    # rb "Now lend me those ears of yours, assistant. Once the show begins, this little gizmo only works on me while I'm on stage."
    rb "现在，把你的耳朵借我用用，助手。演出开始后，这个小玩意只有在我登台时才能对我起作用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_bac11695:

    # rb "For two hours, it listens to the one holding it. After that, boof, I'm back to my usual self."
    rb "它会听从持有者两个小时。之后，噗，我就恢复平常的自己了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_98491273:

    # e "So no matter what happens during the show, you'll snap out of it after two hours?"
    e "所以不管演出中发生什么，两个小时后你都会恢复过来？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_3425a52c:

    # rb "Exactly. I'm not stupid enough to let you take me over for the rest of time."
    rb "没错。我还没蠢到会让你永远控制我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_af9f8cec:

    # rb "And, I've curated a set of acceptable commands for you. Anything outside of those are forbidden."
    rb "还有，我已经为你挑选了一套可接受的命令。除此之外的任何命令都禁止。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_eed475b3:

    # "Ribba exhales slowly, ears drooping for a moment before he squares his shoulders again."
    "里巴缓缓呼气，耳朵耷拉了片刻，随后又挺起肩膀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_d0fca595:

    # rb "Still... while it's humming along, if you press a command, I will have to follow through."
    rb "不过……只要它还在嗡嗡运转，你按下命令，我就必须照做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_4d21e809:

    # rb "So keep that clever little head of yours clear, and stick to the script."
    rb "所以，保持你那颗机灵的小脑袋清醒，照剧本来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_d4d96dbb:

    # e "Doesn't it sound a little dangerous, still?"
    e "这样听起来还是有点危险，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_baeb4538:

    # rb "Yes, yes, but a magician who never risks a thing is just a juggler with a prettier cape."
    rb "对，对，不过一个什么风险都不愿冒的魔术师，不过是披着更漂亮斗篷的杂耍演员。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_e8d47833:

    # rb "More importantly, keep those eyes peeled for the bars when the act begins. Three of them."
    rb "更重要的是，演出开始时盯紧那三条数值条。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_0102a2ca:

    # rb "My Willpower, my Lust, and Hype. Those are tonight's little scorecards, if you will."
    rb "我的意志力、欲望和热度。要是你愿意这么说，它们就是今晚的小计分板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_9d2f2d12:

    # e "Alright."
    e "好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_da0fe58a:

    # rb "And listen carefully here. Do not let my Willpower drop to zero. No jokes on that one."
    rb "仔细听好了。别让我的意志力降到零。这个可不是开玩笑的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_6509c443:

    # rb "If that bar empties out, bad things may happen, and I'd rather not find out how bad in front of a paying audience."
    rb "要是那条数值条清空，可能会发生糟糕的事，我可不想在付费观众面前弄清楚到底能糟糕到什么程度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_4bd4a7ca:

    # e "You think it could actually go that wrong?"
    e "你觉得真的会糟到那种地步？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_e71b1d34:

    # rb "I have no idea what's gonna happen, but I don't wanna find out."
    rb "我完全不知道会发生什么，但我可不想知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_07039b66:

    # rb "My Lust bar should be obvious enough, yes? The higher it climbs, the closer I'm getting to cum. Simple, simple."
    rb "我的欲望条应该够明显了吧？它涨得越高，就说明我离射精越近。简单，简单。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_0ad113d5:

    # e "That is not simple at all."
    e "这一点根本不简单。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_7704e0d6:

    # rb "No, but it is exciting, so stay close and let me do the talking until it's time for the demonstration."
    rb "是不简单，但这很刺激，所以靠近些，在演示开始前都由我来说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_df47e0d9:

    # e "Right. You start with the intro, and I watch the bars once the controller is live."
    e "我来盯着那些数值条。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_2047f00e:

    # rb "Exactly."
    rb "正是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_68a30734:

    # "You take your place near the curtain while the carousal fills with onlookers."
    "旋转木马周围渐渐挤满了围观者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_823adce3:

    # "Bonfires crackle, drinks are passed between paws, and a low hum of anticipation rolls through the grounds."
    "火堆噼啪作响，饮品在一只只爪子间传递，低沉的期待嗡鸣席卷整个场地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_2048aa5c:

    # "Ribba steps into the light with his usual flourish, cape swishing behind him."
    "里巴一如既往地夸张亮相，披风在身后猎猎作响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_838f62f8:

    # rb "Welcome back, my lovely lads! To another Ribba's Ribald Magic Show!"
    rb "欢迎回来，我可爱的伙计们！又一场里巴的荤魔术秀开始了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_a5a2defb:

    # "The audience answers with cheers, whistles, and eager laughter."
    "观众以欢呼、口哨和迫不及待的笑声回应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_cf2c467e:

    # rb "Tonight's finale is not just magic trick or illusion, or even my naturally impeccable stage presence."
    rb "今晚的压轴可不只是魔术或幻术，甚至也不只是我与生俱来的无可挑剔的舞台魅力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_332f4e68:

    # rb "No, tonight we explore something far more mysterious: control."
    rb "不，今晚我们要探索的是更加神秘莫测的东西：控制。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_e16b3373:

    # "He raises the device above his head. Its crystals catch the firelight, sending thin glimmers over the faces in the front row."
    "他将装置举过头顶。装置上的水晶映着火光，向前排观众的脸上投去细细的微光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_6b4cd936:

    # crowd "What's that thing?"
    crowd "那是什么东西？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_6f915f39:

    # crowd2 "Looks expensive. Or dangerous."
    crowd2 "看起来很贵。也可能很危险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_90a101e0:

    # rb "Ah-ah, insightful. This, my dear audience, is tonight's special little prop."
    rb "啊哈，真有洞察力。亲爱的观众们，这就是今晚特别的小道具。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_5eccd618:

    # rb "And rather than spoil the trick, I'd much rather show you what it can do."
    rb "与其提前揭穿这个戏法，我更愿意让你们看看它能做什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_1ac0e6d8:

    # "The reveal earns a fresh wave of anticipation, and the crowd leans in all the same."
    "这一揭晓再次掀起一阵期待，人群也不约而同地探身向前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_2457827d:

    # rb "And because every good experiment needs a brave and charming assistant..."
    rb "而且每场精彩的实验都需要一位勇敢又迷人的助手……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_e09bdc23:

    # rb "I have brought my own dear helper to the stage once again."
    rb "我又一次把我亲爱的助手带上了舞台。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_18ed9cc7:

    # "He gestures for you to step forward."
    "他示意你上前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_87639077:

    # rb "And because I am feeling especially generous, reckless, and confident tonight, I shall be the one under its effects."
    rb "今晚我格外慷慨、鲁莽又自信，所以就由我来承受它的影响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_4839d7fc:

    # crowd "You're letting him control you?"
    crowd "你要让他控制你？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_aa600e65:

    # crowd2 "No way. He's bluffing."
    crowd2 "不可能。他在虚张声势。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_c9b1efa5:

    # rb "Maybe I am. Maybe I'm teasing and acting. That's why you're all here, isn't it?"
    rb "也许吧。也许我是在逗你们、演戏。你们不就是因此全都聚在这里吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_ab17408c:

    # "Ribba circles around you once, making a show of inspecting your stance while keeping the controller visible to the audience."
    "里巴绕着你转了一圈，装模作样地检查你的站姿，同时让观众始终看得见手里的控制器。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_2716c6b5:

    # rb "Now then, no peeking behind the curtain. My assistant and I will handle the fiddly bits, and you lot can focus on being properly amazed."
    rb "那么，别偷看帷幕后面。我和我的助手会处理那些琐碎的细节，你们只管好好惊叹就行了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_2d99ad2d:

    # rb "We'll begin with something simple. No more stalling."
    rb "我们先从简单的开始。别再拖延了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_c7cdf2e6:

    # "The crowd quiets as Ribba lifts one thumb over the controller's top button."
    "人群安静下来，里巴将一根拇指悬在控制器顶部的按钮上方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_9ed4fc80:

    # rb "Eyes forward. Let's get on with it."
    rb "都看前面。我们继续。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Magic_Show_Command_Controller_Intro_5f113f20:

    # "Ribba's first command begins at once, and the audience leans forward in perfect silence."
    "里巴的第一个指令立即开始，观众在一片寂静中纷纷探身向前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Carrot_f3891180:

    # e "About the carrots you wanted, where should I get them?"
    e "你想要的胡萝卜，我该去哪里弄？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Carrot_c54761c4:

    # rb "Carrots, yes. Fresh carrots, I wonder..."
    rb "胡萝卜啊，对。新鲜的胡萝卜，不知道……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Carrot_f26e3439:

    # "The magician ponders as he strokes his invisible chin under the hood."
    "魔术师在兜帽下抚摸着自己那不存在的下巴，陷入沉思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Carrot_9d208b2b:

    # rb "Aha, the dark forest! That's where the best carrots grow, yes! Juicy, crunchy, and sweet."
    rb "啊，黑暗森林！那里长着最好的胡萝卜，对！汁多、爽脆又香甜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Carrot_e3d6be96:

    # rb "You can find them just inside, somewhere where the caproots grow. Pick'em up or fight'em."
    rb "就在里面不远处，找找帽根生长的地方。把它们捡起来，或者跟它们打一架。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Carrot_bd7711e4:

    # e "Got it, I'll head there now."
    e "明白了，我现在就去那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Carrot_52319b88:

    # rb "Wonderful! Also, in case you were wondering, I did not pull those carrots out of thin air."
    rb "太好了！顺便说一句，如果你正好想知道，我可不是凭空变出那些胡萝卜的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Ask_Carrot_2593db75:

    # "He winks."
    "他眨了眨眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_92d8d0a8:

    # e "Ribba, here's all the carrots you need."
    e "里巴，这些就是你要的全部胡萝卜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_71068de0:

    # "You pull out 6 carrots from your bag, and hand them to the magician."
    "你从包里拿出6根胡萝卜，递给魔术师。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_00acd883:

    # rb "Great, Splendid! These will do just fine."
    rb "太好了，妙极了！这些完全够用了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_36768826:

    # e "Are you sure 6 is enough, last time I saw, you pulled out... at least 30 ones from your mouth."
    e "你确定6根够吗？上次我看到你从嘴里掏出来的……至少有30根。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_10234148:

    # rb "Oh, don't you worry, I can always duplicate them with my magic."
    rb "哦，别担心，我随时可以用魔法把它们复制出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_d2e6fb82:

    # "The magician covers the carrot in his hand, and with a snap of his fingers, the amount of carrots on the top suddenly doubles."
    "魔术师用手盖住手里的胡萝卜，随后打了个响指，顶上的胡萝卜数量突然翻倍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_e09c9dfa:

    # rb "There you go, now I have enough for the show."
    rb "好了，这下演出所需的胡萝卜够了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_5b2e1937:

    # rb "Here, take your badge back, and a little something extra for your trouble."
    rb "给，拿回你的徽章吧，另外再给你一点辛苦费。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_6aa6107b:

    # e "Well, thank you, Ribba, I was worried you were about to have me go on another errand."
    e "嗯，谢谢你，里巴。我还担心你要让我再跑一趟呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_0d5186a6:

    # rb "Nonsense, nonsense. You did well, [e]."
    rb "胡说，胡说。你做得很好，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_072682c3:

    # "The magician hands you back your courier badge, along with a small pouch of coins."
    "魔法师把你的信使徽章还给你，还附带一小袋硬币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_85504512:

    # rb "Now, this is where the show gets exciting. You see, I need a proper propper to help me with... getting my audience excited."
    rb "现在，演出的精彩之处就要来了。你看，我需要一个靠谱的道具师来帮我……让观众兴奋起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_864b0ee1:

    # rb "So I was thinking, maybe I might as well get an assistant for the show. Someone with a nice pair of chest and balls."
    rb "所以我在想，或许我也该找个演出助手。得是那种胸脯和蛋蛋都漂亮的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_02f269f4:

    # rb "What do you say, [e]? Care to join me on stage?"
    rb "你觉得呢，[e]？愿意和我一起登台吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_ca1a6cb6:

    # e "S-sure, why not. It sounds fun."
    e "当、当然，为什么不呢。听起来挺有趣的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_a624da26:

    # e "I think I'll pass, Ribba. I'm not really cut out for performing."
    e "我还是算了吧，里巴。我不太适合表演。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_ef9c5c76:

    # rb "Oh... I see. Well, maybe some other time then."
    rb "哦……我明白了。好吧，那就下次再说吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_1c98f71d:

    # rb "Anyway, I don't think I'll bother finishing your quest... yes, that quest on your journal will always stay unfinished..."
    rb "算了，我看我也不打算完成你的任务了……没错，你日志里的那个任务会一直处于未完成状态……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_5b36e864:

    # rb "But at least you can keep the badge and the money."
    rb "不过至少徽章和钱你可以留着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_b0083a65:

    # e "W-what? You don't have to do that."
    e "什、什么？你没必要这么做的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Report_Carrot_eeb2192b:

    # rb "You can always come back, any time for sure, if you've changed your little mind."
    rb "你随时都可以回来，只要你改变了小小的主意，什么时候都行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Accept_7ed5be0e:

    # rb "Yes, yes! You're such a doll, [e]."
    rb "好，好！你真是个小可爱，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Accept_a2eb99d2:

    # rb "Now, listen closely. For the every performance I can show, I'll need some proper props propped by you, the propper."
    rb "现在听好了。我能上演的每一场演出，都需要你这个道具师把合适的道具准备好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Accept_4f30a7b6:

    # rb "But first, for our first step, you'll need to bring me some carrots. The juicer the better."
    rb "不过首先，第一步是你得给我带些胡萝卜来。越多汁越好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Accept_abc98b00:

    # rb "Bring them to me, and I'll give you your badge back, plus a little something extra for your trouble."
    rb "把它们带给我，我就会把你的徽章还给你，另外再给你一点辛苦费。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Accept_fcab66fd:

    # e "Alright, I'll get them for you."
    e "好吧，我会帮你弄来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Accept_b1d555bc:

    # rb "Wonderful! I'll be waiting here, show will start at night, so don't take too long now."
    rb "太棒了！我会在这里等着。演出将在晚上开始，所以可别磨蹭太久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Accept_f273262d:

    # e "I won't. See you later, Ribba."
    e "不会的。回头见，里巴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Accept_e707a3c4:

    # rb "On you go! Chop Chop!"
    rb "去吧！快去快去！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Prop_Quest_Accept_8594509d:

    # "You turn around and leave Ribba to himself."
    "你转身离开，把里巴一个人留在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_c21fb9a2:

    # e "If I may ask, how did your magic come to be, Ribba?"
    e "如果你不介意的话，我想问问，你的魔法是怎么来的，里巴？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_20d1a582:

    # "Ribba lowers his head slightly, ears twitching with hesitation."
    "里巴微微低下头，耳朵因犹豫而轻轻抽动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_63108f46:

    # rb "Oh... that truth, is it? Yes, yes. If master wants it, I'll tell it plainly."
    rb "如果主人想听，我就直说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_62b8af3a:

    # "His voice is soft and obedient, though a trace of his old theatrical lilt still clings to the words."
    "他的声音轻柔而顺从，尽管话语间仍残留着一丝往日舞台腔的抑扬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_a766530b:

    # rb "The past me would've hidden it behind a trick. But if you ask, I answer."
    rb "过去的我会把真相藏在戏法背后。但既然你问了，我就回答。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_baec1ed8:

    # rb "My magic... it isn't tricks. Not really."
    rb "我的魔法……不是戏法。至少不完全是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_1c46171e:

    # "He touches the center of his chest, right beneath the cloak."
    "他抬手触碰斗篷正下方的胸口中央。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_a49473ab:

    # rb "A shard from the old war found me when I was young, and boof... that was that."
    rb "很久以前那场战争的碎片在我年幼时找上了我，然后砰……事情就成了这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_5227eaf2:

    # rb "It didn't leave me as something plain and mortal after."
    rb "它之后没让我变成一个普通的凡人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_356e5419:

    # rb "Since then, magic has sat closer to me than blood does."
    rb "从那以后，魔法就比血液更贴近我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_5d23cfa6:

    # rb "The stage steadies it. Or steadies me. Hard to tell which is which now, especially when you're watching."
    rb "舞台能让它稳定下来。或者，是让我的状态稳定下来。现在很难分清究竟是哪一个，尤其是在你注视着我的时候。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_6fcf311a:

    # rb "...When people watch, I feel more real."
    rb "……有人注视时，我会觉得自己更加真实。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_01f14528:

    # e "So the carrots, the floating crystals, everything...?"
    e "所以胡萝卜、漂浮的水晶，还有这一切……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_3584eb85:

    # rb "Real enough to hold, or maybe taste. It was no illusions. The magic gives them shape... much the same way it gives me mine."
    rb "真实到足以拿在手里，或许还能尝到味道。那可不是幻觉。魔法赋予它们形体……就像它赋予我自身形体一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_08e1a3a0:

    # "He hesitates again, his voice quieter now."
    "他又犹豫了一下，声音也低了些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_56f76075:

    # rb "The magic can only last for a short while, if anything is to interfere, it would go very wrong in very different ways."
    rb "魔法只能维持很短一段时间，要是有什么东西干扰它，事情就会以截然不同的方式变得非常糟糕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_b375cd56:

    # "He bows his head gently, waiting for your reaction."
    "他轻轻低下头，等待你的反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_60955d41:

    # rb "I've never told anyone else, but... for you, master, the words come easy."
    rb "我从没告诉过其他任何人，但是……对你，主人，这些话说起来很容易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_3449d012:

    # "You shudder, unsure how to respond."
    "你打了个寒颤，不知该如何回应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_da0fcea5:

    # e "Uh... is that what caused you to be... so obedient?"
    e "呃……是那让你变得……如此听话的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_dbe45afb:

    # "Ribba nods."
    "里巴点点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_3f82b620:

    # rb "Was that enough? If you ask for more, I'll give it."
    rb "这样够了吗？如果你还想听，我会告诉你更多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_a0d188c1:

    # e "If I may ask, how did your magic come to be, [ribba_title!t]?"
    e "如果可以的话，我想问问，你的魔法是怎么来的，[ribba_title!t]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_acc2a9ec:

    # rb "Gettin- curious, aren't you. Yes, yes. I like that."
    rb "你开始好奇了——不是吗？是，是的。我喜欢这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_5bbbe952:

    # rb "Well. My magic, it's different from all those wanton wanna-be wand wavers out there."
    rb "嗯。我的魔法和外面那些放荡的、妄想成为魔法师的挥杖家伙可不一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_db03ce0e:

    # rb "It exists not in the wand, nor in the hat, but in the performance of the magician."
    rb "它不在魔杖里，也不在帽子里，而在魔术师的表演之中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_8a7b4c34:

    # e "It's... all performed?"
    e "这……全都是表演出来的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_3a15a51d:

    # rb "Yes! You can say it's all an illusion, one that feels real, even though you know it isn't."
    rb "是的！你可以说那全都是幻觉——明明知道它不是真的，却能让人感觉如此真实。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_baf2d452:

    # e "So, it's all just tricks? "
    e "所以，全都只是戏法？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_431acc00:

    # rb "In a way, yes. But it's also about the experience, the emotions it evokes."
    rb "从某种意义上说，是的。但这也关乎体验，以及它唤起的情感。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_ba59774b:

    # e "But that's not real? Even the carrots that came from your mouth?"
    e "可那不是真的吧？连从你嘴里冒出来的胡萝卜也是？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_5814bed8:

    # "The magician prods his arm into the void that is his face, and he swirls around as if nothing's in the hood."
    "魔术师把手臂探进脸所在的虚空，又在原地转了几圈，仿佛兜帽里什么都没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_5f74dfb4:

    # rb "If even you can't tell my tricks from reality, then what's the difference?"
    rb "如果连你都分不清我的戏法和现实，那又有什么区别呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Magic_c763be62:

    # rb "Oh, little tallie, enjoy the show. Or better off, become a part of mine if you will."
    rb "哦，小高个儿，尽情享受这场表演吧。或者更好——如果你愿意，就成为我的一部分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_3a6a64a1:

    # e "Ribba... your hood. Why is there nothing where your face should be?"
    e "里巴……你的兜帽。你的脸本该在的地方，为什么什么都没有？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_41e0a669:

    # "The rabbit goes still at once. One of his ears twitches, then lowers."
    "兔子立刻一动不动。它的一只耳朵抽动了一下，随后垂了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_1b568ea5:

    # rb "Ah... so master noticed it at last."
    rb "啊……原来主人终于注意到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_ba248026:

    # "He lifts a paw, hovering near the dark opening of the hood without quite touching it."
    "他抬起一只爪子，悬在兜帽的黑暗开口附近，却没有真正碰到它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_283dd4b7:

    # rb "This hood has held more of me than skin has for a long while now."
    rb "很长一段时间以来，这顶兜帽里容纳的我，比我的皮肤还要多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_b8bac011:

    # rb "I used it for the act, again and again, until the magic decided the face I showed was the truer one."
    rb "我一次又一次用它表演，直到魔法认定我展现出来的那张脸才是真实的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_56941765:

    # e "So there is really nothing there?"
    e "所以那里真的什么都没有？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_2584fb6a:

    # rb "There is. Just... not the kind of thing a proper little body ought to keep there."
    rb "是有的。只是……不是一个规矩的小身体该把它留在那里的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_23ab0577:

    # rb "If you need to know for certain, master... put your hand in and feel for yourself."
    rb "如果你非要确定，主人……就把手伸进去，亲自摸摸看吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_3eb9e867:

    # "He tilts his head forward and stays perfectly still for you."
    "他向前倾了倾脑袋，为你一动不动地停在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_e6fe90f9:

    # "Carefully, you slide your hand past the edge of the hood."
    "你小心翼翼地把手伸过兜帽的边缘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_255c8d57:

    # "There is cloth. Cool air. The faint prickling hum of magic through the lining."
    "有布料、凉爽的空气，还有魔法透过衬里的微弱刺痒嗡鸣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_15aa6341:

    # "At first there is only depthless emptiness, a void where his face should be."
    "起初，那里只有没有尽头的空虚——一片本该容纳他面孔的虚空。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_70a4a5c7:

    # "Then something in it notices your touch, and the hollowness gathers itself around your hand."
    "随后，其中有什么察觉到了你的触碰，那片空洞便聚拢到你的手周围。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_9a4bf432:

    # "It materializes as something impossibly soft, like warm velvet and down with no true shape beneath it."
    "它具现成某种柔软得不可思议的东西，像温暖的天鹅绒和绒羽，而下方没有真正的形状。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_88086009:

    # e "There's a void in there... and then it just... formed around my hand."
    e "那里是一片虚空……然后它就……在我的手周围成形了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_cc8248a0:

    # rb "Yes, yes. It knows when it's being touched. When I need one, the magic inside can materialize anything from it. When I don't... it stays hollow."
    rb "是的，是的。它知道自己什么时候被碰到了。需要某样东西时，里面的魔法可以从其中具现出任何东西。不需要时……它就保持空洞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_f819f896:

    # "He folds his paws together, with a expectant grin on his face."
    "他合拢双爪，脸上挂着期待的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_f5609025:

    # rb "If it troubles you, master, I'll pull the hood low and hide it for you at once."
    rb "如果这让你感到不适，主人，我马上就会把兜帽往下拉，替你把它藏起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Hood_82f00460:

    # e "No, it's alright, I don't mind it."
    e "不，没关系，我不介意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Learning_ede9f821:

    # e "What's the magic that you are performing, [ribba_title!t]?"
    e "你施展的是什么魔法，[ribba_title!t]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Learning_23a7e785:

    # rb "Magic, my performance you say?"
    rb "魔法？你说的是我的表演？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Learning_783f9903:

    # rb "A magician is nothing without his audience, and you know the secret behind a good magician?"
    rb "没有观众，魔术师什么也不是。你知道成为优秀魔术师的秘诀吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Learning_6a1dac74:

    # rb "The folks barely cares about the tricks. It's all about the showmanship, the flair!"
    rb "大家几乎不在乎戏法。关键在于表演功底和华丽的风采！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Learning_09ea6dd3:

    # e "A-alright, and what about the tricks?"
    e "好、好吧，那戏法呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Learning_99b48221:

    # rb "Tricks? Oh, those are just little things I picked up along the way."
    rb "戏法？哦，那些只是我一路上学会的一些小把戏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Learning_81489df3:

    # rb "A routine, you'd need to grab a few tricks from your handbook."
    rb "要编一套表演，你得从手册里挑几个戏法出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Learning_00cb6763:

    # rb "Make things vanish, make things appear, maybe move it, or penetrate it, they're all the same tricks you'd show in different ways."
    rb "让东西消失，让东西出现，也可以移动它，或让它穿透某物——这些都是同样的戏法，只是用不同的方式展示出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_Learning_cec28402:

    # rb "The real magic lies in how you present them, how you misdirect them from the real action behind the counter."
    rb "真正的魔法在于如何呈现，如何把他们的注意力从柜台后的真实动作上引开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_How_Doing_ae558720:

    # e "How are you doing, [ribba_title!t]?"
    e "你过得怎么样，[ribba_title!t]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_How_Doing_2776eaca:

    # rb "I'm alright, master. Just doing the show for you."
    rb "我没事，主人。只是为你表演而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_How_Doing_60c419d8:

    # rb "I'll keep smiling until you want me closer."
    rb "在你想让我靠近之前，我会一直保持微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_How_Doing_f833cab3:

    # rb "Quiet, mostly. Just getting ready for the show later tonight."
    rb "大多时候都很安静。只是为今晚晚些时候的表演做准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_How_Doing_fcc6fe61:

    # rb "If you want me before then, master, I'll be right here."
    rb "如果你在那之前就想要我，主人，我会一直在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_How_Doing_31f6aaee:

    # rb "Look at the crowd, little tallie. I'm performing!"
    rb "看看人群，小高个儿。我正在表演呢！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Ask_How_Doing_7f983b3b:

    # rb "Well, I'm just preparing for a few tricks later tonight. Catch me there if you want to see."
    rb "嗯，我只是在为今晚晚些时候准备几个戏法。想看的话，到时候来找我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Broken_Dialogue_e4cdaf8a:

    # "Ribba notices you immediately. He stops what he's doing and turns toward you with calm, undivided attention."
    "里巴立刻注意到了你。他停下手上的事，转过身来，平静而专注地望向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Broken_Dialogue_a4b08848:

    # "His posture is meek and obedient, but the old showman spark flickers back to life the moment he sees you."
    "他的姿态温顺而顺从，但看见你的那一刻，那个昔日表演家的火花又重新闪耀起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Broken_Dialogue_86faee71:

    # rb "Oh... master. There you are. Call for me, and I come."
    rb "哦……主人。你在这里。叫我一声，我就来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Broken_Dialogue_60e1a200:

    # "His voice is soft and submissive, but now warmed by the same theatrical sweetness he used to wear so easily."
    "他的声音轻柔而顺从，却又染上了那种他过去总能轻易流露出的戏剧性甜腻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Broken_Dialogue_6f39cbac:

    # rb "Ask whatever you like. I'll give it gladly."
    rb "你想要什么都行，我会心甘情愿地给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Broken_Dialogue_a9dde486:

    # e "...You really are different now, aren't you?"
    e "……你现在真的变了，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Broken_Dialogue_63e734d0:

    # "You study him carefully. The confident, teasing rabbit you knew is nowhere to be found."
    "你仔细打量着他。你所熟悉的那只自信又爱逗弄人的兔子，已经不见踪影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Broken_Dialogue_c610e92d:

    # rb "Yes. Different."
    rb "是的。变了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Broken_Dialogue_9cb271d8:

    # "He answers without hesitation, no defensiveness in him at all."
    "他毫不犹豫地回答，完全没有丝毫防备之意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Broken_Dialogue_da91921d:

    # rb "Softer. Quieter. Better at listening."
    rb "更温柔。更安静。也更善于倾听。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Broken_Dialogue_7b99c772:

    # rb "When you look at me, I feel full. When you speak, I want to kneel and hear every word."
    rb "你看着我，我便觉得心满意足；你一开口，我就想跪下来，听你说完每一个字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Broken_Dialogue_61958c64:

    # rb "I love the stage... but I love serving you more, master."
    rb "我喜欢舞台……但我更喜欢为你效劳，主人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Broken_Dialogue_5595d480:

    # "Ribba turns to you at once, quiet and attentive."
    "瑞巴立刻转向你，安静而专注。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ribba_Broken_Dialogue_de27ff27:

    # rb "Oh... master. Here again? Good."
    rb "哦……主人。你又来了？那太好了。"
